<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="LUK" style="id">- Toma Bible</book>
  <para style="h">Luke</para>
  <para style="toc1">Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi Nii Luke Sɛʋɛni</para>
  <para style="toc2">Luke</para>
  <para style="toc3">Luk</para>
  <para style="mt2">Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi</para>
  <para style="mt1">Nii Luke Sɛʋɛni</para>
  <para style="imt">Sɛʋɛi lɔɔzeizuʋɛ ma woo mɔungiti</para>
  <para style="ip">Luke ná-Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi ɠa ga Minazeɠe Niinɛi zu zɛʋɛ naanigɔiti gila, niiti ti Yesu Kilista ná-eteai zu vaiti suɠulazu. Ti ɠilagilagiti pɛ ti-laasei ka ga «Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi». Ti zɛʋɛʋɛ Yesu ná-saai ʋoluma, ti-zɛʋɛ nuiti ta ga: Matiyo, Maleke, Luke ta Zan. Luke sɛʋɛi ɠɛɛʋɛ, é lo Yesu ná-eteai ʋa, kɛlɛ é la ɠwɛni naa ʋa, é sɛʋɛi ɠɛɛʋɛ ɓalaa, é lo faiti ba, niiti Yesu ná-kaladopoiti ti kɛɛni ná-saai ta ná-buzeɠei ʋoluma, é ɠula saai ya, sɛʋɛi naa laaseigi ɠa ga Keelaiti Kɛɛwotiiti. Nu nɔpɛ ge la kwɛɛ yeeɠɛɠalai nii Luke ná-Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi zɛʋɛai ma, nu la ɓalaa kwɛɛ ʋɛ sɛʋɛai ná, kɛlɛ faaɠwɛ nu wolai bɔɔlɔzu zoloogɛ ma ga, tanisu sɛʋɛʋɛ kona ʋuulɔfela (70) ɠɛɠala leʋegai ma, Kilista zɔlɔɔga ʋoluma.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kɛɛ nui ɠa ga Luke, nii é ɠɛni ga ɗɔɠɔtɔlɔi. Ná-sɛʋɛ ɠɛ ʋelei ta zii wooi wo pelei, naa ɠa dɛɛzu ga é ɠɛni ga zunui nii kalagai. Luke ɠɛni pɔ ga é Yesu ná-eteai ma vai zɛʋɛ ga pagɔ, é faiti sɛʋɛ ʋelei ti leʋegai la, naa ɠa a kɛ nu ɠiligaa ti kulanuma zɔlɔɔ ná-sɛʋɛi ɠalagai ʋa (<char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 1:1-3">1:1-3</ref></char>). É la ɠɛni Zuifu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="COL 4:10-14">Kol 4:10-14</ref></char>), ta é sɛʋɛi ɠɛɛʋɛ ga kɛʋelei ta, nii a kɛ zɔiti ti la ga Zuifua, naati ti zoo gaaɠaazu. Naa ɠulaʋɛ kɛlɛma kɛʋelei zu, é Zuifuiti kɛɛ vaiti suɠulazu la (<char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 1:8">1:8</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Luke ná-Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi zu vaiti kulaʋɛ ga Matiyoni ta Maleke tɔnɔiti, tɔɔzei faa ɠilagiti nɔ ɠa ti ti zɛʋɛai, ti zɛʋɛ ʋeleiti kulaai ga ʋe. Ma Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔ saʋagɔiti saama Luke ɠa Zan Ɓatisete zɔlɔɔ fai wola zuviegai. Luke laaɓakpagɛ ɓalaa suvaayɛgi ma vai ma (<char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 3:3">3:3</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:4">11:4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:3-4">17:3-4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:34">23:34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:47">24:47</ref></char>), é laaɓakpa mɔnɔ GALA falii ma (<char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 3:21">3:21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:16">5:16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:12">6:12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:1-12">11:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:32">22:32</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="iot">Unsosuʋɛ</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Luke ná-Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi ma woo lɔɔzeigiti bogɛ, nii ɓalaa togai ma, é sɛʋɛi ɠɛ, é naa zuɠula (<char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 1:1-4">1:1-4</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">2. Naa ʋoluma, é Yesu zɔlɔɔ fai zuɠula ta ʋelei naa ɠɛʋele ɓɛtɛni la botii ɠɛɛ vai ma (<char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 1:5-4:13">1:5—4:13</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">3. Ná-Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔ wɔɔlɔzuʋɛ kpein (<char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 4:14-21:38">4:14—21:38</ref></char>), botii kpein Yesu kɛɛni, ta ná-laavɔɔ vaiti é ti ɠɛɛni, naa ʋɛɛ kalagiti ba é ti woni, miná ɠa Luke naati pɛ suɠulaai ná.</para>
  <para style="io1">4. Gaaɠwɛsu ɠaaɓela saʋagɔiti su (<char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 22:1-24:53">22:1—24:53</ref></char>) miná, Yesu zaa ʋelei, ta maaɠulu ʋelei, ta buzeɠe ʋelei, é ɠula saai ya, miná ɠa Luke wooɠaaɓelagai ná ga naati suɠula vai.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="LUK 1"/>
  <para style="s">Luke ná-sɛʋɛi ɠɛɛ ungi lɛɛ vai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 1:1"/>Nu mɔinmɔin ge tɔɔzeini ga ti naama vaiti sɛʋɛ, niiti ti ziaai gi zaama, <verse eid="LUK 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 1:2"/>eɠɛʋelei naati ti suɠulaai la gi ma, niiti ma vaiti kɛai ti ɠaazu, ti ga ma zeeleiti kaite tɔɔzeizu mɔunpa, ta ti ɠɛai ga GALA daawooi laazeeli nuiti. <verse eid="LUK 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 1:3"/>Naa ɠa é ba, nà ɓalaa gè kaaʋɛ ga faa ʋagɔ, kpèga ʋoluma ga faiti buuɓɛ ga pagɔ, niiti ti leʋegai, é zo tɔɔzeizu munu ma, ga gè ti zɛʋɛ è ma kɛʋele ʋagɔ zu, ɗɛi è ga nu wolai Teyofile. <verse eid="LUK 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 1:4"/>Gè naa ɠɛɛʋɛ, nii a kɛ è kwɛɛ ga kalagi niiti è ti zɔlɔɔgai, gaamai ʋe.<verse eid="LUK 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Zan Ɓatisete zɔlɔɔ fai laazeeli vai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 1:5"/>Zudé masagi Elɔde ná-siɛgi zu, zalaɠa ɠula nui ta ɠɛni ná, daaseigi ga Zakali, é ɠɛni Aɓiya ná-zalaɠa ɠula ɠuɠui zu. Anzai ɠɛni ga Aalɔn mavofodai zu nui ta, daaseigi ɠɛni ga Elizaɓɛte. <verse eid="LUK 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 1:6"/>Ti felegɔ ti ɠɛni ga telebo nu GALA gaazu, ti ɠoloni Maliɠii ná-deveiti ta ná-tɔgiti bɛ, peelalazu nɔpɛ ge la ɠɛni ti ʋa naa zu. <verse eid="LUK 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 1:7"/>Kɛlɛ doun la ɠɛni ti ʋɛ, tɔɔzei Elizaɓɛte ɠɛni ga doun zɔlɔɔtala anzanui, tama ti felegɔ pɛ ti wɔlɔzaɠani niina.<verse eid="LUK 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 1:8"/>Yeeta, Zakali ɠɛni botii ɠɛɛzu GALA gaazu, é zolooni ná-zalaɠa ɠula ɠuɠui nɔnɔ ma ɠui ma. <verse eid="LUK 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 1:9"/>Ti yeeloni ba ga kpakutoomai, ʋelei a ɗa ɠɛɛ la zalaɠa ɠula nuiti bɛ pɔlɔma, ga é li GALA sei ʋɛlɛi wu, é ansansegiti gala. <verse eid="LUK 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 1:10"/>Ansansegi ɠala ziɛgi zu, bɛbɛi pɛ ge ɠɛni eteaʋɛ, ti ɗa GALA fali.<verse eid="LUK 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 1:11"/>Maliɠii ná-geezuɠeelai gila ge ɠulani kɛlɛma Zakali ʋɛ, é lo ansansegiti ma zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ yeezazu ʋelei. <verse eid="LUK 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 1:12"/>Zakali kaai ma, ziiɠulani ba, dualuagi lɔɔni su. <verse eid="LUK 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 1:13"/>Kɛlɛ geezuɠeelai ɠɛni ma: «Mina lua, Zakali, mazɔlɔɔ GALA ge ɗa-ƓALA falii ɠaaʋotega. È-anzai Elizaɓɛte ɠa doun zunu zɔlɔɔ è ʋɛ. Ɗa daasei pɛɛ ga Zan. <verse eid="LUK 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 1:14"/>È ɠoozu ɠa nɛ, è ɠɔkɔ ná-faa zu, nu mɔinmɔin ka ɠoozunɛ sɔlɔɔ fai zu. <verse eid="LUK 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 1:15"/>Toɠa ɠɛ ga nu wola Maliɠii ɠaazu. É la dɔɔ ɓɔlea, ɓaa gaazulati gani nɔpɛ. Toɠa yɛ dee ɠoozu, daave ga Zɛnvu Ɲadegai. <verse eid="LUK 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 1:16"/>Toɠa ʋa ʋolu ga Izilayɛle nui ma mɔinmɔin ta-ƓALAGI Maliɠii ʋɔ. <verse eid="LUK 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 1:17"/>Toɠa ziɛzu Maliɠii luɠɔ ga GALA goo wo nui Eli ná-zɛnvui ta ná-zɛbɛi, nii a kɛ é doun kɛɛɠɛiti zɔɠɔzuɓɛtɛ ta ti-lointi, é kololala nuiti falibo, ti ziɛ ga telebo nuiti ta-ɠisiɛi, é nuɓusɛiti kɛʋele ɓɛtɛ ɠana Maliɠii ʋɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 1:18"/>Kɛlɛ Zakali geezuɠeelai ɠaazaɠani, é ɠɛ ma: «Lee ɠa nà kwɛɛ ba ga gaama ɠana? Tɔɔzei gá ànzai gi wɔlɔzaɠaga.» <verse eid="LUK 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 1:19"/>Geezuɠeelai gooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «Nà ɠa gè ga Gaɓiliyɛle. Nà loni GALA gaazu. É tèʋegɛ ga gè niima woo niinɛ ʋagɔi wo è ma. <verse eid="LUK 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 1:20"/>Kɛlɛ tɛi è la laani dàawooiti da, niiti ti laa ʋaazu zeelizu ta-yeeɠɛɠalaiti su, ɗa ɠɛɛzu ga ɓoɓoi, è la zooga ɓɔɛzu, eyɛsu niima vaiti ti laazeeli.»<verse eid="LUK 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 1:21"/>Naama ziɛgi zu, nuɓusɛiti ti ɠɛni Zakali maaɓɔunsu, ta ti laavɔɔni ga dɛbi fai GALA sei ʋɛlɛi wu. <verse eid="LUK 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 1:22"/>Kulaai ma, é la ɠɛni zoosu ɓɔɛzu ti ʋɔ. Ti gaaɠaani ga é kulakɛlɛma ɠaaʋɛ GALA sei ʋɛlɛi wu. É yɛni ɓoɓoyai zu, é ɗa ɓɔɛ ti ʋɔ ga yeeiti.<verse eid="LUK 1:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 1:23"/>Yeeɠɛɠalai nii Zakali maanɛɛni ga é kɛ botii zu GALA sei ʋɛlɛi wu, naa ɓegai ma, é ɠaleni ma ná-pɛlɛi wu. <verse eid="LUK 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 1:24"/>Naa ʋoluma anzai Elizaɓɛte kogi zeɠeni. É kɛɛni ga alu dɔɔlugɔ, é ɗa lɔɔɠu. É ɠɛni ɠɛɛzu ma: <verse eid="LUK 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 1:25"/>«Wɛlɛ nii ʋa, Maliɠii kɛa bɛ̀, é vaa bu, é unfegi ɠula gàazu nuiti gaazu.»<verse eid="LUK 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu zɔlɔɔ fai laazeeli vai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 1:26"/>Alugi lɔzitasiɛi ma, GALA ge geezuɠeelai Gaɓiliyɛle leʋeni Galilé laa wolai ta zu, nii daa ga Nazalɛte, <verse eid="LUK 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 1:27"/>anzalopo ɓeai ta ma, nii é la dɛ zunu vaa ɠwɛɛ. Maazoga ɠɛni de zunui ta ʋɛ, nii daaseigi ɠɛni ga Zozɛfe, é ɠɛni ga Davide mavofodai ta. Anzalopoi laaseigi ɠɛni ga Mali. <verse eid="LUK 1:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 1:28"/>Geezuɠeelai lɛɛni ná-pɛlɛi wu, é ɠɛ ma: «Ɗa ná, ɗɛi è zaala zɔlɔɔgai GALA gaazu. Maliɠii ɠa è ʋa.»<verse eid="LUK 1:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 1:29"/>Naama wooi Mali yiiɠulani ba, é ɗa ɓɔɠɔ ɠaazaɠa ga niima laalimai ʋoluʋɛ ɠa ga lee. <verse eid="LUK 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 1:30"/>Geezuɠeelai ɠɛni ma: «Mina lua, Mali, tɔɔzei è zaala zɔlɔɔga GALA zea. <verse eid="LUK 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 1:31"/>Wɛlɛ, ɗa ʋaazu koseɠezu, è doun zunu zɔlɔɔ. Ɗa daaseigi ʋɛɛ ga Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 1:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 1:32"/>Toɠa wɔɔlɔ, é ɗa loli ga GALAGI nii é Anii-Pɛ-Unda, naa ná-doun zunui. Maliɠii GALA ka kɛ ga masagi, eɠɛʋelei mɛmɛwola Davide ɠɛni la. <verse eid="LUK 1:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 1:33"/>Toɠa masadai ɠɛ eyɛsu ɠɔ Zakɔɓe mavofodaiti unda, ná-masadai la ɓega.»<verse eid="LUK 1:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 1:34"/>Mali ɠɛni geezuɠeelai ma: «Naa ɠa zoo é ɠɛ ɠale, tɔɔzei gè la dɛ zunu vaa ɠwɛɛ?» <verse eid="LUK 1:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 1:35"/>Geezuɠeelai gooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «Zɛnvu Ɲadegai ɠa yei è ma, GALA nii é Anii-Pɛ-Unda, naa ná-zɛbɛi ɠa ʋɛɛ è ma eɠɛ niini. Naa ɠa é ba, doun ɲadegai, nii è ʋaazu sɔlɔɔsu, daasei ka ɠɛ ga GALA Doun Zunui. <verse eid="LUK 1:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 1:36"/>Ɗa-wolodamai Elizaɓɛte ɓalaa ge zunu loun ɠoseɠea pɔlɔzaɠa siɛgi zu. Nii ti ɠɛa ɠɛɛzu ma doun zɔlɔɔtala anzanui, ná-alugi lɔzitasiɛi ɠa é su. <verse eid="LUK 1:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 1:37"/>Mazɔlɔɔ faa nɔpɛ ge la ɓaani GALA zea.» <verse eid="LUK 1:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 1:38"/>Mali ɠɛni ma: «Nà ga Maliɠii ná-botiɠɛ nu. Naa ɠɛ bɛ̀ faan, nii è bogai!» Geezuɠeelai zeɠeni koba.<verse eid="LUK 1:38"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mali laali vai Elizaɓɛte ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 1:39"/>Ma yeeɠɛɠalai nɔ zu, Mali wuzeɠeni, é li ga suvilɛ gize yooi zu, Zuda laai ta zu. <verse eid="LUK 1:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 1:40"/>É lɛɛni Zakali ná-pɛlɛi wu, é Elizaɓɛte luʋɔ. <verse eid="LUK 1:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 1:41"/>Elizaɓɛte Mali ná-tuʋɔ gooi mɛnigai ma, doin ɲiikpini koozu. Elizaɓɛte laaveni ga Zɛnvu Ɲadegai. <verse eid="LUK 1:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 1:42"/>É wooɠulani, é ɗa ɠɛ ma: «Tuya ɠa è ma, é leʋe anzanui pɛ ba, tuya ɠa è ɠoozu loin ɓalaa ma. <verse eid="LUK 1:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 1:43"/>Gè niima undaanɛɛi zɔlɔɔgɛ ɠale, ga Màliɠii dee ʋa laaliizu mà? <verse eid="LUK 1:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 1:44"/>È kaa, ɗa-luʋɔ gooi looʋɛ nɔ feya gòizu, doin ɲiikpigɛ kòozu ga koozunɛɛi. <verse eid="LUK 1:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 1:45"/>Undaanɛ nu ɠa ga ɗe, ɗɛi è ɠidaaleʋeai ga nii Maliɠii bogai è ma, daa ɠa zeeli.»<verse eid="LUK 1:45"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mali ná-guyei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 1:46"/>Mali ɠɛni ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:46">«Zɛ̀nvui ɠa Maliɠii wɔɔlɔzu,<verse eid="LUK 1:46"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 1:47"/>ta zìimaʋɛ laavegɛ ga koozunɛɛi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:47">Kìzo Nui GALA bɛ,<verse eid="LUK 1:47"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 1:48"/>mazɔlɔɔ é wɛlɛa ná-botiɠɛ anzanui maawɔinzuʋɛ ʋa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:48">Mazɔlɔɔ za ʋoluma, nuɓusɛi pɛ ka ɠɛ mà undaanɛ anzanui.<verse eid="LUK 1:48"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 1:49"/>Mazɔlɔɔ Zɛbɛi-Pɛ-Maliɠii faa wolaiti kɛɛʋɛ bɛ̀,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:49">daaseigi ɲadegɛ.<verse eid="LUK 1:49"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 1:50"/>Ná-gaazumaawɔinɠai ɠa ná yeeɠɛɠalai ɠilagilagi pɛ su,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:50">naama nuiti bɛ, niiti ti luazu gaazu ʋa.<verse eid="LUK 1:50"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 1:51"/>É faa wolaiti kɛa ga ná-zɛbɛsu yeei,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:51">é naama nuiti suvazaga, niiti waso kisiɛ ɠɛni ti ʋɛ.<verse eid="LUK 1:51"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 1:52"/>É zɛbɛsu nuiti piliga bu, é ti volo ta-masa kpɔkpɔgiti ga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:52">é zɛba é maawɔin nuiti unbuzeɠe.<verse eid="LUK 1:52"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 1:53"/>É faaɓɔɠɔ wolaiti kɛa pulu nuiti bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:53">é naavolo nuiti zeaɲakai ɠaaɠale ma.<verse eid="LUK 1:53"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 1:54"/>É ɓɔga ná-botiɠɛ nui Izilayɛle ʋa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:54">é la yeemani ná-gaazumaawɔinɠai ma,<verse eid="LUK 1:54"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 1:55"/>Abalaame ta mavofodaiti bɛ yeenɔpɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:55">eɠɛʋelei nɔ é minazeɠeni la ade-mɛmɛwolani bɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 1:55"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 1:56"/>Mali yɛni Elizaɓɛte ɠoba alu saʋagɔ laawu. Naa ʋoluma é ɠaleni ma ná-taazu.<verse eid="LUK 1:56"/></para>
  <para style="s">Zan Ɓatisete zɔlɔɔ fai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 1:57"/>Elizaɓɛte ná-doun zɔlɔɔ siɛgi zeeliai ma, é laayeini ga zunu loun. <verse eid="LUK 1:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 1:58"/>Seiɲɔɠɔiti ta ná-nuiti ti mɛnigai ma ga Maliɠii Elizaɓɛte maawɔinɠaaʋɛ, ti pɛ ti ɠoozunɛɛni ta tɔun. <verse eid="LUK 1:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 1:59"/>Foloi lɔsaʋasiɛi, ti ʋaani doungoi lati fai ma pɛlɛʋolu. Ti ɠɛni pɔ ga ti kɛɛɠɛ laaseigi ʋɛɛ ba, ti ɠɛ ma Zakali. <verse eid="LUK 1:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 1:60"/>Kɛlɛ dee ɠɛni ti ma: «Ɓa, daasei ka ɠɛɛzu ga Zan.» <verse eid="LUK 1:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 1:61"/>Ti ɠɛni ma: «Nu nɔpɛ ge la ɗa-wolodai zu, nii daasei ge ga Zan.» <verse eid="LUK 1:61"/><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 1:62"/>Ti ɠɛni poogiti kɛɛzu doun kɛɛɠɛi ma, nii a kɛ ti kwɛɛ daaseigi, nii é pɔ ga ti pɛɛ ba. <verse eid="LUK 1:62"/><verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 1:63"/>É sɛʋɛ ɠɛɛ ɠokologi ta maalolini, é sɛʋɛi ɠɛ ma, é ɠɛ ma: «Daasei ka ga Zan.» Ti pɛ ti laavɔɔni. <verse eid="LUK 1:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 1:64"/>Naama ziɛgi zu nɔ, daaʋɛ laalaoni, nɛgi vie, é tɔɔzei ga ɓɔɛa, é ɗa GALA maamusɛ. <verse eid="LUK 1:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 1:65"/>Dualuagi lɔɔni seiɲɔɠɔiti pɛ su. Naama vaiti nɔ ɠa ti ɠɛni ga yɛpɛ wooi Zudé ɠize yooi zu ná pɛ. <verse eid="LUK 1:65"/><verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 1:66"/>Nu nɔpɛ a la niima wooi mɛnina, é ɓena tɔɔzei ga ɠisiaa su, ma nu ɗa ɓɔɠɔ ɠaazaɠa ga: «Doungoi nuu ɠa ʋaazu ɠɛɛzu ga nui ma ɓɛgele?» Tɔɔzei gaamazu Maliɠii ná-zɛbɛi ɠɛni ba.<verse eid="LUK 1:66"/></para>
  <para style="s">Zakali ná-guyei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 1:67"/>Zɛnvu Ɲadegai kɛɛɠɛ laaveni, Zakali ya, é tɔɔzei ga é ɗa GALA gooi wo, é ɗa ɠɛ ma:<verse eid="LUK 1:67"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 1:68"/>«Mamagi ɠa Maliɠii ʋɛ, Izilayɛle ná-GALAGI,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:68">mazɔlɔɔ é wɛlɛa ná-nuɓusɛiti ma, é ti unmɔɔ.<verse eid="LUK 1:68"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 1:69"/>Ná-botiɠɛ nui Davide mavofodaiti saama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:69">é kizo nu wuzeɠea ade ʋɛ, nii daavegai ga zɛbɛi.<verse eid="LUK 1:69"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 1:70"/>É ná-minazeɠegi laazeelia, nii é puuni kaite wɔlɔwɔlɔ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:70">daawoo wo nu ɲadegaiti da, ti bo ga:<verse eid="LUK 1:70"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 1:71"/>Toɠa ade ɠizo, é ade ɠula ade zili nuiti zea,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:71">ta niiti kpein ti ade wɔinzeɠezu.<verse eid="LUK 1:71"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="LUK 1:72"/>Ná-gaazumaawɔinɠai ɠana é kɛɛzu ade-mɛmɛwolani bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:72">é zoloo ná-minazeɠe ɲadegai ma.<verse eid="LUK 1:72"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="LUK 1:73"/>Minazeɠe konai nii é boni ade-mɛmɛwola Abalaame ʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:73">é naa zu vai ɠɛa ade ʋɛ,<verse eid="LUK 1:73"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="LUK 1:74"/>ga kpega ʋoluma ga ade unmɔɔ, é ade ɠula ade zili nuiti zea,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:74">dualua ge mina ɠɛ ade ʋa, ade dɛbi,<verse eid="LUK 1:74"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="75" style="v" sid="LUK 1:75"/>ade ɠɛ gaazu ga nu ɲadegaiti ta telebo nuiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:75">ade-zii ma voloi pɛ su.<verse eid="LUK 1:75"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="76" style="v" sid="LUK 1:76"/>Ɗa ma, ɗɛi è ga dòin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:76">è-laasei ka ɠɛ ga GALA nii é Anii-Pɛ-Unda, naa laawoo wo nui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:76">Mazɔlɔɔ ɗa ɠa è ʋaazu ziɛzu Maliɠii luɠɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:76">è ná-peleiti suɓɛtɛ bɛ.<verse eid="LUK 1:76"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="77" style="v" sid="LUK 1:77"/>Nii a kɛ, è dɛɛ ga ná-nuɓusɛiti ga GALA ka ti ɠizosu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:77">é ti zuvaayɛ ga ta-ɠotoiti.<verse eid="LUK 1:77"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="LUK 1:78"/>Naa ɠa ɠulazu ada-ƓALAGI ná-gaazumaawɔinɠaa wolai zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:78">naa maaʋele ɠa foloi wuzeɠezu la geezuʋɛ, é ʋa é tuyai loo ade ʋɛ.<verse eid="LUK 1:78"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="79" style="v" sid="LUK 1:79"/>Nii a kɛ é volo naati bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:79">niiti ti zeini kpidii zu ta saai ma niinigi wu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:79">ga é lo ade luɠɔ ziilɛi pelei ma.»<verse eid="LUK 1:79"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="80" style="v" sid="LUK 1:80"/>Doungoi ɠɛni wɔɔlɔzu, ta ɗa ʋɛɛ sɛbɛi ʋa zɛnvui zu. Naa ʋoluma, é zeini teʋebai zu, eyɛsu naama voloi zeeli, yeei é ɠulani la kɛlɛma Izilayɛle nuiti bɛ.<verse eid="LUK 1:80"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="LUK 2"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu zɔlɔɔ fai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 1:18-25">Matiyo 1:18-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 2:1"/>Naama ziɛgi zu, masagi Sezaal Oguste devei veeni ga kɛni daasei sɛʋɛi ɠɛ ná-masadai zu ná pɛ. <verse eid="LUK 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 2:2"/>Daasei sɛʋɛ mɔungi ɠɛni ga naa, nii é ɠɛɛni. Naama ziɛgi zu Kiliniyuse ɠa é ɠɛni ga Siili you ɠundiɠii. <verse eid="LUK 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 2:3"/>Ɛsɛ gilagilagi pɛ ge ɠɛni liizu daaseigi zɛʋɛ vai ma, tɔ ɓɔɠɔi sɔlɔɔ taai zu.<verse eid="LUK 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 2:4"/>Zozɛfe ɓalaa zeɠeni Nazalɛte taazuʋɛ, Galilé yooi zu, é lɛ Zudé yooi zu, Davide ná-taazuʋɛ, ʋɛ ná laa ga Ɓɛteleyɛme, mazɔlɔɔ é ɠɛni ga Davide mavofodai ta, ta ná-pɛlɛ wu nui ta, <verse eid="LUK 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 2:5"/>nii a kɛ ti-laaseigi zɛʋɛ ta Mali, nii maazoga ɠɛni de bɛ, kogi ma. <verse eid="LUK 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 2:6"/>Siɛgi zu ti ɠɛni ná la, naa ná-doun zɔlɔɔ yeeɠɛɠalai zeelini. <verse eid="LUK 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 2:7"/>É ná-doun zunu mɔungi zɔlɔɔni. É maaveleveleni, é da toganiiti daami aniɲakai ta zu, mazɔlɔɔ ti la ɠɛni laazu zɔlɔɔni wɛɛn laazuʋɛ ʋɛlɛi wu.<verse eid="LUK 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Baala makɛ nuiti ta geezuɠeelaiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 2:8"/>Baala makɛ nuiti ti ɠɛni naama yooi nɔ zu, ti ɠɛni dɔɓɔi zu, ti ɗa ta-logani ɓulugiti makɛ kpidii. <verse eid="LUK 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 2:9"/>Maliɠii ná-geezuɠeelai gila ge ɠulani ti ʋɛ kɛlɛma. Maliɠii ná-lɛbiyai voloni ti-maaɠoolii zu. Ti wola luani. <verse eid="LUK 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 2:10"/>Kɛlɛ geezuɠeelai ɠɛni ti ma: «À mina lua, mazɔlɔɔ woo niinɛ ʋagɔ ɠa gè daazeelizu wo ma, nii é ʋaazu ɠɛɛzu ga nuɓusɛiti pɛ ta-ɠoozunɛ vaa: <verse eid="LUK 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 2:11"/>Tɔɔzei za Davide ná-taazuʋɛ, Kizo Nui zɔlɔɔga wo ʋɛ, nii é ga Kilista, Maliɠii. <verse eid="LUK 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 2:12"/>Nii é ɠɛɛzu ga poogi wo ʋɛ, naa ɠa ga: Wa doun zɔlɔɔga niinɛi ɠaazu, maavelevelegai, é laani toganiiti daami aniɲakai ta zu.»<verse eid="LUK 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 2:13"/>Gaamago nɔ, geezuɠeela ɓulugi ʋaani, é ɓɔ geezuɠeelai ʋa, ti ɗa GALA maamusɛ, ti ɗa ɠɛ ma:<verse eid="LUK 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 2:14"/>«Lɛbiyai ɠa GALA bɛ geeɠɔlɔgi unga munu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 2:14">ziilɛigi ɠɛ zooi ma, nɛɛbɛ nuiti bɛ!»<verse eid="LUK 2:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Baala makɛ nuiti ti lii vai Ɓɛteleyɛme</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 2:15"/>Geezuɠeelaiti ti zeɠeai ma ti ɠoba, ti ɠale ma geeɠɔlɔgi zu, baala makɛ nuiti ti ɠɛni ɓɔɠɔ ma: «Ade li Ɓɛteleyɛme, ade naama vai ɠa, nii kɛai, nii Maliɠii dɛai ga adeye.»<verse eid="LUK 2:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 2:16"/>Ti liini ga gaazuvilɛ, ti Mali ta Zozɛfe ɠa, naa ʋɛɛ doun ɲɛgi ʋa, é laani toganiiti daami aniɲakai ta zu. <verse eid="LUK 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 2:17"/>Ti kaai ma, ti naa kpein suɠulani, nii é woni ti ma, é ʋilɛ doungoi ʋa. <verse eid="LUK 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 2:18"/>Zɔiti kpein ti ɠɛni ti-wooi mɛnisu, naati pɛ ti laavɔɔni ga naama wooiti, nii baala makɛ nuiti ti ɠɛni bosu ti ma. <verse eid="LUK 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 2:19"/>Kɛlɛ Mali mu ge ɠɛni ti pɛ makɛsu yiimaʋɛ, é ɗa ɠisiɛ su ga gola. <verse eid="LUK 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 2:20"/>Baala makɛ nuiti ti ɠaleni ma, ti ɗa GALA dɛbi, ti ɗa maamusɛ, mazɔlɔɔ nii ti mɛnini, ti ka, naa zolooni naa ma, nii é woni ti ma.<verse eid="LUK 2:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ɠalivaa vai GALA ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 2:21"/>Doungoi lati yee zeeliai ma pɛlɛʋolu, foloi lɔsaʋasiɛi, ti daasei pɛɛni ga Yesu, daaseigi nii geezuɠeelai pɛɛni ba, aisa dee ʋa kogi zeɠe.<verse eid="LUK 2:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 2:22"/>Yeeɠɛɠalai zeeliai ma ga ti ɓɔɠɔ ɲade, eɠɛʋelei sɛʋɛai la Moize ná-tɔgi zu, ti liini ga doungoi Zeluzalɛme ga ti kaliva Maliɠii ma. <verse eid="LUK 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 2:23"/>Mazɔlɔɔ sɛʋɛʋɛ Maliɠii ná-tɔgi zu ga: «Doun zunu mɔungi kpein ka ve Maliɠii ʋɛ.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 13:2">Ɛgz 13:2</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 13:12">12</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 13:15">15</ref></char>.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 2:24"/>Ti zalaɠai ɓalaa kulani, eɠɛʋelei sɛʋɛai la Maliɠii ná-tɔgi zu ga: «kpumago felegɔ, ɓaa poopo kpokpa felegɔ.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="LEV 12:8">Lev 12:8</ref></char>.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 2:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Simiyɔn GALA mama fai Yesu ná-faa zu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 2:25"/>Zunui ta ɠɛni Zeluzalɛme, daa ga Simiyɔn. É ɠɛni ga telebo nu, é ɗa lua GALA gaazu ʋa, é ɠɛni Izilayɛle ɠaanɛɛnɛ vai maaɓɔunsu kitogi zu. Zɛnvu Ɲadegai ɠɛni ba. <verse eid="LUK 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 2:26"/>Zɛnvu Ɲadegai dɛɛni la ga é la zaa, kɛni a Kilista ɠaana, nii Maliɠii teʋegai. <verse eid="LUK 2:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 2:27"/>Zɛnvu Ɲadegai loni tuɠɔ, é li GALA sei ʋɛlɛi wu. Siɛgi zu Yesu zɔlɔɔ nuiti ti ʋaani la ga doun ɲɛgi ga ti naa ɠɛ bɛ, nii tɔgi bogai, <verse eid="LUK 2:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 2:28"/>Simiyɔn daani yeezu, é GALA maamusɛ, é ɠɛ ma:<verse eid="LUK 2:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 2:29"/>«Màliɠii, ɗa-minazeɠegi laazeelia niina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 2:29">ɗa-wotiɠɛ nui yɛ ná niina, é li ziilɛigi zu.<verse eid="LUK 2:29"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 2:30"/>Mazɔlɔɔ gàazuʋɛ kizogi ɠaa, nii è teʋegai,<verse eid="LUK 2:30"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 2:31"/>nii è kɛʋele ɓɛtɛai ga nuɓusɛiti pɛ ti ka.<verse eid="LUK 2:31"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 2:32"/>Tɔ ɠa é ga wozakalagi, é faaɠaaɠai ve zii ɠiligiti bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 2:32">é ɠɛ ga lɛbiyai ɗa-nuɓusɛiti bɛ, Izilayɛle nuiti.»<verse eid="LUK 2:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 2:33"/>Deeni ta kɛɛɠɛ ti laavɔɔni ga naa, nii é ɠɛni wosu ná-faa zu. <verse eid="LUK 2:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 2:34"/>Simiyɔn tuya looni ti ʋɛ, é ɠɛ doun dee Mali ma: «Suɠwɛɛ ga doungoi nii leʋegɛ ga é ɠɛ ga Izilayɛle nui ma mɔinmɔin too zaɓui, ɓaa tanigaa wuzeɠe zaɓui. Toɠa ɠɛ ga poogi nii nuiti ta sakpe, <verse eid="LUK 2:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 2:35"/>koozu ɠisiɛi niiti ti lɔɔɠuai nui ma mɔinmɔin ziima, naa ɠa ɠula kɛlɛma. Ɗa ɓɔɠɔi mu, è-yii ɠa ɠɛ eɠɛ boɠa zɔkpɔi a baaɓota.»<verse eid="LUK 2:35"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ane GALA mama fai Yesu ná-faa zu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 2:36"/>GALA goo wo anzanui ta ɓalaa ɠɛni ná, daa ga Ane, é ɠɛni ga Fanuwɛle ná-doun anzanui, Asɛɛl wolodamai ta ɠɛni de. É wɔlɔzaɠani niina, kona dɔfelai ʋoluma nii ti kɛɛni ʋa ta sinigi ná-anzalopo ziɛgi zu. <verse eid="LUK 2:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 2:37"/>É yɛni poanzayai zu, é kona ʋuulɔsaʋa maazu naanigɔ (84) zɔlɔɔ. É la ɠɛni zeɠezu pɛ GALA sei ʋɛlɛi wu, kpidi ʋɛɛ folo ʋa é ɠɛni GALA dɛbizu ga zu sogai ta GALA faliiti. <verse eid="LUK 2:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 2:38"/>Tɔ ɓalaa é ʋaani naama yeeɠɛɠalai nɔ zu, é tɔɔzei ga GALA maamusɛa, ta é ɗa doungoi ná-fai laazeeli naama nuiti pɛ ma, niiti ti ɠɛni Zeluzalɛme ná-unmɔɔgi maaɓɔunsu kitogi zu.<verse eid="LUK 2:38"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ti ɠalema vai Nazalɛte</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 2:39"/>Yesu zɔlɔɔ nuiti kpegai ma ga Maliɠii ná-tɔgi ná-devei zu vaiti pɛ kɛ, ti ɠaleni ma Galilé yooi zu, ta-laazuʋɛ Nazalɛte. <verse eid="LUK 2:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 2:40"/>Doungoi ɠɛni wɔɔlɔzu, sɛbɛi ɗa ɓaɠo. Daaveni ga ɠimalai, GALA ná-zaalai ɠɛ ma.<verse eid="LUK 2:40"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ɠɛɛ vai GALA sei ʋɛlɛi wu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 2:41"/>Kona-o-kona Yesu zɔlɔɔ nuiti ti ɠɛni liizu Zeluzalɛme <char style="w" lemma="Pakegi">Pake</char> fɛtii zu. <verse eid="LUK 2:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 2:42"/>É kona puugɔ maazu felegɔi (12) zɔlɔɔgai ma, ti pɛ ti liini, eɠɛʋelei nɔ fɛtii ma vai ɠɛni ɠɛɛzu la pɔlɔma. <verse eid="LUK 2:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 2:43"/>Fɛti voloiti kpegai ma, ti pele zoni ga ti ɠale ma, kɛlɛ zunu loungoi Yesu yɛni Zeluzalɛme, sɔlɔɔ nuiti ti la looni ga naa. <verse eid="LUK 2:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 2:44"/>Ti ɠɛni ɠisiɛzu ga toɠa ti-ziɛɲɔɠɔiti polu, ti folo ɠila siɛ woni, ti ɗa gaiziɛ ta-nuiti ta ti-ɠaazuɠwɛɛgiti saama. <verse eid="LUK 2:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 2:45"/>Kɛlɛ ti la ɠɛni kaani, eyɛsu ti ɠale ma ʋolu Zeluzalɛme, ti ɗa gaiziɛ. <verse eid="LUK 2:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 2:46"/>Foloi zaʋasiɛi ti kaani GALA sei ʋɛlɛi wu, é zeini kalamɔinti saama, é ɗa woilo ti-woo ma, é ɗa ti ɠaazaɠa. <verse eid="LUK 2:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 2:47"/>Zɔiti pɛ ti ɠɛni goomɛnisu, ti laavɔɔni ga ná-keleɠelegi, ta gooɠaaʋotegi niiti é ɠɛni ti veezu.<verse eid="LUK 2:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 2:48"/>Sɔlɔɔ nuiti ti kaai ma, ti laavɔɔni ga gola, dee ɠɛ ma: «Dòun, lee ɠa è kɛai ga giye? Gi yii ɠɛa zoolɛzu, gá è-ɠɛɛ gi ɗa è ɠaiziɛ.» <verse eid="LUK 2:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 2:49"/>É ɠɛni ti ma: «Lee vaa zu wo ɠɛa gàiziɛzu? Wo la suɠwɛɛni ɓaa ga kɛni gè ɠɛ Kɛ̀ɛ ná-pɛlɛi wu?» <verse eid="LUK 2:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 2:50"/>Kɛlɛ ti la ɠɛni ná-kpɔɛi naa ɠaaɠaani, nii é ɠɛni bosu ti ma.<verse eid="LUK 2:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 2:51"/>É ʋilɛni ti ʋolu, ti yei, ti li Nazalɛte. É ɠoloni ti ʋɛ. Dee ɠɛni naama vaiti kpein makɛsu ɠisu. <verse eid="LUK 2:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 2:52"/>Yesu ɠɛni wɔɔlɔzu, é ɗa li luɠɔ ɠimalai zu, ná-fai ɗa li ga nɛa GALA ta nuiti bɛ.<verse eid="LUK 2:52"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="LUK 3"/>
  <para style="s">GALA keelai Zan Ɓatisete</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Matiyo 3:1-12</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Maleke 1:1-8</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Zan 1:19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 3:1"/>Tiɓɛɛl Sezaal ná-masadai ma ɠona puugɔ maazu lɔɔlugɔi (15) ma, siɛgi zu Pɔnse Pilate ɠɛni zeini la Zudé unda, Elɔde ɠɛni ga Galilé masagi, kɛɛɠɛloin Filipe ɗa masadai ɠɛ Itulé ta Talakɔnite unda, Lisaniyase ga Aɓilɛne masagi, <verse eid="LUK 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 3:2"/>Ane ta Kayife ti ɠɛni ga zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠi wolaiti. Naama ziɛgi nɔ zu, GALA ge ɓɔɛni Zakali ná-doun zunui Zan ʋɔ teʋebai zu. <verse eid="LUK 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 3:3"/>É liini Zuludɛn maaɠoolii zu ná pɛ, é ɗa GALA daawooi laazeeli, é ɗa ɠɛ ma: «À wo-ziɛ ʋelei maavalibo, wo ɓatize, naa ɠa a kɛ wo zuvaayɛ ga wa-ɠotoiti.» <verse eid="LUK 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 3:4"/>Ʋele ɠana naama wooi laazeelini la, nii sɛʋɛai GALA goo wo nui Ezayi ná-sɛʋɛi zu ga:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:4">«Nui ta ɠa ɓainsu teʋebai zu, é ɗa ɠɛ ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:4">‹À Maliɠii ná-pelei ɓɛtɛ bɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:4">À ná-pele goiti sɔle.<verse eid="LUK 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 3:5"/>Pɛtugiti pɛ daa ɠa ʋaazu vesu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:5">gize ɠaaɠoozagiti ta gize goiti pɛ ta ɠolo, ti ɠaa ɠɛ sɔli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:5">pele zuɓilikpiligiti ta ʋaazu zɔlesu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:5">pele zuɠuɠuza kuɠuzagiti maa ɠa loun seinsein.<verse eid="LUK 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 3:6"/>Naazu ɛsɛ pɛ ka kizogi ʋɛtɛ, nii GALA ge feezu.›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:4-6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 40:3-5">Eza 40:3-5</ref></char> bogɛ é zoloo Gɛlɛke woo zɛʋɛ wɔlɔmai ma.</char></note>»<verse eid="LUK 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 3:7"/>Bɛbɛ wolai nii é ɠɛni ʋaazu Zan ʋɔ bɛ ɓatize fai ma, é ɠɛni ɠɛɛzu ti ma: «Pɛɛɠaali zuwuzuiti! Ɓɛ ɠa é wo ɠalaga ga wo ʋela GALA ná-ziiɠaawanai ʋa, é ʋaazu? <verse eid="LUK 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 3:8"/>À kɛɛwotiiti kɛ, niiti ti dɛɛzu ga wo wo-ziɛ ʋelei maavaliboga. À mina bo yiimaʋɛ ga: ‹Ada ga Abalaame mavofodaiti.› Mazɔlɔɔ gè bo wo ma, zobogi ɠa GALA bɛ, é kɔtui niiti falibo ga Abalaame mavofodaiti. <verse eid="LUK 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 3:9"/>Zoovɛi laa ɠana vɔlɔ gulu zapeiti ba. Gulu nɔpɛ, é la gwaa ʋagɔ wosu, naa ɠa leʋe ga, é ʋili abui zu.»<verse eid="LUK 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 3:10"/>Bɛbɛi ɠɛni Zan ɠaazaɠasu, ti ɗa ɠɛ ma: «Leeni ɠa gá kɛ mu?» <verse eid="LUK 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 3:11"/>É ɠɛni ti wooɠaaʋotesu, é ɠɛ ti ma: «Zɔi seɠewuzeɠe felegɔ zea, é gaaɠwɛ ti yɔɠɔzu ta zɔi ta la zea. Zɔi ɓalaa ɠɔnɔgi zea, naa kɛ ɠana tɔ ɓalaa.»<verse eid="LUK 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 3:12"/>Mulu zo nuiti ɓalaa ti ʋaani ti ɓatize fai ma. Tiya ɓalaa ti gaazaɠani, ti ɠɛ ma: «Kalamɔn, lee ɠa gá kɛ?» <verse eid="LUK 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 3:13"/>É ɠɛni ti ma: «À mina ta la naa ma, nii deveai.»<verse eid="LUK 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 3:14"/>Salaʋusuiti ɓalaa ti gaazaɠani, ti ɠɛ ma: «Gá ma, lee ɠa gá kɛ?» É ɠɛni naati ma: «À mina wali ɠula nu ya ga zeeɠaaɓa, ɓaa wo ʋa zɛɛ ʋɛɛ nu ma, wo-zalai wo yiilɛi.»<verse eid="LUK 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 3:15"/>Nuɓusɛi pɛ ge ɠɛni maaɓɔungi wosu kitogi zu. Ɛsɛ pɛ ge ɠɛni ɓɔɠɔ ɠaazaɠasu ga ni Zan lɛi, é ʋa ɠɛ ga Kilista. <verse eid="LUK 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 3:16"/>Zan ti pɛ gooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ti ma: «Nɔ̀un, nà wo ɓatizesu ga ziɛi, kɛlɛ zɔi é ʋaazu nɔ̀un poluma, sɛbɛi wɔɔlɔʋɛ nɔ̀nɔi ʋa. Gè la vɔlɔ kula ɠɛɛni su ga gè ʋa ná-saʋala galuiti daavie. Tɔun, toɠa wo ɓatize ga Zɛnvu Ɲadegai ta abui. <verse eid="LUK 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 3:17"/>Ná-sɛpɛgi ɠa zoni zea, ga é ná-molo loɠazuʋɛ ɓalesu, é moloi ɠaalɛ ba, é pu ná-molo ɠotai zu, kɛlɛ toɠa molo ɠaʋai ɠala abui zu, nii é la zaa eyɛsu pɛ.» <verse eid="LUK 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 3:18"/>Ʋele ɠana é ɠɛni Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi laazeelizu la nuɓusɛiti ma ga tɛnɛ gooi taɠiligaa.<verse eid="LUK 3:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 3:19"/>Tama Zan zeliloni masagi Elɔde ma, tɔɔzei kɛɛɠɛloin anzai Elɔdiade zeɠe vai ʋa bɛ ga anza, ta ná-faa ɲɔu mɔinmɔingiti faa zu, niiti é ti ɠɛɛni. <verse eid="LUK 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 3:20"/>É ta ʋɛɛni zɔɔma vaa ɲɔi mɔtaiti pɛ ba, ga é Zan zoni, é pili kasoi ɠa.<verse eid="LUK 3:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ɓatize fai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:13-17">Matiyo 3:13-17</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="MRK 1:9-11">Maleke 1:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 3:21"/>Tɛi nuɓusɛi pɛ ge ɠɛni ɓatizesu, Yesu ɓalaa ɓatizeni. Kɛai ma GALA falizu, geeɠɔlɔgi laalaoni, <verse eid="LUK 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 3:22"/>Zɛnvu Ɲadegai yei ma, poopogi ɓusɛi ɠɛʋelei zu. Wooi ta ɠulani geeɠɔlɔgi zu, é ɠɛ ma: «Ɗa ɠa è ga nɛ̀ɛbɛ Loun Zunui, ɗa gòla yiilaazu.»<verse eid="LUK 3:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu mɛmɛwolani ta-zɛʋɛi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 1:1-17">Matiyo 1:1-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 3:23"/>Yesu kona ʋuusaʋagɔ (30) ɠɛɠala zɔlɔɔni niina, siɛgi zu é ná-botii lɔɔzeini la. Ʋelei nuiti ti laani la da, é ɠɛni ga Zozɛfe ná-doun zunui, Ɠeli ná-doun zunui, <verse eid="LUK 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 3:24"/>Matate ná-doun zunui, Levi ná-doun zunui, Mɛlɛki ná-doun zunui, Yanayi ná-doun zunui, Zozɛfe ná-doun zunui, <verse eid="LUK 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 3:25"/>Matatiyase ná-doun zunui, Amɔse ná-doun zunui, Naɠuume ná-doun zunui, Ɛsɛli ná-doun zunui, Nagayi ná-doun zunui, <verse eid="LUK 3:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 3:26"/>Maate ná-doun zunui, Matatiyase ná-doun zunui, Semeyɛn ná-doun zunui, Zozɛke ná-doun zunui, Yoda ná-doun zunui, <verse eid="LUK 3:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 3:27"/>Yoɠanan ná-doun zunui, Lesa ná-doun zunui, Zoloɓaɓɛle ná-doun zunui, Seyalitiyɛle ná-doun zunui, Neli ná-doun zunui, <verse eid="LUK 3:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 3:28"/>Mɛlɛki ná-doun zunui, Adi ná-doun zunui, Kozame ná-doun zunui, Ɛlɛmadame ná-doun zunui, Ɛɛl ná-doun zunui, <verse eid="LUK 3:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 3:29"/>Yesu ná-doun zunui, Eliyezɛɛl ná-doun zunui, Yolime ná-doun zunui, Matate ná-doun zunui, Levi ná-doun zunui, <verse eid="LUK 3:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 3:30"/>Simiyɔn ná-doun zunui, Zuda ná-doun zunui, Zozɛfe ná-doun zunui, Yoname ná-doun zunui, Eliakime ná-doun zunui, <verse eid="LUK 3:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 3:31"/>Meleya ná-doun zunui, Mɛna ná-doun zunui, Matata ná-doun zunui, Natan ná-doun zunui, Davide ná-doun zunui, <verse eid="LUK 3:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 3:32"/>Izayi ná-doun zunui, Woɓɛde ná-doun zunui, Ɓoaze ná-doun zunui, Sala ná-doun zunui, Naason ná-doun zunui, <verse eid="LUK 3:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 3:33"/>Aminadaɓe ná-doun zunui, Adamin ná-doun zunui, Aalini ná-doun zunui, Ɠɛsɛlon ná-doun zunui, Pelɛze ná-doun zunui, Zuda ná-doun zunui, <verse eid="LUK 3:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 3:34"/>Zakɔɓe ná-doun zunui, Izaake ná-doun zunui, Abalaame ná-doun zunui, Tela ná-doun zunui, Naɠɔɔl ná-doun zunui, <verse eid="LUK 3:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 3:35"/>Seluge ná-doun zunui, Leyu ná-doun zunui, Pelɛge ná-doun zunui, Eɓɛɛl ná-doun zunui, Sala ná-doun zunui, <verse eid="LUK 3:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 3:36"/>Kayiname ná-doun zunui, Aalafakesade ná-doun zunui, Sɛme ná-doun zunui, Nowe ná-doun zunui, Lemɛke ná-doun zunui, <verse eid="LUK 3:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 3:37"/>Matuzalɛme ná-doun zunui, Enɔke ná-doun zunui, Yelɛde ná-doun zunui, Maleleyɛle ná-doun zunui, Kenan ná-doun zunui, <verse eid="LUK 3:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 3:38"/>Enɔse ná-doun zunui, Sɛte ná-doun zunui, Adama ná-doun zunui, GALA ná-doun zunui.<verse eid="LUK 3:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="LUK 4"/>
  <para style="s">Tɛgai nii é zeelini Yesu ma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:1-11">Matiyo 4:1-11</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="MRK 1:12-13">Maleke 1:12-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 4:1"/>Yesu laavega ɠɛni de ga Zɛnvu Ɲadegai, é zeɠe Zuludɛn. Zɛnvu Ɲadegai loni tuɠɔ, é lii la teʋebai zu. <verse eid="LUK 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 4:2"/>É kɛɛni ná ga folo ʋuunaanigɔ (40), Inɛgi ɠɛni tɛɛzu ga. É la ɠɛni daami nɔpɛ boni naama voloiti su. Naati teʋegai ma, pului soni.<verse eid="LUK 4:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 4:3"/>Inɛgi ɠɛni ma: «Tɛi è ga GALA Doun Zunui, devei ve kɔtui nii ya, é valibo ga ɓului.» <verse eid="LUK 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 4:4"/>Yesu gooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «Sɛʋɛʋɛ GALA Sɛʋɛi zu ga: ‹Nui la zɛnvui woga ga daamianigi nɔ.›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 8:3">TSV 8:3</ref></char>.</char></note>»<verse eid="LUK 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 4:5"/>Naa ʋoluma, Inɛgi liini la ada ɠaaɠoozagi ta, é eteai zu masadai pɛ dɛɛ la, yeeɠɛɠala ɓuɠa ko nɔ laawu, <verse eid="LUK 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 4:6"/>é ɠɛ ma: «Nà niima masadaiti pɛ ma zobogi ta ma lɛbiyaiti pɛ fe è ya, mazɔlɔɔ ti pɛ puuʋɛ zèezu, ta nà zoo feezu nu nɔpɛ zea, nii a nɛ bɛ̀. <verse eid="LUK 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 4:7"/>Ni ɗa nɔkɔna bù, ti pɛ ka ɠɛ ga ɗɔnɔ.» <verse eid="LUK 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 4:8"/>Yesu gooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «Sɛʋɛʋɛ GALA Sɛʋɛi zu ga: ‹Nɔkɔ Maliɠii ɗa-ƓALAGI wu, tɔ ɠila kpe nɔ ɠa ɗa dɛbi.›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 6:13">TSV 6:13</ref></char>.</char></note>»<verse eid="LUK 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 4:9"/>Naa ʋoluma, Inɛgi liini la Zeluzalɛme, é pilɛ GALA sei ʋɛlɛi ungaʋɛ, é ɠɛ ma: «Tɛi è ga GALA Doun Zunui, zeɠe ʋɛ, è ʋili bu, <verse eid="LUK 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 4:10"/>mazɔlɔɔ sɛʋɛʋɛ GALA Sɛʋɛi zu ga: ‹Toɠa devei ve ná-geezuɠeelaiti zea ɗa-vaa zu, ga ti ɓaa è maazu.›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 91:11">Guy 91:11</ref></char>.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 4:11"/>Bogɛ ɓalaa ga: ‹Ta è la yeezu, nii a kɛ è-ɠɔɠɔi mina ziɠa kɔtu ʋa.›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 91:12">Guy 91:12</ref></char>.</char></note>» <verse eid="LUK 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 4:12"/>Yesu gooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «Sɛʋɛʋɛ GALA Sɛʋɛi zu ga: ‹Mina Maliɠii ɗa-ƓALAGI zuɠɔɠɔ.›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 6:16">TSV 6:16</ref></char>.</char></note>»<verse eid="LUK 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 4:13"/>Inɛgi ɓega ʋoluma ga tɛ ga, é maaɠoozani ba, eyɛsu yeeɠɛɠala ɠili.<verse eid="LUK 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ná-botii lɔɔzei vai Galilé</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:12-17">Matiyo 4:12-17</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="MRK 1:14-15">Maleke 1:14-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 4:14"/>Yesu ɠaleni ma Galilé yooi zu, Zɛnvu Ɲadegai ná-zɛbɛi ba. Tɔɠɔi ɠulani zou yɔɠɔzuʋɛ miná. <verse eid="LUK 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 4:15"/>É ɠɛni kalagi wosu GALA dɛbi ʋɛlɛiti bu, ɛsɛ pɛ ge ɠɛni dɛbizu.<verse eid="LUK 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nazalɛte nuiti ti ɠɛlɛ vai Yesu ʋa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">Matiyo 13:53-58</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="MRK 6:1-6">Maleke 6:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 4:16"/>É liini Nazalɛte, ʋɛ é kulasui woni ná. Dooɠo foloi é lɛɛni GALA dɛbi ʋɛlɛi wu, ʋelei nɔ é ɠɛni kɛɛzu la pɔlɔma. É wuzeɠeni ga é GALA daawooi ná ta ɠala. <verse eid="LUK 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 4:17"/>Ti GALA goo wo nui Ezayi ná-sɛʋɛi veeni zea. É suvieni, ʋɛ sɛʋɛai ná ga:<verse eid="LUK 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 4:18"/>«Màliɠii ná-Zɛnvui ɠa bà,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 4:18">mazɔlɔɔ é gulɔ ɲadegai ziɛʋɛ mà,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 4:18">nii a kɛ gè Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi laazeeli bala nuiti ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 4:18">É tèʋegɛ ga gè unmɔɔ fai wo kɔɔ luɔiti ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 4:18">gè gaazuɠole nuiti gaazuzeɠema vai wo ti ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 4:18">niiti ti suziɠaai laawu, gè yeeɓe naati ba, ti ɠɛ ɓɔɠɔ yeema.<verse eid="LUK 4:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 4:19"/>Gè Maliɠii ná-faaɓɔɠɔ ɠɛɛ ɠonagi ma wooi laazeeli.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:18-19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 61:1-2">Eza 61:1-2</ref></char> bogɛ é zoloo Gɛlɛke woo zɛʋɛ wɔlɔmai ma.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 4:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 4:20"/>Naa ʋoluma Yesu sɛʋɛi maaɓilini, é fe botiɠɛ nui ya, é li, é zei. Niiti pɛ ti ɠɛni GALA dɛbi ʋɛlɛi wu, ti pɛ ti ɠaazuloni ba. <verse eid="LUK 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 4:21"/>É zɛba é ɠɛ ti ma: «GALA Sɛʋɛi zu wooi nii wo mɛnigai, é ʋilɛga su, za.»<verse eid="LUK 4:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 4:22"/>Ti kpein ti zeele wooi woni ná-faa zu. Ti laavɔɔni ga woo nɛɛnɛgiti, niiti ti ɠɛni ɠulazu da, ti ɗa ɠɛ ma: «Kɛbɛ Zozɛfe ná-doun zunui ɠa, kɛlɛ?»<verse eid="LUK 4:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 4:23"/>Yesu ɠɛni ti ma: «Wa ʋaazu niima vaalaalii wosu mà nɔ ti: ‹Ɗɔɠɔtɔlɔi, ɓɔɠɔ ɠɛdɛna.› Naa ʋolu wa ɠɛ mà: ‹Fai niiti gi mɛnigai ga è ti ɠɛɛʋɛ Kapɛɛlɛnawume, naa ta ɠɛɛna è ɓɔɠɔ yooi zu.› » <verse eid="LUK 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 4:24"/>É ɠɛni ti ma ʋolu: «Gè bo wo ma ga gaamai, GALA goo wo nu nɔpɛ ge la ɗa ga zeezeibu zɔlɔɔ kpɔɠɔ yooi zu. <verse eid="LUK 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 4:25"/>Gè bo wo ma ga gaamai, poanzai mɔinni Izilayɛle yooi zu Eli ná-yeeɠɛɠalai, siɛgi zu geeɠɔlɔgi laaɠuluni da kona saʋagɔ alu dɔzita laawu, pulu wolai zɛba é loo zooi ɠa ná pɛ. <verse eid="LUK 4:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 4:26"/>Kɛlɛ GALA ge la ɠɛni Eli leʋeni tanɔpɛ pɔ bɛ, kɛni poanzai nii é ɠɛni Salɛpɛta, Sidɔn yooi zu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Wɛlɛ ʋɛ: <char style="xt"><ref loc="1KI 17:8-16">1Ma 17:8-16</ref></char>.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 4:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 4:27"/>Gee nui ɓalaa mɔinni Izilayɛle yooi zu, GALA goo wo nui Elizé ná-yeeɠɛɠalai, kɛlɛ tanɔpɛ ge la ɠɛni ɲadeni, kɛni Siili yooi zu nui Naaman.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Wɛlɛ ʋɛ: <char style="xt"><ref loc="1KI 5:1-14">1Ma 5:1-14</ref></char>.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 4:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 4:28"/>Niiti pɛ ti ɠɛni GALA dɛbi ʋɛlɛi wu, ti naama wooi mɛnigai ma, ti pɛ ti yiiɠulani ga gola. <verse eid="LUK 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 4:29"/>Ti wuzeɠeni, ti ɗa zɔɔ ba, ti kula taai ʋa, ti liini la gize zɛlɛgi ɠa, nii ta-laai loga ɠɛni de ma, nii a kɛ ti daaʋili, é loo bu. <verse eid="LUK 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 4:30"/>Kɛlɛ é leʋeni ti zaama, é ɗa li.<verse eid="LUK 4:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu inɛ su nui ɠɛdɛ fai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:21-28">Maleke 1:21-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 4:31"/>É liini Galilé laa wolai zu, nii daa ga Kapɛɛlɛnawume. É ɠɛni nuiti kalasu dooɠo foloi, <verse eid="LUK 4:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 4:32"/>nuiti ti wola laavɔɔni ga ná-kalabo pelei, tɔɔzei é ɠɛni ɓɔɛzu ga zobogi.<verse eid="LUK 4:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 4:33"/>Zunui ta ɠɛni GALA dɛbi ʋɛlɛi wu, nii kɔzɔba yɛnvui ɠɛni su. É kpeei looni, é ɠɛ ma: <verse eid="LUK 4:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 4:34"/>«Ee, Nazalɛte nui Yesu, ɗa-vaa ɓɛgele ɠa é gá-vaa zu? È ʋaaʋɛ gi undaaʋilisu ɓaa? Gè è ɠwɛni, ɗa ga GALA ná-Nu Ɲadegai!» <verse eid="LUK 4:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 4:35"/>Yesu devei veeni zea ga sɛbɛi, é ɠɛ ma: «É vɔ, ɠula zunui tɛi su!» Inɛgi zunui loai ma ti zaama, é ɠulani su, é la faa ɲɔu nɔpɛ kɛɛni la. <verse eid="LUK 4:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 4:36"/>Ɛsɛ pɛ daavɔɔni, ti ɗa ɓɔɠɔ ɠaazaɠa ga: «Wooi ma zii ɓɛgele ɠa ga nii? Toɠa kɔzɔba yɛnvuiti devezu ga zobogi ta zɛbɛi, naati ti ɗa ɠula nuiti su.» <verse eid="LUK 4:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 4:37"/>Maawooi ɠɛni ziɛzu ná maaɠoolii pɛ su.<verse eid="LUK 4:37"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu seeɓɛ nu mɔinmɔin kɛdɛ fai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:14-17">Matiyo 8:14-17</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="MRK 1:29-34">Maleke 1:29-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 4:38"/>Yesu ɠulaai ma GALA dɛbi ʋɛlɛi wu, é liini Simon ná-pɛlɛi wu. Kɔlɔkpadima wolai ɠɛni Simon mɔɛin ʋa, é laani. Ti Yesu maanɛɛnɛni ga é fai ta ɠɛ naa ʋɛ. <verse eid="LUK 4:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 4:39"/>Yesu zɛlɛni maazu, é devei ve ga kɔlɔkpadimai zeɠe ba. Kɔlɔkpadimai ɠaayeini. Gaamago, anzanui wuzeɠeni, é tɔɔzei ga é ɗa ti maaleʋebo.<verse eid="LUK 4:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 4:40"/>Foloi liai ma, niiti seeɓɛ nuiti ti ɠɛni ti ya ta-ʋɛlɛiti bu, seeɓɛ laalitaaligiti ti ʋa, ti ʋaani ga naati pɔ. É yeelaani ti ɠilagilagi pɛ ma, é ti ʋalo. <verse eid="LUK 4:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 4:41"/>Inɛgiti ɓalaa ti ɠɛni ɠulazu nu mɔinmɔin su, ti ɗa kpeei loo, ti ɗa ɠɛ ma: «Ɗa ga GALA Doun Zunui!» Kɛlɛ é ɠɛni devei veezu ti ya ga sɛbɛi, é la ɠɛni vaazu bu, naati ti ʋa ɓɔɛ, mazɔlɔɔ ti ɠɛni kwɛɛni ga tɔ ɠa é ga Kilista.<verse eid="LUK 4:41"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu GALA daawooi laazeeli vai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:35-39">Maleke 1:35-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 4:42"/>Geelaalaogai ma, é ɠulani, é li teʋebai zu. Bɛbɛ wolai ʋilɛni, é ɗa gaiziɛ. Ti kaai ma, ti ɠɛni pɔ ga ti suzo, é mina zeɠe ti ʋa. <verse eid="LUK 4:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 4:43"/>Kɛlɛ é ɠɛni ti ma: «Kɛni gè GALA ná-masadai ma Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi laazeeli ɓalaa zɔɔma laaiti su, tèʋe ungi ɠana.» <verse eid="LUK 4:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 4:44"/>É ɠɛni GALA daawooi laazeelizu GALA dɛbi ʋɛlɛiti bu, Zudé yooi zu.<verse eid="LUK 4:44"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="LUK 5"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu ná-kaladopo mɔungiti toli fai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:18-22">Matiyo 4:18-22</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Maleke 1:16-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 5:1"/>Yeeta Yesu ɠɛni loni Zenezalɛte ɓoigi laaʋɛ, bɛbɛi ɠɛni zɔɔzu ɓɔɠɔ ʋa maaɠoolii zu, ti ʋa woilo GALA daawooi ma. <verse eid="LUK 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 5:2"/>É kein felegɔ ɠaani kpoigi ɠobaʋɛ, kale ɓɛɛ nuiti kulaai ti zu, ti ɗa ta-lumɔiti gba. <verse eid="LUK 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 5:3"/>Yesu lɛɛni keingi gila su, nii é ɠɛni ga Simon nɔnɔi. É naa maanɛɛnɛni ga naa keingi tago maaɠooza kakei ʋa. Naa ʋoluma é zeini keingi zu, é tɔɔzei ga bɛbɛi ɠalaga.<verse eid="LUK 5:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 5:4"/>Kpegai ma ga kpɔɛi zuɠula, é ɠɛni Simon ma: «Li ga ɗa-ɠeingi ziɛ zaamaʋɛ, wo wa-lumɔiti pili ziɛi wu, kale ɓɛɛ vai ma.» <verse eid="LUK 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 5:5"/>Simon gooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «Kalamɔn, gi botii ɠɛɛʋɛ kpidii ɲɛgɛlɛin daawu, gi la ani nɔpɛ soni. Kɛlɛ nà losu è-wooi ma, gè tumɔiti pili ziɛi wu.»<verse eid="LUK 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 5:6"/>Ti tumɔiti piligai ma ziɛi wu, ti kale mɔinmɔin soni, tumɔiti ti tɔɔzei vɔlɔ ga ʋalia ga. <verse eid="LUK 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 5:7"/>Ti ta-wotiɠɛɲɔɠɔiti tolini ga yeeɓeɠa, niiti ti ɠɛni keingi ɠilagi zu, ga naati ti ʋa, ti kpɔba ɠɛ ti ʋɛ. Naati ti ʋaani, ti kein felegɔi pɛ daave, kalei mɔin ʋele ma keingiti ti ɠɛnina lɔɔzu ziɛi wu.<verse eid="LUK 5:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 5:8"/>Simon Piyɛlɛ miná ɠaai ma, é ʋilɛni ɲiibiɠa Yesu ɠɔɠɔwu, é ɠɛ ma: «Maaɠooza bà, Màliɠii, tɔɔzei nà ga kotoba nu.» <verse eid="LUK 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 5:9"/>Mazɔlɔɔ, ta bɔɔlaiti ti wola luani, tɔɔzei kale mɔinmɔingi ʋa, ti kpɛɛni. <verse eid="LUK 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 5:10"/>Ʋele nɔ ɠana é ɠɛɛni la ɓalaa ga Simon ná-botiɠɛɲɔɠɔ felegɔiti, Zeɓedé ná-doun zunu felegɔi Zake ta Zan. Yesu ɠɛni Simon ma: «Mina lua, mazɔlɔɔ za ʋoluma, nuiti ka ɗa ɠɛ ti ɠaiziɛzu.» <verse eid="LUK 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 5:11"/>Ti liini naazu ga ta-ɠeingiti kakei ma, ti fai pɛ zɛ ná, ti ʋilɛ Yesu ʋolu.<verse eid="LUK 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu gee nui ɠɛdɛ fai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Matiyo 8:1-4</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Maleke 1:40-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 5:12"/>Tama tɛi Yesu ɠɛni taa wolai gila su, zunui ta ɠɛni ná, nii geei ɠɛni ma nɔ ɠilikpikpi. É Yesu ɠaai ma, é laaʋɛɛni zooi ma, é maanɛɛnɛ, é ɠɛ ma: «Màliɠii, ni ɗa vaana bu, ɗa zoo è ɲàde.» <verse eid="LUK 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 5:13"/>Yesu yeemaaleni, é vɔɔɠu ba, é ɠɛ ma: «Gè vaa bu, ɲade!» Gaamago nɔ, gee zeeɓɛi zeɠeni zunui ʋa. <verse eid="LUK 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 5:14"/>Naa ʋoluma é devei veeni zunui ya, é ɠɛ ma: «Mina faa wo nu nɔpɛ ma. Kɛlɛ li, è ɓɔɠɔ lɛ ga zalaɠa ɠula nui, é è ɠɛʋele ʋɛtɛ, naa ʋoluma è ɗa-ɲade fai ma zalaɠai ɠula, eɠɛʋelei Moize ma levei veeni la. Naa ɠa ɠɛ ga zeele woo, nuiti bɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 5:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 5:15"/>Tɔɠɔ ʋagɔi ɠɛni liizu ga ɠulaa, naa ʋoluma bɛbɛ wolai ɠɛni maaɓɔsu koba goomɛni fai zu, ta ti ɠɛdɛ fai zu ta-zeeɓɛiti ma. <verse eid="LUK 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 5:16"/>Kɛlɛ tɔun é ɓena ɠula ʋolu, é li teʋebai zu, é ɗa GALA fali ná.<verse eid="LUK 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kɔlɔsama nui ɠɛdɛ fai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Matiyo 9:1-8</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="MRK 2:1-12">Maleke 2:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 5:17"/>Yeeta Yesu ɠɛni kalagi wosu. Faliziɛinti ta tɔ kalamɔinti ti ɠɛni zeini ná, ti zeɠeai Galilé ta Zudé laaiti pɛ su, naa ʋɛɛ Zeluzalɛme ʋa. Maliɠii ná-zɛbɛi ɠɛni Yesu ʋa ga é nuiti kɛdɛ. <verse eid="LUK 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 5:18"/>Nui tanigaa ti ʋaani ga kɔlɔsama nui ta betei zu, ti ɠɛni ɠɛɛzu, ti tɛ pɛlɛi wu, ti da Yesu ɠakala. <verse eid="LUK 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 5:19"/>Tɛi bɛbɛi mɔin ʋelei ma, ti la ɠɛni leʋesu ɠaani, ti lɛɛni pɛlɛ ɠɔmaʋɛ, ná ga dooɠo bosuʋɛ, ti ná ta laalao, ti zɛ betei zu, ti zei bɛbɛi zaama Yesu ɠakala. <verse eid="LUK 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 5:20"/>Yesu ta-ɠidaaleʋei ɠaai ma, é ɠɛni ma: «Zunu, ɗa-ɠotoiti suvaayɛga è ʋɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 5:21"/>Tɔ kalamɔinti ta Faliziɛinti ti tɔɔzeini ga ɠisiaa, ti ɗa ɠɛ ɓɔɠɔ ma: «Ɓɛ ɠa ga zunui nii, é woo ɲɔiti bosu GALA daalɔɠɔma? Ɓɛ ɠa a zoo kotoiti suvaayɛsu, é ɠula GALA gila kpe polu?» <verse eid="LUK 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 5:22"/>Yesu ta-ɠisiɛi ɠwɛɛni, é ɠɛ ti ma: «Lee vaa zu wo ɠisiɛzu ɠana wo-yiimaʋɛti? <verse eid="LUK 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 5:23"/>Ɓɛgele ɠa boda nɛai, nu ɠɛ ma: ‹Ɗa-ɠotoiti suvaayɛga è ʋɛ,› ɓaa nu ɠɛ ma: ‹Wuzeɠe, è ziɛ›? <verse eid="LUK 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 5:24"/>Wa ma, wa kwɛɛ ga nii maaʋele ga zobogi ɠa Nu ná-Doun Zunui ʋɛ zooi ma ga é kotoiti suvaayɛ.» É zɛba é ɠɛ kɔlɔsama nui ma: «Ɗa ɠa gè ɓɔɛzu è ʋɔ, wuzeɠe, è ɗa-ʋetei zeɠe, è li ɗa-ɠoizu.»<verse eid="LUK 5:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 5:25"/>Gaamago nɔ, zunui naa wuzeɠeni ti ɠaazu, é betei zeɠe, nii é ɠɛni laani su, é ɗa li ná-koizu ga lɛbiyai vea GALA bɛ. <verse eid="LUK 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 5:26"/>Zɔiti pɛ ti laavɔɔni, ti ɗa lɛbiyai ve GALA bɛ. Dualuagi lɔɔni ti pɛ su, ti ɗa ɠɛ ma: «Ade kulafiliba vaiti kaaʋɛ za.»<verse eid="LUK 5:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Levi loli fai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Matiyo 9:9-13</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="MRK 2:13-17">Maleke 2:13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 5:27"/>Naa ʋoluma, Yesu ɠulani, é mulu zo nui ta ɠa, nii daa ɠɛni ga Levi, é zeini mulu zo nuiti ta-wotii ɠɛɛzuʋɛ. Yesu ɠɛni ma: «Ʋilɛ pòlu!» <verse eid="LUK 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 5:28"/>Levi ná-fai pɛ zɛni ná, é wuzeɠe, é ʋilɛ polu.<verse eid="LUK 5:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 5:29"/>Naa ʋoluma, Levi fɛti laamii ɓɛtɛni bɛ ná-pɛlɛi wu. Mulu zo nuiti ma ʋɛbɛ wolai ʋaani ná, ta nu ɠiligiti, ti ɗa daamii wo ta tiye. <verse eid="LUK 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 5:30"/>Faliziɛinti ta ta-lɔ kalamɔinti ti ɠɛni unsuyelii losu, ti ɗa ɠɛ ná-kaladopoiti ma: «Lee vaa zu wo laamiizu, wo ɗa ɓɔɔle ʋɔɔma, wa mulu zo nuiti ta kotoba nuiti?» <verse eid="LUK 5:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 5:31"/>Yesu ti wooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ti ma: «Zɔiti ti ɠɛdɛgai, naati kpɛdɛ la ɗɔɠɔtɔlɔi ʋa, kɛni seeɓɛ nuiti. <verse eid="LUK 5:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 5:32"/>Gè la ʋaani ga gè telebo nuiti toli, kɛlɛ kotoba nuiti ka gè ti lolisu ga ti ti-ziɛ ʋelei maavalibo.»<verse eid="LUK 5:32"/></para>
  <para style="s">Zu so fai ma ɠaazaɠagi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Matiyo 9:14-17</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="MRK 2:18-22">Maleke 2:18-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 5:33"/>Ti ɠɛni Yesu ma: «Zan ná-kaladopoiti ta Faliziɛinti ta-ɠaladopoiti ta ɗa zugi zo valafala, ti ɗa GALA faliiti kɛ. Kɛlɛ ɗɔun, ɗɔnɔiti ta daamii wosu, ti ɗa ɓɔɔle.» <verse eid="LUK 5:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 5:34"/>Yesu ti wooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ti ma: «Nuiti ti loligai vulu ɠɛɛzuʋɛ, wa zoo ɓaa wo kɛ, ti zugi zo, siɛgi zu anzazini niinɛi ti ʋa la dɛ? <verse eid="LUK 5:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 5:35"/>Kɛlɛ yeeɠɛɠalai ta ɠa ʋaazu, siɛgi zu ta anzazini niinɛi zeɠe la ti ʋa. Názu ɠa ta zugi zo la niina.»<verse eid="LUK 5:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 5:36"/>É niima vaalaalii woni ti ma mɔnɔ, é ɠɛ ti ma: «Nu nɔpɛ ge la ɗa ga seɠe niinɛi ʋali ga, è ʋa ti laɠa ɓɔɠɔ ʋa ta seɠe zaɠai. Naa ɠa ɠɛɛna, seɠe niinɛi ɠa ʋali ga, tama seɠe niinɛi ma ɓuɠaiti ti la zolooga ɓɔɠɔ ma ta seɠe zaɠai. <verse eid="LUK 5:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 5:37"/>Nu la ɗa ga dɔɔ niinɛi ʋu ɓalaa kɔlɔ woole wɔlɔmaiti su. Naa ɠa ɠɛɛna, dɔɔ niinɛi ɠa kɔlɔ woole wɔlɔmaiti fuka, dɔɔi ɠa ʋu ya, gooleiti ta ɠoloɠolo. <verse eid="LUK 5:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 5:38"/>Kɛlɛ kɛni nu a ɗa dɔɔ niinɛi ʋu kɔlɔ woole niinɛiti su. <verse eid="LUK 5:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 5:39"/>Nu nɔpɛ ka ɓena ga dɔɔ wɔlɔmai ɓɔle, ma niinɛi wɔin la mɔ ɗa ga so, mazɔlɔɔ toɠa ɗa ɠɛ ma: ‹Ma wɔlɔmai vizɔgɛ.› »<verse eid="LUK 5:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="LUK 6"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu ɠa ga dooɠo foloi Maliɠii</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Matiyo 12:1-8</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Maleke 2:23-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 6:1"/>Yeeta, dooɠo foloi, Yesu ɠɛni leʋesu molo ɓalagiti su. Ná-kaladopoiti ti ɠɛni molo ɠɔpɔgiti gaaʋolosososu, ti ɗa <char style="w">ɲɔfɔ ya</char>, ti ɗa ma ɠɛzɛi mi. <verse eid="LUK 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 6:2"/>Faliziɛin tanigaa ti ɠɛni ti ma: «Lee vaa zu wo naa ɠɛɛzu, nii tɔgi la vaani bu ga nu kɛ dooɠo foloi?» <verse eid="LUK 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 6:3"/>Yesu ti wooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ti ma: «Wo la dɛ naa ɠalani mu ɓaa, nii Davide kɛɛni, siɛgi zu pului soni da ta siɛɲɔɠɔiti? <verse eid="LUK 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 6:4"/>É lɛɛni GALA ná-seɠe ʋɛlɛ ɲadegai wu, é ɓuluiti seɠe, ti veai GALA bɛ, é ta mi, é ta ve siɛɲɔɠɔiti zea, tama tɔgi deveni ga zalaɠa ɠula nuiti gila kpe nɔ ɠa ta ɓului naati mi.» <verse eid="LUK 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 6:5"/>Naa ʋoluma, é ɠɛni ti ma: «Nu ná-Doun Zunui ɠa é ga dooɠo foloi Maliɠii.»<verse eid="LUK 6:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu zeezaama zunui ɠɛdɛ fai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Matiyo 12:9-14</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="MRK 3:1-6">Maleke 3:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 6:6"/>Dooɠo foloi taɠili mɔnɔ, Yesu lɛɛni GALA dɛbi ʋɛlɛi wu, é ɗa kalagi wo. Zunui ta ɠɛni ná, nii zeezai zaani ma. <verse eid="LUK 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 6:7"/>Tɔ kalamɔinti ta Faliziɛinti ti ɠɛni Yesu zumɔsu ga ni toɠa nu ɠɛdɛ dooɠo foloi. Ti ɠɛni pɔ ga ti peelalazu zɔlɔɔ ba. <verse eid="LUK 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 6:8"/>Kɛlɛ tɔun ge ɠɛni ta-ɠisiɛiti kwɛɛ, é ɠɛni zunui naa ma, nii zeei zaani ma: «Wuzeɠe, è lo ɛsɛ pɛ gaazu.» É wuzeɠeni, é lo.<verse eid="LUK 6:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 6:9"/>Yesu ɠɛni ti ma: «Nà wo ɠaazaɠasu, tɔgi vaaʋɛ nɛi bu ga dooɠo foloi, nu faa ʋagɔi ɠɛ, ɓaa nu faa ɲɔi ɠɛ? Nu è nui yɛnvui ɠizo, ɓaa è nu undaaʋili?» <verse eid="LUK 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 6:10"/>É wɛlɛni ti pɛ ba, naa ʋolu é ɠɛ zunui ma: «Yeemaale.» Naa yeei maaleni, é ɠɛdɛ.<verse eid="LUK 6:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 6:11"/>Ti wola laaveni ga ziiɠaawanai, ti ɗa yɛpɛ ga nii ta kɛ ga Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu yiimazeɠe vai ga <optbreak/> keela puugɔ maazu felegɔiti (12)</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Matiyo 10:1-4</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Maleke 3:13-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 6:12"/>Naama ziɛgi zu, Yesu lɛɛni gizei ta ma ga é GALA fali. É kpidii pɛ kɛɛni, é ɗa GALA fali. <verse eid="LUK 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 6:13"/>Geelaalaogai ma, é ná-kaladopoiti tolini, é yiimazeɠe ti zaama ga nu puugɔ maazu felegɔ (12), é ti-laasei pɛɛ ga keelaiti: <verse eid="LUK 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 6:14"/>Simon nii é daasei pɛɛni ga Piyɛlɛ, ta kɛɛɠɛloin Andelé, Zake, Zan, Filipe, Ɓaatelemi, <verse eid="LUK 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 6:15"/>Matiyo, Tomase, Alefé ná-doun zunui Zake, Simon nii é ɠɛni ga Zou Maalobo Nui ta, <verse eid="LUK 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 6:16"/>naa ʋɛɛ Zake ná-doun zunui Zude ʋa, ta Zudase Isekaliyɔte, nii é ɠɛni ga yaava nui.<verse eid="LUK 6:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kalagi wo fai <optbreak/> ta nuiti kɛdɛ fai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:23-25">Matiyo 4:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 6:17"/>Yesu ta ná-keelaiti ti yeini gize ɠɔɠɔaʋɛ nɛmɛi zu, ʋɛ ná-kaladopo mɔinmɔingiti ti ɠɛni ná, ta nu ʋɛbɛ wolai niiti ti zeɠeni Zudé yooi zu ta Zeluzalɛme, naa ʋɛɛ kpoloɗɛ ɠobaʋɛ yooi ʋa, nii é Tiil ta Sidɔn taa wolaiti maaɠoolii zu. <verse eid="LUK 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 6:18"/>Ti ʋaani goomɛni fai ma, ta ti ɠɛdɛ fai zu. Niiti kɔzɔba yɛnvuiti ti ɠɛni ti ɓɔlɔzu, naati ti ɠɛdɛni. <verse eid="LUK 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 6:19"/>Bɛbɛi pɛ ge ɠɛni pɔ ga ti yeevɔɔɠu ba, mazɔlɔɔ zɛbɛi ɠɛni ɠulazu su, é ɗa ti pɛ kɛdɛ.<verse eid="LUK 6:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Undaanɛɛi ta maanɔɠɔi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:1-12">Matiyo 5:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 6:20"/>Yesu ɠaazuloni ná-kaladopoiti ba naazu, é ɠɛ ti ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:20">«Undaanɛ nu ɠa ga woye, wɔi wo ga bala nuiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:20">tɔɔzei GALA ná-masadai ɠa ga wɔnɔ.<verse eid="LUK 6:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 6:21"/>Undaanɛ nu ɠa ga woye, wɔi pului wo ma niizu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:21">tɔɔzei wa yiɠo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:21">Undaanɛ nu ɠa ga woye, wɔi wo wɔlɔzu niizu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:21">tɔɔzei wa ɲɛ.<verse eid="LUK 6:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 6:22"/>Undaanɛ nu ɠa ga woye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:22">siɛgi zu nuiti ti wo wɔinzeɠezu la,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:22">ti wo ɓɛ, ti wo ʋoomu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:22">ti wo leve ga nu ɲɔu, Nu ná-Doun Zunui maaʋele ma.<verse eid="LUK 6:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 6:23"/>«À ɠoozunɛ naama yeei, wo ɠɔkɔ ga koozunɛɛi, mazɔlɔɔ kulanuma wola ɠa wo ya geeɠɔlɔgi zu. Tɔɔzei ʋele nɔ ɠana ti-mɛmɛwolani ti kɛɛni la ga GALA goo wo nuiti.<verse eid="LUK 6:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 6:24"/>Kɛlɛ maanɔɠɔ ɠa wo ʋɛ, naavolo nuiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:24">tɔɔzei wo wɔnɔ ma ɠaanɛɛnɛi zɔlɔɔga.<verse eid="LUK 6:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 6:25"/>Maanɔɠɔ ɠa wo ʋɛ, wɔi wo yiɠoai niizu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:25">tɔɔzei pului ɠa wo zo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:25">Maanɔɠɔ ɠa wo ʋɛ, wɔi wo ɲɛɛzu niizu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:25">tɔɔzei wo maa ɠa wɔin, wo ɗa wɔlɔ.<verse eid="LUK 6:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 6:26"/>Maanɔɠɔ ɠa wo ʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:26">siɛgi zu ɛsɛ pɛ ge wa-vaa ʋagɔi wosu da,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:26">tɔɔzei ʋele nɔ ɠana ti-mɛmɛwolani ti kɛɛni la</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:26">ga zɛɛ ɠala goo wo nuiti.<verse eid="LUK 6:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">È zili nui nɛɛ vai ʋɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:38-48">Matiyo 5:38-48</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:12">7:12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 6:27"/>«Kɛlɛ wɔiti wo gòomɛnisu, nà bosu wo ma ga: À wo zili nuiti nɛɛ ʋɛ. À faa ʋagɔi ɠɛ naati bɛ, ti wo wɔinzeɠezu. <verse eid="LUK 6:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 6:28"/>À tuya loo naati bɛ, niiti ti wo voovoozu. À GALA fali naati bɛ, ti wo zopele ɲɔu zu. <verse eid="LUK 6:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 6:29"/>Ni nui a è loɠana è-woizuʋɛ ɠilagi, zɔɔla ʋelei ɓalaa lete ma. Zɔi ma é ɗa-zeɠe wolai zeɠezu, mina ɠɛlɛ seɠewuzeɠei ɓalaa yɛsu zea. <verse eid="LUK 6:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 6:30"/>Zɔi é è valizu, naa ɠɔ. Zɔi é è-ɠɔligi ɠulazu è ya, mina ɠɛ ma, é gaaɠale ma. <verse eid="LUK 6:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 6:31"/>Nii wo pɔ ga zɔiti ti kɛ wo ʋɛ, à naa ɠɛɠalai ɓalaa kɛ ti ʋɛ.<verse eid="LUK 6:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 6:32"/>«Ni wa naati nɔ nɛɛna ʋɛ, niiti ti wo nɛɛzu ʋɛ, lee ma lɔnɔ ka wa sɔlɔɔ naazu? Mazɔlɔɔ kotoba nuiti ɓalaa ta ɗa naati nɛɛ ʋɛ, niiti ti ti nɛɛzu ʋɛ. <verse eid="LUK 6:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 6:33"/>Ni wa faa ʋagɔi ɠɛɛna naati nɔ ʋɛ, niiti ti ta ɠɛɛzu wo ʋɛ, lee ma lɔnɔ ka wa sɔlɔɔ naazu? Kotoba nuiti ɓalaa ta ɗa kɛ ɠana nɔ. <verse eid="LUK 6:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 6:34"/>Ni wa kuyei ʋɛɛna naati nɔ ma, niiti wo-ɠi ge ti ʋa ga ta kula, lee ma lɔnɔ ka wa sɔlɔɔ naazu? Kotoba nuiti ɓalaa ta ɗa kuyeiti pɛ kotoba nui zɔiti ma, nii a kɛ ti ʋa potogi zɔlɔɔ. <verse eid="LUK 6:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 6:35"/>Kɛlɛ à wo zili nuiti nɛɛ ʋɛ. À faa ʋagɔi ɠɛ ti ʋɛ, wo kuyei ʋɛ ti ma, wo mina ɠito ani nɔpɛ ba naa ʋoluʋele. Naazu, wa-ɠulanumai ɠa wɔɔlɔ, naa ʋolu wa ɠɛ ga nii é Anii-Pɛ-Unda, naa ná-dointi, mazɔlɔɔ toɠa ɗa faa ʋagɔi ɠɛ faanɛɛ wuuɠwɛɛtala nuiti bɛ, ta nu ɲɔiti. <verse eid="LUK 6:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 6:36"/>À ɠɛ ga gaazumaawɔinɠaa nuiti, eɠɛʋelei wo-Ɠɛɛ la ga gaazumaawɔinɠaa ƓALAGI.<verse eid="LUK 6:36"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mina è-wɔɔlai lukpɔɠaaleʋe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:1-5">Matiyo 7:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 6:37"/>«À mina nu lukpɔɠaaleʋe, GALA ge la wo lukpɔɠaaleʋea. À mina nu ʋeelala, GALA ge la wo ʋeelalaa. À suvaayɛgi wo, GALA ka wo zuvaayɛ. <verse eid="LUK 6:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 6:38"/>À nuiti kɔ, GALA ka wo ɠɔ. Nii kɔɠɔgai ga pagɔ, maaluɓaai, ɲiikpigai, pooʋaai ma, GALA ka naa ʋu wo-ɠeke su gbu. Mazɔlɔɔ kɔɠɔ ganii nii nɔ wo kɔɠɔgi wosu su, naa nɔ ɠa kɔɠɔgi ɠa wo su wa ɓalaa wo ʋɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 6:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 6:39"/>É faalaalii nii ɓalaa boni ti ma, é ɠɛ ti ma: «Gaazuɠole nui ɠa zoo nɛi é lo bɔɔla gaazuɠole nui luɠɔ ɓaa? Kɛbɛ ti felegɔ ta loo zeɠei zu, kɛlɛ? <verse eid="LUK 6:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 6:40"/>Kaladopoi la leʋeni ná-kalamɔin ʋa, kɛlɛ kaladopoi nii é kalagi zɔlɔɔgai ga pagɔ, naa ɠa ɗa ɠɛ ga ná-kalamɔin ɠɛʋele.<verse eid="LUK 6:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 6:41"/>«Lee vaa zu è ɠaazulosu kaʋa goi ʋa è-ɠɛɛloin ɠaazuʋɛ, ɗa ma, è la gulu ɠoozagi ɠaazu, kpadɔai ɗɔnɔi ma? <verse eid="LUK 6:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 6:42"/>È leʋe ɠale, è ɗa ɠɛ è-ɠɛɛloin ma: ‹Kɛ̀ɛloun, ɓɛ gè kaʋa goi ɠula è-ɠaazuɠɛzɛi ma,› ɗɛi è la gulu ɠoozagi ʋɛtɛsu è ʋɔ bɛ? Koo, woovele nui! Gulu ɠoozagi ɠula dɛ è-ɠaazuɠɛzɛi ma, naazu ɗa zoo wozaɠaazu ga pagɔ, è kaʋa goi ɠula è-ɠɛɛloin ɠaazuɠɛzɛi ma.<verse eid="LUK 6:42"/></para>
  <para style="s">Gului ta gaawaai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:16-20">Matiyo 7:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:33-35">12:33-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 6:43"/>«Gulu ʋagɔi la ɗa ga gwaa ɲɔu woga. Zenɔ ɠana ɓalaa gulu ɲɔi la ɗa ga gwaa ʋagɔ woga. <verse eid="LUK 6:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 6:44"/>Mazɔlɔɔ gului ɠa ɠwɛɛsu ga gaawaai. Nu la ɗa ga kooleɠoole gwaai ɠula ɠain gului ɠa, nu la ɓalaa leezɛn waai ɠula ɠain kpɔvɔi ɠa. <verse eid="LUK 6:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 6:45"/>Nu ʋagɔi ɠa ɗa ani ʋagɔiti kula ná-ani makɛsu ʋagɔi, ʋɛ ná ziimaʋɛ, nu ɲɔi ɓalaa ka ɗa ani ɲɔiti kula ná-ani makɛsu ɲɔi. Mazɔlɔɔ nii é ʋooʋazu nui yiimaʋɛ, naa ɠa daaʋɛ, a ɗa bo.<verse eid="LUK 6:45"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pɛlɛ lo nu felegɔiti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:24-27">Matiyo 7:24-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 6:46"/>«Lee vaa zu wo tòlisu ga ‹Màliɠii, Màliɠii›, tama wo la naa ɠɛɛzu, nii gè bosu wo ma? <verse eid="LUK 6:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 6:47"/>Nu nɔpɛ é ʋaazu pɔ̀, é gòoiti mɛni, é ti ɠɛ, ɓɛ gè baaɠulabai lɛ ga woye. <verse eid="LUK 6:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 6:48"/>Kɛɛʋɛ eɠɛ zunui nii é ɠɛni ná-pɛlɛi losu. É zeɠei wɔɔni, é suɠooza, é tɔɔɓadɔ fasai ma. Ziɛvegi ʋaani, ta ziɛ veinfeingiti ti loɠa pɛlɛi naa zu, ti la zooni ti ʋa ɲiikpi, tɔɔzei toga ɠɛni de ga pagɔ. <verse eid="LUK 6:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 6:49"/>Kɛlɛ zɔi é gòoiti mɛnisu, é la ti ɠɛɛni, naama nui ɠɛɛʋɛ eɠɛ zunui nii é ná-pɛlɛi logai zou ɲakai ma, é la tɔɔɓadɔni. Ziɛ veinfeingi loɠani ba, gaamago nɔ é ɠolo, pɛlɛi naa ɠoloɠolo pele wɔɔlɔni.»<verse eid="LUK 6:49"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="LUK 7"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu salaʋusu ɠundiɠii <optbreak/> ná-botiɠɛ nui ɠɛdɛ fai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:5-13">Matiyo 8:5-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 7:1"/>Yesu ɓegai ma ga niima ɓɔɛiti pɛ bo nuɓusɛiti ma, é lɛɛni Kapɛɛlɛnawume taazuʋɛ. <verse eid="LUK 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 7:2"/>Wɔlɔme zalaʋusu ɠundiɠii gila ge ɠɛni ná, nii ná-botiɠɛ nui ná-seeɓɛi ɓɔini, é ɠɛ é za. Ná-botiɠɛ nui naa wola nɛɛni bɛ. <verse eid="LUK 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 7:3"/>É Yesu maawoo mɛnigai ma, é Zuifuiti ta-lotuɠɔi tanigaa leʋeni ma, ga ti bo ma, é ʋa, é ná-botiɠɛ nui ʋalo. <verse eid="LUK 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 7:4"/>Ti ʋaani Yesu ʋɔ bɛ, ti maanɛɛnɛ ga gola, ti ɠɛ ma: «Soloogɛ ga è niima ɓɔbai ɠɛ bɛ, <verse eid="LUK 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 7:5"/>mazɔlɔɔ ade-ma zii nɛɛʋɛ bɛ, tɔ ɠa vɔlɔ, é gá-ƓALA dɛbi ʋɛlɛi logai.»<verse eid="LUK 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 7:6"/>Yesu ʋilɛni ti ʋolu, ti ɗa li. Yesu maa la mɔ ɠɛni ɠoozani pɛlɛi ʋa, eyɛsu salaʋusu ɠundiɠii bɔɔlaiti teʋe ma, ti gooi wo ma ga: «Màliɠii, mina ɓɔɠɔ ɓɔlɔ, mazɔlɔɔ gè la kula ɠɛɛni su ga è ʋa lɛ nà-pɛlɛi wu. <verse eid="LUK 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 7:7"/>Naa ɠa é kɛai ɓalaa, gè pɛtɛgai la ga gè la vizɔni ga nà ɓɔɠɔi gè ʋa è ʋɔ bɛ. Kɛlɛ woo ɲɛ gila bo nɔ, nà-botiɠɛ nui ɠa ɠɛdɛ. <verse eid="LUK 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 7:8"/>Tɔɔzei nà ɓɔɠɔi nà nà-kundiɠiiti ta-zobogi wu, salaʋusuiti ɓalaa ta nà-devei wu. Nà ɠɛɛna gila ma: ‹Li!›, toɠa liizu. Nà ɠɛɛna taɠili ma: ‹Ʋa!›, toɠa ʋaazu. Nà ɠɛɛna ɓalaa nà-duɔi ma: ‹Nii ɠɛ!›, naa ɠa é kɛɛzu.»<verse eid="LUK 7:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 7:9"/>Yesu naama wooi mɛnigai ma, gola laavɔɔni ga salaʋusu ɠundiɠii. É ɠaaʋoteni bɛbɛi ma, nii é ɠɛni polu, é ɠɛ ti ma: «Gè bo wo ma, gè la dɛ nii ɠɛɠala ɠidaaleʋei ta ɠaani, anɛɛ Izilayɛle nuɓusɛiti saama.» <verse eid="LUK 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 7:10"/>Keelaiti ti ɠalegai ma ma pɛlɛi wu, ti botiɠɛ nui ɠɛdɛgai ɠaani.<verse eid="LUK 7:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu poanzai ná-doun zunui wuzeɠe vai, <optbreak/> é kula saai ya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 7:11"/>Naa ʋoluma, é liini taa wolai ta zu, nii daa ga Nayɛn. Ná-kaladopoiti ti ɠɛni polu, naa ʋɛɛ nu mɔinmɔin ba. <verse eid="LUK 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 7:12"/>Siɛgi zu é maaɓuɠani la taa loaʋɛ ʋa, nuiti ti ɠɛni liizu ga poomai kabamaʋɛ, poanzai ta, ná-doun zunu ɠila kpegi ɠɛni de. Taazuʋɛ zei wo nui ma mɔinmɔin ge ʋilɛni polu, ti ɗa li. <verse eid="LUK 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 7:13"/>Maliɠii poanzai ʋɛtɛgai ma, naa maawɔin soni, é ɠɛ ma: «Mina mɔ wɔlɔ.» <verse eid="LUK 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 7:14"/>É maaɓuɠani, é yeevɔɔɠu kpaɠalaɓaɠalai ʋa. Niiti ti ɠɛni seɠezu, naati ti loni. Yesu ɠɛni ma: «Zinipoi, nà è levezu ga è wuzeɠe!» <verse eid="LUK 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 7:15"/>Poomai wuzeɠeni, é zei, é tɔɔzei ga kpɔɛi zuɠulaa. Yesu feeni ʋolu dee ya. <verse eid="LUK 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 7:16"/>Dualuagi lɔɔni ti pɛ su, ti ɗa GALA dɛbi, ti ɗa ɠɛ ma: «GALA goo wo nu wolai ta wuzeɠea gi zaama! GALA ge ʋaa wɛlɛzu ná-nuɓusɛiti ma!» <verse eid="LUK 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 7:17"/>Naa maawooi zeelini Zudé yooi zu ná pɛ, ta ná maaɠooliiti su.<verse eid="LUK 7:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ɓɛɛni ka ga Yesu ta Zan Ɓatisete?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:2-19">Matiyo 11:2-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 7:18"/>Zan ná-kaladopoiti ti naama vaiti pɛ boni ta-ɠalamɔin ma. Zan ná-kaladopo felegɔ lolini, <verse eid="LUK 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 7:19"/>é ti leʋe Maliɠii ma, ti gaazaɠa, ti ɠɛ ma: «Ɗa ɠa è ga naama nui, nii maanɛai ga é ʋa, ɓaa gi taɠili maaɓɔun?» <verse eid="LUK 7:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 7:20"/>Naati seeliai ma Yesu ʋɔ bɛ, ti ɠɛni ma: «Zan Ɓatisete gi leʋegɛ ga gi è ɠaazaɠa, ni ɗa ɠa è ga naama nui, nii maanɛai ga é ʋa, ɓaa gi taɠili maaɓɔun?»<verse eid="LUK 7:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 7:21"/>Naama yeeɠɛɠalai nɔ zu, Yesu nu mɔinmɔin kɛdɛni, niiti seeɓɛi ɠɛni ti ʋa, ta maalɛɠɛfɛgiti, ta niiti zɛnvu ɲɔiti ti ɠɛni ti zu, é gaazuɠole nu mɔinmɔin gaazuzeɠe ma. <verse eid="LUK 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 7:22"/>É ti wooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ti ma: «À li, wo naa zuɠula Zan ma, nii wo kaa, ta wo mɛniga: Gaazuɠole nuiti gaazu ɠa zeɠezu ma, mɛɠɛlɛ nuiti ti ɗa ziɛ ga pagɔ, gee nuiti ti ɗa ɲade, goizuɓɔlɔ nuiti ti ɗa faa mɛni, gɔvɛiti ti ɗa wuzeɠe, woo niinɛ ʋagɔi laa ɠa zeelizu bala nuiti ma. <verse eid="LUK 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 7:23"/>Undaanɛ nu ɠa ga naama nui, nii é la loa kakagi zu ga nɔ̀un maaʋele.»<verse eid="LUK 7:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 7:24"/>Zan ná-keelaiti ti liai ma, Yesu tɔɔzeini ga ɓɔɛa bɛbɛi ʋɔ, é ʋilɛ Zan ʋa, é ɠɛ ti ma: «Ɓɛgele ɠa wo liini kaazu teʋebai zu? Seeligi nii fiilɛi ɲiikpisu ɓaa? <verse eid="LUK 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 7:25"/>Leeni ɠa mu wo liini kaazu? Nui nii maaɠiliai ga seɠe ʋapagiti ɓaa? Niiti ti maaɠiliai ga seɠe ʋapagiti ta ti zɛnvui wosu gaanɛɛi zu, naati ta masa pɛlɛiti bu. <verse eid="LUK 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 7:26"/>Ɓɛgele ɠa mu wo liini kaazu? GALA goo wo nu? Gaama ɠana, nɔ̀un nà bosu wo ma ga teʋegɛ GALA goo wo nu ʋa. <verse eid="LUK 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 7:27"/>Tɔ ɠa sɛʋɛai ná-faa zu GALA Sɛʋɛi zu ga:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 7:27">‹Nà nà-keelai leʋesu è luɠɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 7:27">é ɗa-ʋelei ɓɛtɛ è luɠɔ.›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAL 3:1">Mal 3:1</ref></char>.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 7:27"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 7:28"/>Ɓɛ gè nii wo wo ma, nui kpein nii anzanu sɔlɔɔgai, tanɔpɛ ge la wɔɔlɔni Zan ʋa. Kɛlɛ zɔi dɔiɗai GALA ná-masadai zu, naa wɔɔlɔʋɛ ba.»<verse eid="LUK 7:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 7:29"/>(Nuɓusɛiti pɛ ta mulu zo nuiti ti gooi mɛnini, ti vaani GALA ná-telebodai wu, ti ɓatize ga Zan ná-ɓatizei. <verse eid="LUK 7:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 7:30"/>Kɛlɛ Faliziɛinti ta tɔ kalamɔinti, ti ɠɛlɛni GALA ziimai ʋa ti letegi, tɔɔzei kɛlɛi ʋa ti boni ga Zan mina ti ɓatize.)<verse eid="LUK 7:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 7:31"/>Yesu ɠɛni ma ʋolu: «Ɓɛ ɠa mu nà niizuʋɛ nuɓusɛiti pokɔɠɔ ma? Ɓɛ ɠa ti ɠulaai la? <verse eid="LUK 7:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 7:32"/>Ti ɠulaʋɛ ga doungoiti ti zeini dɔɔɠɔ ɓalagi zu, ti ɗa wooɠula ɓɔɠɔ ma, ti ɗa ɠɛ ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 7:32">‹Gi koolei vɛa, wo la kuai woni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 7:32">gi saa zu wuyei loa, wo la wɔlɔni.›<verse eid="LUK 7:32"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 7:33"/>Tɔɔzei Zan Ɓatisete ʋaani, é ɗa zugi zo, é la dɔɔ ɓɔlezu, wo ɠɛ ma: ‹Inɛgi ɠa su.› <verse eid="LUK 7:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 7:34"/>Nu ná-Doun Zunui ʋaa, é ɗa daamii ta kpɔɔlei wo, wo ɠɛ ma mɔnɔ: ‹Zunui nii ɠa ga ɠulukpu nu ta dɔɔ ɓɔle nu wolai. Toɠa ga mulu zo nuiti ta kotoba nuiti ti-wɔɔlai.› <verse eid="LUK 7:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 7:35"/>Kɛlɛ niiti ti vaazu ɠimalai wu, naati ta dɛɛzu ga naa lelebogɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 7:35"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kotoba anzanui nii suvaayɛni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 7:36"/>Faliziɛin gila ge Yesu maanɛɛnɛni ga naa li, ti laami ʋɔɔma. Yesu liini, é zei taɓalii ɠakala, Faliziɛin ná-pɛlɛi wu. <verse eid="LUK 7:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 7:37"/>Kotoba anzanui gila ge ɠɛni taazuʋɛ. É mɛnigai ma ga Yesu ɠa daami wosuʋɛ Faliziɛin ná-pɛlɛi wu, é ʋaani ga goole ɠila, kpɛtɛai ga aaleɓatelegi, nii daaveni ga gulɔ maku nɛɛnɛgi. <verse eid="LUK 7:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 7:38"/>É ɠɛni Yesu ɠɔɠɔwu ʋoluzuʋɛ. É ɠɛni wɔlɔzu, é tɔɔzei ga naa ɠɔɠɔiti maagbaa ga gaazuɗɛi, é ɗa ti maaɓale ga nɔundeɠaiti, é ɗa laaʋɛɛ kɔɠɔiti ba, é ɗa gulɔ maku nɛɛnɛgi ziɛ ti ma.<verse eid="LUK 7:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 7:39"/>Faliziɛin, nii é tolini, naa miná ɠaai ma, é ɠɛni ɓɔɛzu ɠisu, é ɗa ɠɛ ma: «Ni zunui tɛi ge ɠɛni ga GALA goo wo nu ɠiteɠite, a la kwɛɛ ga anzanui nii é vɔɔɠuzu tɔun ba, naa ɠa ga kotoba nui.» <verse eid="LUK 7:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 7:40"/>Yesu gooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «Simon, faa ɠa bɛ̀ ga gè bo è ma.» Naa ɠɛni ma: «Kalamɔn, ɓɔɛna.»<verse eid="LUK 7:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 7:41"/>Yesu ɠɛni ma: «Zunui ta ɠɛni ná, nii ná-kuyei ɠɛni nu felegɔ ma. Zɔi maaɠuyei ɠɛni ga wali undɔɔlugɔ (500), zɔi puulɔɔlugɔ (50). <verse eid="LUK 7:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 7:42"/>Tɛi kula zobo ge la ɠɛni ti felegɔ pɛ bɛ, é ti zuvaayɛni ga ta-ɠuyeiti. Naati felegɔ zu, ɓɛ ɠa a zunui naa nɛɛ ʋɛ ga gola?» <verse eid="LUK 7:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 7:43"/>Simon gooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «Nà ɠisiɛzu ga zɔi ʋe, nii é maaɠuye wolai zuvaayɛni.» Yesu ɠɛni ma: «È gaamai woga.» <verse eid="LUK 7:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 7:44"/>Naa ʋoluma, é ɠaaʋoteni anzanui ma, é ɠɛ Simon ma: «È anzanui tɛi kaa? Gè lɛa ɗa-ʋɛlɛi wu, è la ziɛ veeni zèa, gè ʋa kɔ̀ɠɔiti maagba, kɛlɛ tɔun ge kɔ̀ɠɔiti zɛɓɛa ga gaazuɗɛi, é ti maaɓale ga nɔundeɠaiti. <verse eid="LUK 7:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 7:45"/>È la nɛ̀ɛnɛni ga è-laaʋɛ, kɛlɛ tɔun kaipa za gè lɛɛni, é la looɠoni ga laaʋɛa kɔɠɔiti ba. <verse eid="LUK 7:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 7:46"/>È la gulɔ ziɛni nɔ̀ungi ma, kɛlɛ tɔun ge gulɔ maku nɛɛnɛgi ziaa kɔ̀ɠɔiti ma. <verse eid="LUK 7:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 7:47"/>Gè bo è ma, ná-koto mɔinmɔingiti suvaayɛga bɛ, naa ɠa é kɛai é nɛɛbɛ wolai ɠulaai la kɛlɛma. Kɛlɛ zɔi tago nɔ zuvaayɛsu bɛ, naa ná-nɛɛbɛi ɠa ɗa ɠɛ nɔ kpein.»<verse eid="LUK 7:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 7:48"/>Naa ʋoluma, é ɠɛni anzanui ma: «Ɗa-ɠotoiti suvaayɛga.» <verse eid="LUK 7:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 7:49"/>Zɔiti ti ɠɛni zeini koba taɓalii ɠakala, naati ti ɠɛni ɓɔɛzu ɠisu, ti ɗa ɠɛ ma: «Nu zii ɓɛgele ɠa ga zunui tɛi, nii é kotoiti suvaayɛsu ɠani vɔlɔ?» <verse eid="LUK 7:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 7:50"/>Yesu ɠɛni anzanui ma ʋolu: «Tɛi è laa dà, è ʋaloa. Li ziilɛigi zu.»<verse eid="LUK 7:50"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="LUK 8"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu ná-siɛpoluiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 8:1"/>Naa ʋoluma Yesu ɠɛni leʋeteʋesu taa goiti ta taa wolaiti su, é ɗa GALA ná-masadai ma Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi laazeeli. Keela puugɔ maazu felegɔiti (12) ti ɠɛni polu, <verse eid="LUK 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 8:2"/>ta anzanui tanigaa niiti ti ɠɛdɛni, ti ɠula zɛnvu ɲɔiti zea, ta seeɓɛiti su: Mali nii é lolisu ga Magedala nui, nii inɛ dɔfelai ɠulani su, <verse eid="LUK 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 8:3"/>ta Zane, Suza anzai, Elɔde ná-koi unda nui, ta Suzane, naa ʋɛɛ taɠiligaa ʋa, niiti ti ɠɛni ɓɔsu ti ʋa ga ti-yeaɠɔligiti.<verse eid="LUK 8:3"/></para>
  <para style="s">Faalaalii é ʋilɛ <optbreak/> molo zuwu vaza nui ʋa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:1-9">Matiyo 13:1-9</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="MRK 4:1-9">Maleke 4:1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 8:4"/>Tɛi bɛbɛ wolai ɠaalɛɛni ba Yesu ɠoba, ti ɠula taa wolaiti pɛ su, é niima vaalaalii woni ti ma, é ɠɛ ti ma: <verse eid="LUK 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 8:5"/>«Molo zuwu vaza nui ta ɠulani ga é ná-molo zuwui vaza. Kɛai ma moloi vazasu, molo ɠaei tanigaa ti looni pele ɠɛzɛi zu, nuiti ti ɠɔɠɔi lo ma, wɔniiti ti mi. <verse eid="LUK 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 8:6"/>Taɠiligaa ti looni fasa lutui zu. Ti ʋɔnɔni, naa ʋolu ti vɔ, tɔɔzei dɛilɛi balagi ʋa. <verse eid="LUK 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 8:7"/>Taɠiligaa ti looni ɠaingiti saama. Ti ʋɔnɔni ʋɔɔma ta naati, ɠaingiti ti molo ʋɔnɔ koiti maaɓɔle. <verse eid="LUK 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 8:8"/>Taɠiligaa ti looni mɔnɔ zou ʋagɔi zu. Ti ʋɔnɔni, ti waa, ti-ɠaawaai ɠɛ ga ungilagila (100).» É naa wogai ma, é wooɠulani, é ɠɛ ma: «Zɔi faa mɛni goiyeɠe ba, naama nui nii mɛni.»<verse eid="LUK 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ná-faalaaliiti bo ungi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:10-17">Matiyo 13:10-17</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="MRK 4:10-12">Maleke 4:10-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 8:9"/>Ná-kaladopoiti ti gaazaɠani faalaalii naa ʋoluʋɛ ma. <verse eid="LUK 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 8:10"/>É ɠɛni ti ma: «Wɔun, feeʋɛ wo ʋɛ ga wo GALA ná-masadai ma lɔɔɠuzu vaiti kwɛɛ, kɛlɛ ta wo nui mɔtaiti ma, faalaaliiti su, nii a kɛ ‹anɛɛ ni ta wɛlɛzu, ti mina wozaɠa, ti ɠɛ ʋa woilosu, ti mina faa ɠaaɠa.›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 6:9">Eza 6:9</ref></char> bogɛ é zoloo Gɛlɛke woo zɛʋɛ wɔlɔmai ma.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 8:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Faalaalii zuɠulazuʋɛ <optbreak/> pilɛgai molo zuwu vaza nui ʋa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:18-23">Matiyo 13:18-23</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="MRK 4:13-20">Maleke 4:13-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 8:11"/>«Wɛlɛ faalaalii nii ʋoluʋɛ ʋa: Molo zuwui ɠa é ga GALA daawooi. <verse eid="LUK 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 8:12"/>Niiti ti molo zuwui zɔlɔɔgai pele ɠɛzɛi zu, naati ka ti wooi mɛnisu, naa ʋoluma Inɛgi ʋa, é kula ti-yiimaʋɛ, nii a kɛ ti mina ɠidaaleʋe, ti ʋa ɠizo. <verse eid="LUK 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 8:13"/>Zɔiti ti molo zuwui zɔlɔɔgai fasa lutui zu, naati ka ta wooi mɛnina, ta yeezeizu bu ga koozunɛ. Kɛlɛ ti la naa yɛsu ná, é ʋa zapelɔ, ta ɠidaaleʋezu nɔ yeeɠɛɠala go nɔ zu. Siɛgi zu tɛgai ʋaazu la, ta ɠalesu ma. <verse eid="LUK 8:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 8:14"/>Zɔiti ti molo zuwui zɔlɔɔgai ɠaingiti saama, naati ka ti wooi mɛnisu, kɛlɛ naa maa ɠa ɓɔɔlezu ga ziizoolɛi, naavoloi, ta etea yiimaɠɛɛi, ma waai ʋa ɠɛ é zeeli kpɔizu ma. <verse eid="LUK 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 8:15"/>Zɔiti ti molo zuwui zɔlɔɔgai zou ʋagɔi zu, naati ka ti wooi mɛnisu, ti makɛ ma kpaan ga ti-yiima ɲadegai, ta pagai. Toɠa waa ta-wooɠɛɠiladai maaʋele ma.»<verse eid="LUK 8:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Faalaalii é ʋilɛ <optbreak/> lanboi ʋa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:21-25">Maleke 4:21-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 8:16"/>«Nu nɔpɛ ge la ɗa ga lanboi ɠaazo, é ʋa dɔ aniɲakai wu, ɓaa betei wu, kɛlɛ toɠa ɗa sei lanbo zei anii ɠa, naa ɠa a kɛ zɔiti ti lɛɛzu pɛlɛi wu, ti wozakalagi ɠa. <verse eid="LUK 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 8:17"/>Tɔɔzei dɔɔɠuzu vaa nɔpɛ ge la ná, nii é la ɠulaa kɛlɛma. Dɔɔɠuzu vaa nɔpɛ ge la ná, nii é la ɠwɛɛga, é ʋa la wozakalagi ɠa. <verse eid="LUK 8:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 8:18"/>À dama mu ga wa-vaa mɛni pelei. Mazɔlɔɔ zɔi ani zea, ta ɠa ve naa ya ʋolu. Kɛlɛ zɔi ani la zea, anɛɛ zɔɔgoi é ɠisiɛzu ga toɠa zea, naa ɠa ɠula zea.»<verse eid="LUK 8:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ná-pɛlɛyeɠe ɠitei</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Matiyo 12:46-50</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Maleke 3:31-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 8:19"/>Yesu dee ta deɠeiti ti ʋaani pɔ bɛ, kɛlɛ ti la ɠɛni zeelini ma, tɔɔzei bɛbɛi ʋa. <verse eid="LUK 8:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 8:20"/>Nui ta ʋaani, é ɠɛ ma: «È-lee ta è-leɠeiti ta loni eteaʋɛ, ta pɔ ga ti è ɠa.» <verse eid="LUK 8:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 8:21"/>Kɛlɛ é gooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «Dèe ta dèɠeiti ka ga niiti ti GALA daawooi mɛnisu, ti ɠolo bɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 8:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu fiilɛ wolai ɠaayei vai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Matiyo 8:23-27</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="MRK 4:35-41">Maleke 4:35-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 8:22"/>Yeeta Yesu ta ná-kaladopoiti ti lɛɛni keingi zu, é ɠɛ ti ma: «Ade leʋe ziɛ ʋoluʋelei.» Ti liini. <verse eid="LUK 8:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 8:23"/>Ti ɠɛai ma keingi ɓizɛzu, Yesu ɲiini. Fiilɛ wolai lokoleʋeni ziɛi ɠa, keingi tɔɔzeini ga daa ɗa ve ga ziɛi, ti ɠɛ faaɓaagi zu. <verse eid="LUK 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 8:24"/>Ti maaɓuɠani Yesu ʋa, ti maaloɠa, ti ɠɛ ma: «Kalamɔn, kalamɔn, gi undaa ɠana ʋili!» É wuunni, é devei ve fiilɛi ta ziɛ lakpatakpagi ya ga sɛbɛi, naati suleʋe kpe, woza ɠaalɛi tɔɔntɔɔn. <verse eid="LUK 8:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 8:25"/>É ɠɛni ti ma: «Mini ɠa wa-ɠidaaleʋei ná?» Ti luani, ti laavɔ, ti ɗa ɓɔɠɔ ɠaazaɠa ga: «Ɓɛ ɠa é ga nii mu, é devei veezu vɔlɔ fiilɛi ta ziɛi ya, ti ɗa ɠolo gooi ʋɛ?»<verse eid="LUK 8:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu inɛ su nui ʋalo vai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Matiyo 8:28-34</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="MRK 5:1-20">Maleke 5:1-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 8:26"/>Ti zeelini Gelase nuiti ta-yooi zu, nii é ziɛ ʋoluʋelei, gaaʋotegai Galilé yooi ma. <verse eid="LUK 8:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 8:27"/>Pilɛsuʋɛ zooi ma, taai naa zu zunui ta daaɠomini, nii inɛgiti ti ɠɛni su. Kaite é la mɔ ɠɛni seɠe loozu ɠɔba, ta é la mɔ ɠɛni ɲiizu pɛlɛ wu, kɛni kabamaʋɛ. <verse eid="LUK 8:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 8:28"/>É Yesu ɠaai ma, é ɓainni, é loo kɔɠɔwu, é bo ga woo wola, é ɠɛ ma: «GALA nii é Anii-Pɛ-Unda, naa ná-Doun Zunui Yesu, lee ɠa è pɔ ga è sei mà? Nà è maanɛɛnɛzu, mina kpɔ̀lɔ!» <verse eid="LUK 8:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 8:29"/>Tɔɔzei Yesu devei veeni kɔzɔba yɛnvui ya, ga é ɠula zunui naa zu. (Zɛnvu ɲɔi lɔɔni su kaite yeeɠɛɠala mɔinmɔin su. Ti ɓena makɛ giliai ga yɔlɔɠɔiti, ti kɔluiti pili kɔɠɔiti ba, kɛlɛ é ɓena ti zuɠaleɠale, inɛgi lii la teʋebai zu.)<verse eid="LUK 8:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 8:30"/>Yesu gaazaɠani, é ɠɛ ma: «È-laasei ka ga lee?» É naa wooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «Dàa ɠa ga ‹Ma Ɓulugi›,» mazɔlɔɔ inɛ mɔinmɔin ka é ɠɛni su. <verse eid="LUK 8:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 8:31"/>Inɛgi naati ti Yesu maanɛɛnɛni ga é mina ti leve ga ti ʋa li zeɠezaɠa ɓokulagi zu.<verse eid="LUK 8:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 8:32"/>Boi kpulu gola ɠɛni laamiizu náʋɛ, gizei ma. Inɛgiti ti Yesu maanɛɛnɛni gola ga é va bu, ti lɔ boigiti su. É vaani naa wu. <verse eid="LUK 8:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 8:33"/>Inɛgiti ti ɠulani zunui zu, ti lɔ boigiti su. Boi kpulugi yeini ga kpizɛ gize ɠakazuʋɛ, ti ʋu ziɛi wu, ti yɛ bu nɔ mɛtu.<verse eid="LUK 8:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 8:34"/>Boi makɛ nuiti ti naama vai ɠaai ma, ti ʋelani, ti ma wooi laazeeli taa wolai zu, ta ɓalaɠaiti su. <verse eid="LUK 8:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 8:35"/>Nuiti ti liini, ti naama vai ɠa, nii kɛai. Ti ʋaani Yesu ɠobaʋɛ, ti zunui ɠa, nii inɛgiti ti ɠulani su. É zeini Yesu ɠɔɠɔwu, seɠei kɔba, kigi ma ga pagɔ. Nuiti ti wola luani. <verse eid="LUK 8:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 8:36"/>Zɔiti ti naa ɠaani, nii é ɠɛɛni, ti ɠɛni naa zuɠulazu ti ma, ʋelei inɛ su nui ʋaloai la. <verse eid="LUK 8:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 8:37"/>Gelase nuɓusɛiti pɛ ti ɠɛni Yesu ma, é ɠula ta-yooi ʋa. Tɔɔzei dualua golai ti zoni. Yesu lɛɛni keingi zu, é ɠale ma. <verse eid="LUK 8:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 8:38"/>Zunui nii inɛgiti ti ɠulani su, naa Yesu maanɛɛnɛni ga tɔun é ʋilɛ Yesu ʋolu. Kɛlɛ Yesu gaaɠaleni ma, é ɠɛ ma: <verse eid="LUK 8:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 8:39"/>«Ɠale ma ɗa-ʋɛlɛi wu, è naa laazeeli, nii GALA ge kɛa è ʋɛ.» Zunui naa zɛba é li, é naa pɛ daazeeli taa wolai zu ná pɛ, nii Yesu kɛɛni bɛ.<verse eid="LUK 8:39"/></para>
  <para style="s">Zayiluse ná-doun anzanui <optbreak/> ta ɲama ɠula koozu anzanui</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Matiyo 9:18-26</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="MRK 5:21-43">Maleke 5:21-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 8:40"/>Siɛgi zu Yesu ɠaleni la ma, bɛbɛi daaɠomini, mazɔlɔɔ ti ɠɛni kpɔunsu. <verse eid="LUK 8:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 8:41"/>GALA dɛbi ʋɛlɛi ma ɠundiɠii gila ge ʋaani, nii daa ɠɛni ga Zayiluse. É looni Yesu ɠɔɠɔwu, é maanɛɛnɛ ga naa li ná-pɛlɛi wu, <verse eid="LUK 8:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 8:42"/>tɔɔzei anzanu loun gila kpegi é ɠɛni zea, ná-konagi ga puugɔ maazu felegɔ (12) ɠɛɠala, naa ɠɛni niina zaazu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:42">Yesu liizuʋɛ ná, bɛbɛi ɠɛni kpatasu. <verse eid="LUK 8:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 8:43"/>Anzanui ta ɠɛni ná, nii é kɛɛni ɲama ɠula koozu zeeɓɛi zu ga kona puugɔ maazu felegɔ (12). É kɔligi pɛ kwɛɛni ɗɔɠɔtɔlɔiti pɔ bɛti, kɛlɛ tanɔpɛ ge la zooni é ʋa kɛdɛ. <verse eid="LUK 8:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 8:44"/>É maaɓuɠani Yesu ʋa ga poluʋelei, é yeevɔɔɠu ná-seɠei laamaʋɛ ʋa. Gaamago, ná-ɲama ɠula koozui maaleʋeni.<verse eid="LUK 8:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 8:45"/>Yesu gaazaɠagi woni, é ɠɛ ma: «Ɓɛ ɠa fɔɔɠuai bà?» Tɛi ɛsɛ pɛ ge ɠɛni zeɠezu ga, Piyɛlɛ ɠɛni ma: «Kalamɔn, bɛbɛi ɠakugɛ è ma, ti ɗa ziɠaziɠa è ʋa.» <verse eid="LUK 8:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 8:46"/>Kɛlɛ Yesu ɠɛni ma: «Nui ta vɔɔɠuʋɛ bà, tɔɔzei gè gaaɠaaʋɛ ga zɛbɛi ta ɠulaʋɛ sù.»<verse eid="LUK 8:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 8:47"/>Anzanui kaai ma ga poluɠulaa, é yɛni ɓalizu, é ʋa, é loo Yesu ɠɔɠɔwu, é naa pɛ suɠula nuɓusɛi pɛ gaazu, nii é kɛai fɔɔɠuai Yesu ʋa, ta ʋelei é ɠɛdɛni la gaamago. <verse eid="LUK 8:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 8:48"/>Yesu ɠɛni ma: «Dòun anzanu, tɛi è laa dà, è ʋaloa. Li ziilɛigi zu.»<verse eid="LUK 8:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 8:49"/>Yesu yɛni nɔ ɓɔɛzu, keela zeɠe GALA dɛbi ʋɛlɛi ma ɠundiɠii ná-koizuʋɛ, é ɠɛ ma: «È-loun anzanui zaa, mina mɔ kalamɔin ɓɔlɔ.» <verse eid="LUK 8:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 8:50"/>Kɛlɛ Yesu naa mɛnigai ma, é ɠɛni Zayiluse ma: «Mina lua. Ɠidaaleʋe nɔ, toɠa ʋalo.»<verse eid="LUK 8:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 8:51"/>Seeliai ma pɛlɛi wu, é la ɠɛni vaani bu nu ɠili ge ʋa lɛ, kɛni Piyɛlɛ, Zan ta Zake, naa ʋɛɛ doun kɛɛɠɛi ʋa ta doun deei. <verse eid="LUK 8:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 8:52"/>Ti pɛ ti ɠɛni wɔlɔzu ma, ti ɗa ɓɔɠɔ maawɔin. Yesu ɠɛni ti ma: «À mina wɔlɔ, tɔɔzei é la zaani, toɠa ɲiizu nɔ.» <verse eid="LUK 8:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 8:53"/>Kɛlɛ nuiti ti ɠɛni ɲɛɛɠulazu su, tɔɔzei ti ɠɛni kwɛɛni ga anzanu loungoi zaaʋɛ. <verse eid="LUK 8:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 8:54"/>É naa zoni zeei ʋa, é wooɠula, é ɠɛ ma: «Doungo, wuzeɠe!» <verse eid="LUK 8:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 8:55"/>Naa yɛnvui ʋuuni su ʋolu, é wuzeɠe gaamanɔ. Yesu devei veeni ga ti daamiani fe zea. <verse eid="LUK 8:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 8:56"/>Anzanu loungoi zɔlɔɔ nuiti ti laavɔɔni. Kɛlɛ Yesu ti leveni ga ti mina naama vai wo nu nɔpɛ ma, nii kɛai.<verse eid="LUK 8:56"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="LUK 9"/>
  <para style="s">Keela puugɔ maazu felegɔiti (12) <optbreak/> teʋe fai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:5-15">Matiyo 10:5-15</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="MRK 6:7-13">Maleke 6:7-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 9:1"/>Yesu keela puugɔ maazu felegɔiti (12) gaalɛai ma ba, é gaaɓaai ta zobogi ve ti ya inɛgiti pɛ unda, ta seeɓɛ nuiti kɛdɛ sɛbɛi. <verse eid="LUK 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 9:2"/>É ti leʋeni ga ti GALA ná-masadai ma vai laazeeli, ta ti seeɓɛ nuiti kɛdɛ. <verse eid="LUK 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 9:3"/>É ɠɛni ti ma: «À mina ani nɔpɛ seɠe siɛi wo fai zu. À mina tukpɔ zeɠe, ɓaa ɓɔlɔ, ɓaa ɠɔnɔ, ɓaa wali. Seɠewuzeɠe felegɔ mina ɠɛ wo ya. <verse eid="LUK 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 9:4"/>Pɛlɛ nɔpɛ wo lɛɛzu bu, à yɛ ná, eyɛsu wo zeɠena yeeɠɛɠalai zeeli. <verse eid="LUK 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 9:5"/>Ʋɛ nɔpɛ nuiti ti la yeezeini ná wo wu, à ɠula taai naa ʋa, wo fufiligi ɓukpunɛ, é ɠula wo-ɠɔɠɔiti ma, é ɠɛ ga zeele wooi ti laalɔɠɔma.»<verse eid="LUK 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 9:6"/>Ti liini, ti leʋeteʋe taaiti su, ti Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi laazeeli, ti ɗa seeɓɛ nuiti kɛdɛ ada pɛ.<verse eid="LUK 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ná-tɔɠɔɠulagi <optbreak/> Elɔde ɠoozu ʋili fai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:1-12">Matiyo 14:1-12</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="MRK 6:14-29">Maleke 6:14-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 9:7"/>Galilé masagi Elɔde naa mɛnini, nii é ɠɛɛni. Koozu ʋilini, mazɔlɔɔ nui tanigaa ti ɠɛni ɠɛɛzu ma: «Zan ɠa buzeɠeai, é ɠula saai ya.» <verse eid="LUK 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 9:8"/>Taɠiligaa ti ɗa ɠɛ ma: «Eli ɠa kulaai kɛlɛma.» Zɔiti ti ɗa ɠɛ ma: «GALA goo wo nu wɔlɔwɔlɔgi ta ɠa buzeɠeai, é ɠula saai ya.» <verse eid="LUK 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 9:9"/>Elɔde ɠɛni ma: «Gè devei ʋeeni ga ti Zan unteʋe, kɛlɛ ɓɛ ɠa ga zunui tɛi, gè nii ɠɛɠala vaiti mɛnisu, é lo ba?» É ɠɛni pele goi pɛ gaiziɛzu ga ti ɠa.<verse eid="LUK 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu zunu waadɔɔlugɔi (5.000) <optbreak/> ɠɔnɔkula vai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Matiyo 14:13-21</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Maleke 6:30-44</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Zan 6:1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 9:10"/>Keelaiti ti ɠalegai ma ma, ti ʋoluvaawoni Yesu ma ga nii ti kɛai. Naa ʋoluma, é ti zeɠeni, é li ga tiye taa wolai ta ɠobaʋɛ, daa ga Ɓɛtesayida. <verse eid="LUK 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 9:11"/>Bɛbɛi looni ga ná, ti ʋilɛ Yesu ʋolu. Yesu yeezeini ti wu, é ɠɛni GALA ná-masadai ma vai wosu ti ma, é ɗa naati kɛdɛ, niiti ti ɓɛdɛi ɠɛni kɛdɛgi ʋa.<verse eid="LUK 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 9:12"/>Foloi tɔɔzeini ga lia. Keela puugɔ maazu felegɔiti (12) ti maaɓuɠani Yesu ʋa, ti ɠɛ ma: «Bɛbɛi ɠaaɠale ma, ti li ʋɛ ɠoba laa goiti ta ɓalaɠaiti su, ɠɔnɔgi ta ɲiizu zɔlɔɔ náti, tɔɔzei ada teʋebai zu.» <verse eid="LUK 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 9:13"/>Yesu ɠɛni ti ma: «Wa ɓɔɠɔi à ɠɔnɔ fe ti ya.» Kɛlɛ ti ɠɛni ma: «Ɓulu lɔɔlugɔ ta kale felegɔ nɔ ɠa é gi ya. Kɛni, ni gá liizu, gi ɠɔnɔ geya niima nuɓusɛi pɛ bɛ.» <verse eid="LUK 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 9:14"/>Zunu waadɔɔlugɔ (5.000) ɠɛɠala ɠa é ɠɛni ná. Yesu ɠɛni ná-kaladopoiti ma: «À ti zei ga nu ʋuulɔɔludɔɔlugi (50).»<verse eid="LUK 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 9:15"/>Kaladopoiti ti naa ɠɛɛni, ti nuiti pɛ seini. <verse eid="LUK 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 9:16"/>Yesu ɓulu lɔɔlugɔi ta kale felegɔiti seɠeni, é ɠaazulɛ geezu, é mama fee ƓALA falii wo. Naa ʋolu é ɓuluiti kpulukpuluni, é ma ɓuɠaiti fe kaladopoiti zea ga ti gaaɠwɛ bɛbɛi ʋa. <verse eid="LUK 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 9:17"/>Ɛsɛ pɛ ge daamii woni, ti yiɠo. Kaladopoiti ti ɓulu ɓulukpulugi mɔtai ɠaalɛɛni ba, é ɠɛ ga kpɔlɔ puugɔ maazu felegɔ (12).<verse eid="LUK 9:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Piyɛlɛ Yesu ɠwɛɛ fai ga Kilista</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:13-19">Matiyo 16:13-19</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="MRK 8:27-29">Maleke 8:27-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 9:18"/>Yeeta, Yesu ɠɛni adɛ ta yɛ, é ɗa GALA falii wo, ná-kaladopoiti ti ɠɛni ba. É ti ɠaazaɠani, é ɠɛ ma: «Bɛbɛi ɠa ɠɛɛzu nà ga ɓɛ?» <verse eid="LUK 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 9:19"/>Ti gooɠaaʋoteni, ti ɠɛ ma: «Tanigaa ti ɠɛ, ɗa ga Zan Ɓatisete, zɔiti ti ɠɛ Eli, taɠiligaa ti ɠɛ, ɗa ga GALA goo wo nu wɔlɔwɔlɔgi ta, nii buzeɠeai, é ɠula saai ya.» <verse eid="LUK 9:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 9:20"/>É zɛba é ɠɛ ti ma: «Wɔun, wa ma, wo ɠɛ nà ga ɓɛ?» Piyɛlɛ gooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «Ɗa ga è ga Mesi, nii GALA ge teʋegai.»<verse eid="LUK 9:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu saa vai ta buzeɠe vai wo fai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:21-23">Matiyo 16:21-23</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="MRK 8:31-33">Maleke 8:31-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 9:21"/>Yesu ti laa maaɓakpani ga ti mina naama wooi wo nu nɔpɛ ma, <verse eid="LUK 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 9:22"/>é ɠɛni ti ma mɔnɔ: «Kɛni Nu ná-Doun Zunui kpɔlɔ mɔinmɔin sɔlɔɔ, totuɠɔiti ti ɠɛlɛ ba, ta zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠiiti, naa ʋɛɛ tɔ kalamɔinti ba. Kɛni ti paa, naa ʋolu é wuzeɠe, é ɠula saai ya foloi zaʋasiɛi.»<verse eid="LUK 9:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nu ʋilɛ pelei Yesu ʋolu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:24-28">Matiyo 16:24-28</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="MRK 8:34-9:1">Maleke 8:34—9:1</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 9:23"/>Naa ʋoluma Yesu ɠɛni ti pɛ ma: «Zɔi é pɔ ga é ʋilɛ pòlu, kɛni é ɠikula ɓɔɠɔ zu, é zaa wului zeɠe folo-o-folo, é ʋilɛ pòlu. <verse eid="LUK 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 9:24"/>Tɔɔzei zɔi é pɔ é zɛnvui ɠizo, naama nui ɠa ʋala ma. Kɛlɛ zɔi a ʋala zɛnvui ma nà-faa zu, naama nui ɠa zɛnvui ɠizo. <verse eid="LUK 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 9:25"/>Ni nui ta a etea zɔlɔɔ ganii pɛ sɔlɔɔna, kɛlɛ é ʋala zɛnvui ma, kulanuma ɓɛgele ɠa é bɛ? <verse eid="LUK 9:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 9:26"/>Mazɔlɔɔ zɔi a unfe ga ze ta dàawooiti, Nu ná-Doun Zunui ɠa unfe ga naama nui, siɛgi zu é ʋaazu la ná-lɛbiyai zu, naa ʋɛɛ Kɛɛɠɛ ta geezuɠeela ɲadegaiti ta-lɛbiyai ʋa. <verse eid="LUK 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 9:27"/>Gè bo wo ma ga gaamai, tanigaa ta ʋɛ, ti la zaa, eyɛsu ti ɠaazula GALA ná-masadai ma.»<verse eid="LUK 9:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ɠaazuʋɛ valibo fai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:1-8">Matiyo 17:1-8</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="MRK 9:2-8">Maleke 9:2-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 9:28"/>Naama wooiti bogai ma foloi lɔsaʋa leʋeni, Yesu Piyɛlɛ ta Zan zeɠeni, é ʋɛɛ Zake ʋa, é lɛ gizei ma, GALA fali wo fai ma. <verse eid="LUK 9:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 9:29"/>Kɛai ma GALA falizu, gaazuʋɛ valiboni, ná-seɠeiti ti ɠole, ti ɗa volo eɠɛ mainmain. <verse eid="LUK 9:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 9:30"/>Gaamago, zunu felegɔ ɠɛni yɛpɛzu pɔ. Moize ta Eli ɠɛni de. <verse eid="LUK 9:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 9:31"/>Ti ɠulani kɛlɛma lɛbiyai zu, ti ɠɛni ná-saa vai wosu, é ʋaazu daazeelizu Zeluzalɛme. <verse eid="LUK 9:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 9:32"/>Piyɛlɛ ta bɔɔlaiti ti ɠɛni ɲiizu poun. Kɛlɛ ti wuungai ma, ti Yesu ná-lɛbiyai ɠaani, ta zunu felegɔiti ti ɠɛni loni kobaʋɛ. <verse eid="LUK 9:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 9:33"/>Zunui naati seɠezuʋɛ Yesu ɠoba, Piyɛlɛ ɠɛni ma: «Kalamɔn, soloogɛ ga ade yɛ ʋɛ. Gá kota saʋagɔ lo, gilagi ɠɛ ga ɗɔnɔi, gilagi ɠɛ ga Moize nɔnɔi, zɔi ɠɛ ga Eli nɔnɔi.» É la ɠɛni kwɛɛni, nii é bosu.<verse eid="LUK 9:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 9:34"/>Siɛgi zu é ɠɛni ɓɔɛzu la ɠana, tonaɓiingi ʋaani, é ti maaɓidi. Kaladopoiti ti wola luani, siɛgi zu tonaɓiingi lɔɔni la ti unga. <verse eid="LUK 9:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 9:35"/>Wooi ta ɠulani tonaɓiingi naa zu, é ɠɛ ma: «Nii ɠa é ga Dòun Zunui, nii gè yiimazeɠeai la. À woilo goo ma ɗɛ!» <verse eid="LUK 9:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 9:36"/>Naama wooi mɛnigai ma, Yesu ɠila kpe nɔ ɠa é ɠɛni ná niina. Naama voloiti su, kaladopoiti ti maaɠɛni kpɔ, ti la ɠɛni naama vai ta woni nu nɔpɛ ma, nii ti kaani.<verse eid="LUK 9:36"/></para>
  <para style="s">Inɛ su loungoi ɠɛdɛ fai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:14-18">Matiyo 17:14-18</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="MRK 9:14-27">Maleke 9:14-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 9:37"/>Poluma voloi ti zeɠeai ma gizei ma, ti yei, bɛbɛ wolai ʋaani Yesu laaɠomisu. <verse eid="LUK 9:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 9:38"/>Bɛbɛi naa zaama zunui ta kpee looni, é ɠɛ ma: «Kalamɔn, nà è maanɛɛnɛzu, dòun zunui maawɔinɠa, mazɔlɔɔ tɔ ɠila nɔ ɠa é zèa ga doun zunui! <verse eid="LUK 9:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 9:39"/>Zɛnvu ɲɔi ɠa ɗa zeɠe la, gaamago nɔ é ɗa ɓain, zɛnvu ɲɔi ɗa kpali gola, daaɗɛ ɲagi ɗa ʋu, kula vai ɠa ɗa ɓaa su, kɛni a maawana na. <verse eid="LUK 9:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 9:40"/>Gè ɗa-ɠaladopoiti maanɛɛnɛʋɛ ga ti kpɛ su, kɛlɛ ti la zooni.»<verse eid="LUK 9:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 9:41"/>Yesu ɠɛni ma: «Ee, kidaaleʋelala nuɓusɛiti ti ɲɔuɗai, nà yɛsu wo ʋa dɛ, eyɛsu yeelɛ? Nà yeezei wo wu, eyɛsu yeelɛ? Ʋa ʋɛ ga è-loin.» <verse eid="LUK 9:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 9:42"/>Tɛi é ɠɛni maaɓuɠazu, inɛgi doungoi ʋilini ya zooi ma, é ɗa kpali. Kɛlɛ Yesu devei veeni kɔzɔba yɛnvui ya ga sɛbɛi, é doungoi ɠɛdɛ, é fe kɛɛ ya. <verse eid="LUK 9:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 9:43"/>Ti pɛ ti laavɔɔni ga GALA sɛbɛi wɔɔlɔ ʋelei.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="LUK 9:43">Yesu saa vai wo fai ʋolu</para>
  <para style="r" vid="LUK 9:43">(<ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">Matiyo 17:22-23</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="MRK 9:30-32">Maleke 9:30-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:43">Tɛi ti pɛ ti laa ɠɛni vɔɔzu ga niiti Yesu ɠɛni ti ɠɛɛzu, Yesu ɠɛni ná-kaladopoiti ma: <verse eid="LUK 9:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 9:44"/>«À woilo nii ma, gè bosu wo ma: Nu ná-Doun Zunui ɠa ʋaazu lɔɔzu nuiti zeezu.» <verse eid="LUK 9:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 9:45"/>Kɛlɛ kaladopoiti ti la ɠɛni naama ɓɔɛi ɠaaɠaani. Gaaɓidini ti ɠaazu, ti la poluɠwɛɛni, tama ti ɠɛni luazu ga ti ʋa gaazaɠa naama vai ma.<verse eid="LUK 9:45"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ɓɛ ɠa bɔɔlɔai ɛsɛ pɛ ba?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Matiyo 18:1-5</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Maleke 9:33-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 9:46"/>Maaɠaalii ta wuzeɠeni naazu kaladopoiti zɔɠɔzu ga ti ʋa kwɛɛ zɔi bɔɔlɔai ti zaama. <verse eid="LUK 9:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 9:47"/>Yesu ti ɠoozu ɠisiɛi ɠwɛɛgai ma, é doungoi ta zeɠeni, é pilɛ ɠobaʋɛ, <verse eid="LUK 9:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 9:48"/>é ɠɛ ti ma: «Zɔi nɔpɛ a yeezei doungoi nii wu nɔ̀un maaʋele ma, naama nui yeezeiɗa bù, nà ɓɔɠɔi. Zɔi a yeezei bù, é yeezeiɗa ɓalaa tèʋe nui wu. Mazɔlɔɔ zɔi dɔiɗai wo pɛ saama, naa ɠa bɔɔlɔai.»<verse eid="LUK 9:48"/></para>
  <para style="s">Zɔi é la wo laalɔɠɔma, naa ɠa wo ʋa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:38-40">Maleke 9:38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 9:49"/>Zan ɠɛni ma: «Kalamɔn, gi zunui ta ɠaaʋɛ, é ɗa inɛgiti kpɛ è-laaseigi zu. Gi ɠɛni pɔ ga gi pele leʋe tuɠɔ, mazɔlɔɔ é la ʋilɛsu ade ʋolu.» <verse eid="LUK 9:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 9:50"/>Kɛlɛ Yesu ɠɛni ma: «À mina pele leʋe tuɠɔ, mazɔlɔɔ zɔi é la wo laalɔɠɔma, naa ɠa wo ʋa.»<verse eid="LUK 9:50"/></para>
  <para style="s">Samali laai gila kɛlɛ vai Yesu ʋa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 9:51"/>Siɛgi maaɓuɠaai ma, ga é lɛ geeɠɔlɔgi zu, é deveni ga kɛni nɔ é li kpae Zeluzalɛme. <verse eid="LUK 9:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 9:52"/>É keelaiti teʋeni luɠɔʋelei, naati ti liini, ti lɛ Samali laai ta zu kɛʋele ɓɛtɛ vai zu bɛ. <verse eid="LUK 9:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 9:53"/>Kɛlɛ taaʋeaiti ti la ɠɛni yeezeini bu, mazɔlɔɔ é ɠɛni liizu ga Zeluzalɛme ʋele. <verse eid="LUK 9:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 9:54"/>Kaladopoiti Zake ta Zan ti miná ɠaai ma, ti ɠɛni ma: «Màliɠii, ɗa va bu, gi abui maaloli, é zeɠe geezuʋɛ, é ti ɠɛ ga zuʋui?» <verse eid="LUK 9:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 9:55"/>Yesu ɠaaʋoteni ti ma, é zelii lo ti ma.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:55 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Niima wooiti pɛɛʋɛ ba sɛʋɛ wɔlɔmai tanigaa zu: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">É ɠɛ ma: «Wo la kwɛɛ zɛnvui ma zii, nii é wo zu. Mazɔlɔɔ Nu ná-Doun Zunui la ʋaani nuɓusɛiti zɛnvui undaaʋili faa ma, kɛni ti ɠizo fai».</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 9:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 9:56"/>Naa ʋolu, ti liini taa ɠili su.<verse eid="LUK 9:56"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nu fai pɛ zɛ ná, è ʋilɛ Yesu ʋolu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:19-22">Matiyo 8:19-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 9:57"/>Ti ɠɛai ma pelei zu, zunui ta ɠɛni Yesu ma: «Ʋɛ nɔpɛ è liizu ná, nà ʋilɛsu è ʋolu.» <verse eid="LUK 9:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 9:58"/>Yesu gooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «Zeɠei ɠa zazagoiti bɛ, daɠagi ɠɛ wɔniiti bɛ, kɛlɛ ada la Nu ná-Doun Zunui ʋɛ, ʋɛ a ungi la ná.»<verse eid="LUK 9:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 9:59"/>É ɠɛni taɠili ma: «Ʋilɛ pòlu.» Naa gooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «Màliɠii, va bu, gè li dɛ, gè kɛ̀ɛ maaɠulu.» <verse eid="LUK 9:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 9:60"/>Yesu ɠɛni ma: «Gɔvɛiti zɛ ná, ti ta-ʋoomaiti maaɠulu. Ɗɔun, li, è GALA ná-masadai ma vai laazeeli.»<verse eid="LUK 9:60"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 9:61"/>Taɠili ge ɠɛ ma: «Nà ʋilɛ è ʋolu, Maliɠii, kɛlɛ ɓɛ dɛ, gè li, gè vali nà-bolodai ma.» <verse eid="LUK 9:61"/><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 9:62"/>Yesu ɠɛni ma: «Zɔi é yeeʋɛɛzu kalii ma, é ɗa wɛlɛ ga ʋoluʋelei, naa la zolooni GALA ná-masadai ma.»<verse eid="LUK 9:62"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="LUK 10"/>
  <para style="s">Nu ʋuulɔfela maazu felegɔiti (72) <optbreak/> teʋe fai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 10:1"/>Naama vaiti poluma, Maliɠii yeeloni kaladopo ʋuulɔfela maazu felegɔ (72) ɠiligaa ʋa, é ti leʋe luɠɔ ga nu velefele taaiti pɛ su, ta adɛti pɛ, ʋɛti tɔ ɓɔɠɔi ɠɛni ʋaazu liizu náti. <verse eid="LUK 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 10:2"/>É ɠɛni ɠɛɛzu ti ma: «Molo mɔɔi wola zuwɔɔlɔʋɛ, kɛlɛ botiɠɛ nuiti ti la mɔinni. À kpala kɛɛ nui maanɛɛnɛ mu, é botiɠɛ nuiti teʋe ná-molo leʋezuʋɛ. <verse eid="LUK 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 10:3"/>À li! Nà wo leʋesu eɠɛ baala ziʋoiti, zuluɓuiti saama. <verse eid="LUK 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 10:4"/>À mina wali ʋuu ɓɔlɔ zeɠe ya, ɓaa ɓɔlɔ, ɓaa saʋala. À mina nɛkɛ pelei ma ga daalima vaa.<verse eid="LUK 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 10:5"/>«Wa lɛɛna pɛlɛ nɔpɛ bu, à ɠɛ ma dɛ: ‹Ziilɛigi ɠɛ pɛlɛi nii ʋɛ!› <verse eid="LUK 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 10:6"/>Ni ziilɛi nu ɠa pɛlɛi naa wu, wa-yiilɛigi ɠa yɛ ba. Ni naa laade, tɔun toɠa ɠaaɠale ma wo ʋɔ. <verse eid="LUK 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 10:7"/>À yɛ pɛlɛi naa wu, ɠɔnɔ nɔpɛ ta fe wo ya, à mi, kpɔɔle ani nɔpɛ ta fe wo ya, wo naa ɓɔle, mazɔlɔɔ botiɠɛ nui maanɛɛʋɛ é zalai zɔlɔɔ. À mina ɗa ga wo laa ʋɛlɛi maavalibofalibo.<verse eid="LUK 10:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 10:8"/>«Taai nɔpɛ wa lɛ su, ti yeezei wo wu, nii ta fe wo ya, à mi, <verse eid="LUK 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 10:9"/>wo seeɓɛ nuiti balo, niiti ta ɠɛ ná, wo ɠɛ ti ma: ‹GALA ná-masadai maaɓuɠaa wo ʋa.› <verse eid="LUK 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 10:10"/>Kɛlɛ taai nɔpɛ wo lɛɛzu su, ti la yeezeini wo wu, à li koi zaamaʋɛ, wo ɠɛ ma: <verse eid="LUK 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 10:11"/>‹Anɛɛ wa-laazuʋɛ vufiligi nii pɛai gi-ɠɔɠɔiti ma, gá kpukpunɛsu wo laalɔɠɔma. Naa pɛ poluma, à kwɛɛ ga GALA ná-masadai maaɓuɠaa.› <verse eid="LUK 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 10:12"/>Gè bo wo ma, tukpɔɠaaleʋe voloi, taai naa ná-tukpɔi ɠa ɓaa, é leʋe Sɔdɔme nɔnɔi ʋa.<verse eid="LUK 10:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kidaaleʋelala laaiti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:20-24">Matiyo 11:20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 10:13"/>«Maanɔɠɔi ɠa è ʋɛ, Kolazɛn, maanɔɠɔi ɠɛ è ʋɛ, Ɓɛtesayida! Mazɔlɔɔ laavɔɔ vai niiti ti ɠɛai wo ʋɔ bɛ, ni naa ɠɛɠalai ɠɛɛni Tiil ta Sidɔn laaiti su, eɠɛ kaite ti zu nuɓusɛiti ti ti-ziɛ ʋelei maavaliboga, ti saa wɔlɔ wo seɠeiti too ɠɔba, ti zuʋui ʋu tɔungiti su. <verse eid="LUK 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 10:14"/>Naa ɠa é ba, tukpɔɠaaleʋe voloi, wa-lukpɔi ɠa ɓaa, é leʋe Tiil ta Sidɔn laaiti tɔnɔi ʋa. <verse eid="LUK 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 10:15"/>Ɗɔun, Kapɛɛlɛnawume, ɗa kaazu ga è-lɔɠɔi ɠa wɔɔlɔzu, è zeeli geeɠɔlɔgi zu ɓaa? Naa li poun! Ta è yei gɔvɛalaazu.»<verse eid="LUK 10:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 10:16"/>Yesu ɠɛni kaladopoiti ma ʋolu: «Zɔi é woilosu wo-woo ma, naama nui woiloga gòo ma. Zɔi é ɠɛlɛzu wo ʋa, naama nui ɠɛlɛa bà. Zɔi é ɠɛlɛzu bà, naama nui ɠɛlɛa tèʋe nui ʋa.»<verse eid="LUK 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kaladopo ʋuulɔfela maazu felegɔiti (72) <optbreak/> ta-ʋoluvaawogi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 10:17"/>Kaladopo ʋuulɔfela maazu felegɔiti (72) ti ɠaleni ma ga koozunɛɛi, ti ɗa ɠɛ ma: «Màliɠii, inɛgiti ɓalaa ti ɠoloʋɛ gi ʋɛ è-laaseigi zu!» <verse eid="LUK 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 10:18"/>Yesu ti wooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ti ma: «Gè Setana ɠaani, é ɗa ɠula geezuʋɛ, é ɗa loo bu eɠɛ mainmain. <verse eid="LUK 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 10:19"/>Wɛlɛ, gè zobogi veeʋɛ wo ya ga wo ziɛ kaaliiti ta akuɠɔtɔkaaliiti ma, naa ʋɛɛ sili nui ná-zɛbɛiti pɛ ba. Ani nɔpɛ ge la faa ɲɔu ɠɛa ga woye. <verse eid="LUK 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 10:20"/>Anɛɛ naa ʋe, à mina ɠoozunɛ tɔɔzei zɛnvuiti ti ɠoloni wo ʋɛ, kɛlɛ à ɠoozunɛ mazɔlɔɔ wo-laaseigiti ti zɛʋɛa geeɠɔlɔgi zu.»<verse eid="LUK 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi kulaai <optbreak/> zeemalɔi nuiti bɛ kɛlɛma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:25-27">Matiyo 11:25-27</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="MAT 13:16-17">13:16-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 10:21"/>Naama yeeɠɛɠalai nɔ, Zɛnvu Ɲadegai Yesu laaveni ga koozunɛɛi, é zɛba é ɠɛ ma: «Ee, Kɛ̀ɛ, geeɠɔlɔgi ta zooi Maliɠii, nà è mamasu, tɔɔzei è niima vaiti dɔɔɠua ɠima nuiti ta keleɠele nuiti ba, è ti lɛ ga naati, niiti ti yeemalɔigai. Gaamazu, Kɛ̀ɛ, ʋele ɠana nɛai la è ʋɛ. <verse eid="LUK 10:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 10:22"/>Kɛ̀ɛ fai pɛ puuʋɛ zèezu. Nu nɔpɛ ge la Doun Zunui ɠwɛɛ, é ɠula Ɠɛɛɠɛi ʋolu, tama nu nɔpɛ ge la ɓalaa Ɠɛɛɠɛi ɠwɛɛ, é ɠula Doun Zunui ʋolu, ta naama nui nii Doun Zunui a ɠɛna pɔ é dɛɛ la.»<verse eid="LUK 10:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 10:23"/>Naa ʋoluma Yesu latini ná-kaladopoiti ma yɛ, é ɠɛ ti ma: «Undaanɛ nu ɠa ga naama nuiti, niiti ti niima vaiti kaazu, niiti wo ti ɠaazu. <verse eid="LUK 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 10:24"/>Mazɔlɔɔ gè bo wo ma, GALA goo wo nu mɔinmɔin, ta masa mɔinmɔingaa ti ɠɛni pɔ ga ti naa ɠa, nii wo kaazu, kɛlɛ ti la kaani, ti naa mɛni, nii wo mɛnisu, kɛlɛ ti la mɛnini.»<verse eid="LUK 10:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Faalaalii é ʋilɛ <optbreak/> Samali zunu ʋagɔi ʋa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 10:25"/>Tɔ kalamɔin gila ge wuzeɠeni Yesu zuɠɔɠɔ faa ma, é ɠɛ ma: «Kalamɔn, nà kɛ ɠale, gè ʋa ɠɔoɠɔ zɛnvui zɔlɔɔ ga nɔ̀nɔ?» <verse eid="LUK 10:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 10:26"/>Naa gooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «Leeni ɠa sɛʋɛai GALA ná-tɔgi zu? Ɗa gaaɠaazu ɠale?» <verse eid="LUK 10:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 10:27"/>É Yesu wooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «Ɗa Maliɠii ɗa-ƓALAGI nɛɛ ʋɛ, ga è-yii pɛ, ta è-yɛnvui pɛ, naa ʋɛɛ è-zuvikɛi ta ɗa-ɠisiɛi pɛ ba.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 6:5">TSV 6:5</ref></char>.</char></note> Naa ʋoluma, ɗa è-zeiɲɔɠɔi nɛɛ ʋɛ, eɠɛ ɗa ɓɔɠɔi.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="LEV 19:18">Lev 19:18</ref></char>.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 10:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 10:28"/>Yesu ɠɛ ma: «È gaaʋotega ga pagɔ. Naa ɠɛ, ɗa zɛnvui wo.»<verse eid="LUK 10:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 10:29"/>Kɛlɛ tɔ kalamɔin ɠɛni pɔ gaamai yɛ zea, é ɠɛni Yesu ma: «Ɓɛ ɠa mu é ga sèiɲɔɠɔi?» <verse eid="LUK 10:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 10:30"/>Yesu gooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «Zunui ɠila ge ɠɛni zeɠezu Zeluzalɛme, é ɗa yei Zeliko. Diai ma, toosu nuiti ti valani ba pelei zu, ti maavo, ti doɠa, ti li, ti zɛnvu go nɔ yɛ su. <verse eid="LUK 10:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 10:31"/>É zoloo nɔ kpein, zalaɠa ɠula nui ta ɗa leʋe ga ná ʋelei, é zunui naa ɠaani, é leʋe koba. <verse eid="LUK 10:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 10:32"/>Levi nui gila ɓalaa ge ʋaani adaʋɛ miná, é zunui naa ɠa, é leʋe koba. <verse eid="LUK 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 10:33"/>Kɛlɛ Samali zunu ɠila ge ɠɛni liizu siɛi ma, é zeeli zunui ma. É kaai ma, naa maawɔin soni. <verse eid="LUK 10:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 10:34"/>É maaɓuɠani naa ʋa, é gulɔi ta dɔɔi ʋu ná-palaiti ga, é ti ɠaaɠili. Naa ʋoluma, é tɛ tɔ ɓɔɠɔi ná-soovalegi ɠɔma, é lii la wɛɛn laazuʋɛ ʋɛlɛi wu, é ɠaaɓa ma. <verse eid="LUK 10:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 10:35"/>Poluma zobui, é wali ɠae felegɔ ɠulani, é fe wɛɛn laazuʋɛ ʋɛlɛi wu wotiɠɛ nui ya, é ɠɛ ma: ‹Ɠaaɓa zunui nii ma, wali nii ɗa kwɛɛ, é la nii maazu, nà ɠalena ma, nà ɗɔnɔi ve.›<verse eid="LUK 10:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 10:36"/>«Nu saʋagɔi niiti saama, è ɠaazu ɓɛ ɠa é ɠɛni ga zunui nii zeiɲɔɠɔi, nii toosu nuiti ti valani ba?» <verse eid="LUK 10:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 10:37"/>Tɔ kalamɔin ɠɛni ma: «Zɔi é gaazumaawɔinɠaani.» Yesu ɠɛni ma: «Li, ɗa ɓalaa, è naa ɠɛɠalai ɠɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 10:37"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu lii vai Mali ta Maate ʋɔ bɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 10:38"/>Ti ɠɛai ma pelei zu ta ná-kaladopoiti, Yesu lɛɛni taai ta zu. Anzanu ɠila ge ɠɛni miná, daa ga Maate, naa yeezeini bu ná-pɛlɛi wu. <verse eid="LUK 10:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 10:39"/>Deɠei laaseigi ɠɛni ga Mali. Naa ʋaani, é zei Maliɠii ɠɔɠɔi wu, é ɗa woilo goo ma. <verse eid="LUK 10:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 10:40"/>Maate ɠaazuvilɛni ga sɛsɛbo woti mɔinmɔin. É ʋaani Yesu ʋɔ bɛ, é ɠɛ ma: «Màliɠii, é la è ɠaazu ga faaɓaa, ga dèɠei nà ɠila zɛ botiiti ga? Bo ma mu, é ɓɔ bà.» <verse eid="LUK 10:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 10:41"/>Gooɠaaʋotesuʋɛ, Maliɠii ɠɛni ma: «Maate, Maate, ɗa yiizoolɛzu, è ɗa ɓɔɠɔ ɓɔlɔ ga faa mɔinmɔin, <verse eid="LUK 10:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 10:42"/>tama faa gila kpe nɔ ɠa é ga ma ɓiigi. Mali yiimazeɠea ga ma ʋagɔi, nii é la ɠulaa zea pɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 10:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="LUK 11"/>
  <para style="s">Kalagi é ʋilɛ GALA falii ʋa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:9-13">Matiyo 6:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:7-11">7:7-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 11:1"/>Yeeta Yesu ɠɛni GALA falizu adaʋɛ ta. Kpegai ma, ná-kaladopoi gila ge ɠɛni ma: «Màliɠii, gi maalɛlɛ ga GALA falii, ʋelei Zan ná-kaladopoiti maalɛlɛni la.» <verse eid="LUK 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 11:2"/>É ɠɛni ti ma: «Siɛgi zu wo GALA falizu la, wa ɗa ɠɛ ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 11:2">Ɠɛɛɠɛ, è-laaseigi ɲade.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 11:2">Ɗa-masadai ʋaana.<verse eid="LUK 11:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 11:3"/>Folo ɠilagila kɔnɔgi ve gi ʋɛ.<verse eid="LUK 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 11:4"/>Gi zuvaayɛ ga gá-ɠotoiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 11:4">mazɔlɔɔ gá ɓalaa gá nuiti suvaayɛsu, niiti ti ɓaaɠosu gi ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 11:4">Mina va bu, gi ʋa loo tɛgai zu.»<verse eid="LUK 11:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 11:5"/>É ɠɛni ti ma ʋolu: «Ni bɔɔla a ɠɛna wo ta ya, é zɛba é li naa ʋɔ bɛ ga kua zaamai, é ɠɛ ma: ‹Bɔɛ, dɔ̀dɔ ga ɓulu saʋagɔ, <verse eid="LUK 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 11:6"/>mazɔlɔɔ bɔ̀ɔlai gila paaʋɛ pɔ̀ bɛ, é zeɠe siɛi ma, tama ani nɔpɛ ge la zèa, gè ʋa fe zea.› <verse eid="LUK 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 11:7"/>Bɔɔlai naa zɛba é yɛ pɛlɛ ɠoozuʋɛ, é ɠɛ ma: ‹Mina kpɔ̀lɔ, pɛlɛi laaɠulugɛ niina, gá dòinti gá na laani, gè la mɔ zooga wuzeɠezu, gè ʋa ɓuluiti fe è ya.› <verse eid="LUK 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 11:8"/>Gè bo wo ma ga gaamai, ni é la wuzeɠeni, é ʋa ɓuluiti fe zea bɔɔla vai ma, kɛlɛ tɛi naa ɓɔizu da, toɠa wuzeɠe, nii nɔpɛ naa pɔ, é fe zea.<verse eid="LUK 11:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 11:9"/>«Nɔ̀un, nà bosu wo ma ga: À falii wo, wa sɔlɔɔ. À gaiziɛ, wa ka. À pɛlɛi laaloɠa, daa ɠa lao wo ʋɛ. <verse eid="LUK 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 11:10"/>Mazɔlɔɔ zɔi é falii wosu, naa ɠa sɔlɔɔ. Zɔi é gaiziɛi wosu, naa ɠa ka. Zɔi é pɛlɛi laaloɠazu, daa ɠa lao naa ʋɛ.<verse eid="LUK 11:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 11:11"/>«Doun kɛɛɠɛi ɓɛ ɠa é wo zaama, ni ná-doun zunui ɠa kalei valina ma, a kaalii ve naa ya ga kalei ʋotogi? <verse eid="LUK 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 11:12"/>Ɓaa a akuɠɔtɔkaalii ve naa ya, ni naa ɠa tɛɛ ɠain valina ma? <verse eid="LUK 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 11:13"/>Wɔigi wo wola ɲɔuɗai, ni wo ani ʋagɔi vee ʋelei ɠwɛɛ wo-lointi zea, Ɠɛɛɠɛ nii é geeɠɔlɔgi zu, naa la kɛa, é ʋa ɓudɛ wɔnɔi maazu ɓaa, é ʋa Zɛnvu Ɲadegai ve naati zea, niiti ti falizu ma?»<verse eid="LUK 11:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">GALA ɓaa Setana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:22-30">Matiyo 12:22-30</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="MRK 3:20-27">Maleke 3:20-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 11:14"/>Yesu ɠɛni inɛgi ta ɓɛɛzu zunui ta zu, nii é ɠɛni ga ɓoɓoi. Inɛgi ɠulaai ma zunui zu, gaamanɔ ɓoɓoi tɔɔzeini ga é ɗa ɓɔɛ. Bɛbɛi laavɔɔni. <verse eid="LUK 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 11:15"/>Kɛlɛ tanigaa ti ɠɛni ma: «Inɛ kundiɠii Ɓeelezeɓule ná-zobogi ɠa é inɛgiti kpɛɛzu la.»<verse eid="LUK 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 11:16"/>Zɔiti ti ɠɛni pɔ ti suɠɔɠɔ, naati ti gaazaɠani ga é laavɔɔ vai ta ɠula kɛlɛma, é ɠulazu geeɠɔlɔgi zu. <verse eid="LUK 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 11:17"/>Kɛlɛ tɛi Yesu ɠɛni ta-ɠisiɛi ɠwɛɛni, é ɠɛni ti ma: «Masadai nɔpɛ su nuɓusɛiti ti ɠaaɠwɛɛzu su ɓɔɠɔ laalɔɠɔma, naa ɠa ɗa ɠoloɠolo. Pɛlɛyeɠei nii gaaɠwɛai su, naa ɠa loo. <verse eid="LUK 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 11:18"/>Ni mu Setanai ná-masadai ɠa ɠaaɠwɛɛzu su ɓɔɠɔ laalɔɠɔma, naama masadai ɠa zoo yɛsu ná ɠale? Tɔɔzei wo ɠɛ Ɓeelezeɓule ná-zobogi ɠa gè inɛgiti kpɛɛzu la. <verse eid="LUK 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 11:19"/>Ni nɔ̀un, nà inɛgiti kpɛɛzu ga Ɓeelezeɓule ná-zobogi, wa-ɠaladopoiti ta ti ɓɛɛzu ga ɓɛ ná-zobo? Naa ɠa é ba, tiya ɓɔɠɔgo ɠa ti ʋaazu wa-lukpɔi ɠaaleʋezu. <verse eid="LUK 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 11:20"/>Kɛlɛ ni GALA ná-zobogi ɠa gè inɛgiti kpɛɛzu la, deɠɛmu GALA ná-masadai ʋaa, é zeeli wo ma.<verse eid="LUK 11:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 11:21"/>«Ni zɛbɛsu nui nii kɔɔɠɔ zɔɔlaiti ti zea, a ɠɛna ɓaa ná-pɛlɛi maazu, zeaɠɔligiti pɛ makɛgɛ naazu ga pagɔ. <verse eid="LUK 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 11:22"/>Kɛlɛ ni zunui taɠili ka ʋaana, nii sɛbɛi wɔɔlɔai nɔnɔi ʋa, naa ɠa ná-kɔɔɠɔ zɔɔlaiti pɛ kula zea, niiti é ɠɛa laani ti la, é kɔligiti gaaɠwɛ. <verse eid="LUK 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 11:23"/>Zɔi nɔpɛ é la nɔ̀un ba, naa ɠa dàalɔɠɔma. Zɔi é la ɓɔsu bà, gi ʋa gaalɛbai wo, naa ɠa suvazagi wosu.»<verse eid="LUK 11:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Zɛnvu ɲɔi ɠalema vai ʋolu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:43-45">Matiyo 12:43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 11:24"/>«Siɛgi zu kɔzɔba yɛnvui ɠulazu la zunui ta zu, toɠa ɗa li, é leʋeteʋe teʋebai zu, é ɗa zeizu ɠaiziɛ, kɛlɛ é la ná ta ɠaani. Naazu, toɠa ɠɛɛzu ɓɔɠɔ ma: ‹Nà ɠalesu ma nà-pɛlɛi wu, ʋɛ kùlaai ná.› <verse eid="LUK 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 11:25"/>Siɛgi zu é ɠalesu da ma, é ná ɠa, ná ɓalegai, fai pɛ seiɗai kpasu ná ga pagɔ, <verse eid="LUK 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 11:26"/>toɠa ɗa li naazu, é zɛnvu lɔfela ɠiligaa zeɠe, niiti ti ɲɔuɗai ti leʋe ba, ti ʋa ʋɔɔma, ti zei ná. Zunui naa ná-fai ɠaaɓelagi ɠa ɲɔu, é leʋe ma mɔungi ʋa.»<verse eid="LUK 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Undaanɛ ɠitei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 11:27"/>Yesu ɠɛai ma ɓɔɛzu ɠana, anzanu ɠila ge wooɠulani bɛbɛi zu, é ɠɛ ma: «Undaanɛ nu ɠa ga anzanui naa, nii é è zɔlɔɔgai, ta è ná-ɲiimii ɓɔleai!» <verse eid="LUK 11:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 11:28"/>Yesu gooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «Ungo. Kɛlɛ undaanɛ nu ɠitei ɠa ga naati, niiti ti woilosu GALA daawooi ma, ti ɠolo bɛ!»<verse eid="LUK 11:28"/></para>
  <para style="s">Laavɔɔ vaa maaɠaazaɠabo fai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:38-42">Matiyo 12:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 11:29"/>Tɛi bɛbɛi mɔinni, ti ɗa ɠaalɛ ba Yesu ɠoba, é tɔɔzeini ga ɠɛa ma: «Niizuʋɛ nuɓusɛiti ɲɔuʋɛ. Ta laavɔɔ vaa maaɠaazaɠabosu, tama poo kili nɔpɛ ge la vea ti ya, kɛni Zonase ná-poogi. <verse eid="LUK 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 11:30"/>Mazɔlɔɔ ʋelei Zonase ɠɛni la ga poogi Ninive nuiti bɛ, ʋele nɔ ɠana Nu ná-Doun Zunui ɠɛɛzu la ga poogi niizuʋɛ nuɓusɛiti bɛ. <verse eid="LUK 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 11:31"/>Tukpɔɠaaleʋe voloi, lɛkpɛmaʋɛ nu yeezazu ʋelei ma masa anzanui ɠa wuzeɠe, é niizuʋɛ nuɓusɛiti peelala, tɔɔzei tɔun é zeɠeni kenein zou ɓela ga, é ʋa woilosu Salomɔn ná-ɠima ɓɔɛiti ma. Tama zɔi é ʋɛ, naa wɔɔlɔʋɛ Salomɔn ʋa. <verse eid="LUK 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 11:32"/>Tukpɔɠaaleʋe voloi, Ninive nuiti ta wuzeɠe, ti niizuʋɛ nuɓusɛiti peelala, tɔɔzei tiya mu Zonase ná-GALA goo wogai maaʋele ma, ti ti-ziɛ ʋeleiti maavaliboni. Tama zɔi é ʋɛ, naa wɔɔlɔʋɛ Zonase ʋa.»<verse eid="LUK 11:32"/></para>
  <para style="s">Zɛnvui ná-wozakalagi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:16">Matiyo 5:16</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="MAT 6:22-23">6:22-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 11:33"/>«Nu nɔpɛ ge la ɗa ga lanboi ɠaazo, é ʋa sei dɔɔɠuzuʋɛ, ɓaa é ʋa dɔ aniɲakai wu, kɛlɛ toɠa ɗa sei lanbo zei anii ɠa, naa ɠa a kɛ zɔiti ti lɛɛzu pɛlɛi wu, ti wozakalagi ɠa. <verse eid="LUK 11:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 11:34"/>È-ɠaazuɠɛzɛiti ka ti ga eɠɛ lanboi kpusɛi ʋɛ. Ni è-ɠaazuɠɛzɛiti kɛdɛgɛ, è-ɓusɛi pɛ daa ɠa ve ga wozakalagi. Kɛlɛ ni è-ɠaazuɠɛzɛiti ti la ɠɛdɛni, è-ɓusɛi pɛ daa ɠa ve ga kpidii. <verse eid="LUK 11:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 11:35"/>Ɓɔɠɔ ʋɛtɛ mu sɛ, ɗa-wozakalagi mina ɠɛ ga kpidii. <verse eid="LUK 11:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 11:36"/>Ni è-ɓusɛi pɛ ka ɠɛna ga wozakalagi, kpidi la ná tanɔpɛ su, toɠa ɠɛ ɓɔɠɔ ma naazu kala, eɠɛʋelei lanboi a ɠɛna zoga da, a ɗa wozakalagi ve la è ya.»<verse eid="LUK 11:36"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Faliziɛinti ta tɔ kalamɔinti peelala vai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Matiyo 23:1-36</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Maleke 12:38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 11:37"/>Yesu ɠɛai ma ɓɔɛzu, Faliziɛin gila ge tolini ga é li, é folo laamii wo pɔ bɛ. É lɛɛni, é zei daami laɓalii ɠakala. <verse eid="LUK 11:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 11:38"/>Faliziɛin laavɔɔni ga Yesu la yeagbani, eɠɛʋelei maanɛai é ɠɛ la, é ʋa daamii lɔɔzei. <verse eid="LUK 11:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 11:39"/>Maliɠii ɠɛni ma: «Wɔun, Faliziɛinti, wa wa-ɓɔɔle aniɲakaiti ta daami aniɲakaiti maaʋɛ gbazu fo. Kɛlɛ wo-ɠoozu ʋelei, wo laavegɛ ga unma wo fai ta suɲɔulai. <verse eid="LUK 11:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 11:40"/>Ee, ɠimalala nuiti! Zɔi é maaʋɛ ɓɛtɛai, naa nɔ lɛi é ʋa suʋɛ ɓɛtɛ ɓalaa ɓaa? <verse eid="LUK 11:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 11:41"/>À wo-yiimaʋɛ ve lɛɛ dɛ ga vebɛani, gaamanɔ wa ɲade fo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:41 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tati pelei taɠili ɓalaa ka ga nii: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">À naati fe lɛɛ dɛ bala nuiti bɛ, niiti ti wa-aniɲakaiti su, gaamanɔ ti pɛ ta ɲade wo ʋɛ.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 11:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 11:42"/>«Maanɔɠɔi ɠa wo ʋɛ, Faliziɛinti! Tɔɔzei wa puusiɛi ɠulazu tufa maku nɛɛnɛgi ʋa, ta tufa ɠonai, ta guluwulugi ma zii pɛ, kɛlɛ telebodai maanɛai wo ziɛ su, ta nɛɛbɛi maanɛai wo kɛ GALA bɛ, wo ɗa naa la ɠoba. Tama naa ɠa maanɛɛni ga wo ɗa kɛ, wo mina fai mɔtaiti da ɠoba. <verse eid="LUK 11:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 11:43"/>Maanɔɠɔi ɠa wo ʋɛ, Faliziɛinti! Tɔɔzei wo wɔinʋɛ ga lɛbiya zeizuʋɛti GALA dɛbi ʋɛlɛiti bu, ta ti ɗa wo luʋɔ kɛlɛmaʋɛti. <verse eid="LUK 11:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 11:44"/>Maanɔɠɔi ɠa wo ʋɛ! Tɔɔzei wo ɠɛɛʋɛ eɠɛ kabai nii poo nɔpɛ ge la ba, ta nu ziɛzu ma, é la suɠwɛɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 11:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 11:45"/>Tɔ kalamɔin gila ge kpɔɛi zeɠeni, é ɠɛ ma: «Kalamɔn, ɗa ɠɛna ɓɔɛa ɠana, ɗa gá ɓalaa gi ʋoomusu.» <verse eid="LUK 11:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 11:46"/>Yesu gooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «Maanɔɠɔi ɠa wo ʋɛ, wa ɓalaa, tɔ kalamɔinti! Tɔɔzei wa kasɔiti daazu nuiti unma, nii seɠezu ɓaai, nii wa ɓɔɠɔi wo la yeeɓeɠa go pa fɔɔɠuzu ba ta zeɠe vaa zu. <verse eid="LUK 11:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 11:47"/>Maanɔɠɔi ɠa wo ʋɛ! Tɔɔzei wa GALA goo wo nuiti ta-ɠabaiti kpɛtɛzu, tama wo-mɛmɛwolani ka ti ti ʋaani. <verse eid="LUK 11:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 11:48"/>Naa ɠɛa ga wo ʋa zeelei ga wo vaaʋɛ wo-mɛmɛwolani ta-ɠɛɛwotiiti bu. Tɔɔzei wo-mɛmɛwolani ti GALA goo wo nuiti paaʋɛ, wɔun, wo ɗa ta-ɠabaiti kpɛtɛ. <verse eid="LUK 11:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 11:49"/>Naa ɠa é kɛai GALA ge boni la ga ɠimalai, é ɠɛ ma: ‹Nà GALA goo wo nuiti ta keelaiti teʋe ti ma, ta tanigaa ʋa, ti tanigaa wɔinzeɠe.› <verse eid="LUK 11:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 11:50"/>Naa ɠa a kɛ, é zo eteai ɓɛtɛ yee ma, é zeeli za ma, GALA goo wo nuiti kpein ti ti ʋaai, ti-ma ɲamai maaɠaazaɠa ge wo niizuʋɛ nuɓusɛiti ma, <verse eid="LUK 11:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 11:51"/>é zo Aɓɛle ma, é zeeli Zakali ma, nii ti paani zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛti zɔɠɔzuʋɛ ta seizu ɲadegai. Gè bo wo ma, ti-ma ɲamai maaɠaazaɠa ka wo niizuʋɛ nuɓusɛiti ma. <verse eid="LUK 11:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 11:52"/>Maanɔɠɔi ɠa wo ʋɛ, tɔ kalamɔinti! Tɔɔzei wo faaɠwɛgi ma ɓaɠui zeɠea. Wa ɓɔɠɔi wo la lɔɔni su, wo la ɓeni zɔiti ba, wɔin ɠɛni ti ma, ti ʋa lɔ su.»<verse eid="LUK 11:52"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 11:53"/>Siɛgi zu é zeɠeni la miná, tɔ kalamɔinti ta Faliziɛinti ti ɠɛni ɓɔizu da, ti ɗa daaɠula ga é ɓɔɛ, é ʋilɛ faa mɔinmɔin ba. <verse eid="LUK 11:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 11:54"/>Ti ɠɛni bali lɛɛzu tuɠɔ kpɔɛzuɠulai zu, nii a kɛ ti so ga tɔ ɓɔɠɔi gooi.<verse eid="LUK 11:54"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="LUK 12"/>
  <para style="s">À dama ga wooveledai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:26-27">Matiyo 10:26-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 12:1"/>Naama ziɛgi zu, nu waa mɔinmɔingiti ti ɠaalɛɛni ba Yesu ɠoba, ti mɔin ʋelei ma, ti ɗa ɠɔɠɔlo ɓɔɠɔ ma. Yesu tɔɔzeini ga ɠɛa ná-kaladopoiti ma naazu: «À dama ga Faliziɛinti ta-lɛʋɛi, nii é ga ta-wooveledai. <verse eid="LUK 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 12:2"/>Tɔɔzei maalɔɔɠu vaa nɔpɛ ge la ná, nii é la ɠulaa kɛlɛma. Dɔɔɠuzu vaa nɔpɛ ge la ná, nii é la ɠwɛɛga. <verse eid="LUK 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 12:3"/>Naa ɠa é ba, nii nɔpɛ wo bogai dɔɔɠuzu, naa ɠa mɛni kɛlɛmaʋɛ. Nii wo laaʋɛai woiyeɠei la, wo bo pɛlɛ laaɠulugai wu, naa ɠa wo ga woo wola pɛlɛ ɠɔmaʋɛti.<verse eid="LUK 12:3"/></para>
  <para style="s">Zɔi maanɛai nu lua ba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:28-31">Matiyo 10:28-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 12:4"/>«Nà nii wosu wo ma, wɔi wo ga bɔ̀ɔlaiti: À mina lua naati ba, niiti ta zoo nui ɓusɛi nɔ ʋaazu, kɛlɛ ti la zooga faa ɠili kɛɛzu naa ʋolu. <verse eid="LUK 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 12:5"/>Zɔi wa lua ba, ɓɛ gè naa lɛ ga woye. À lua GALA ba, nii zobogi bɛ, a nu ʋaana, é pili ya undaaʋili abui zu. Ungo, gè bo wo ma, naa ɠa maanɛai wo lua ba.<verse eid="LUK 12:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 12:6"/>«Nu la ɗa ga soolo dɔɔlugɔi ʋɔdia ga wali ɠae felegɔ ɓaa? Tama GALA ge la ɗa ga yeemaa ti ɠila kpalaa ma. <verse eid="LUK 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 12:7"/>É ɓudɛ naa maazu, wɔundeɠai pɛ gaalugɛ vɔlɔ. À mina lua, wo vizɔgɛ soolo kpulugiti ba.<verse eid="LUK 12:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nu ɠeke suziɠa vai ga Kilista ná-faa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:19-20">Matiyo 10:19-20</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 10:32-33">32-33</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:32">12:32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 12:8"/>«Gè bo wo ma, zɔi nɔpɛ a ɠeke suziɠa ga nà-faa, nuiti gaazu, Nu ná-Doun Zunui ɓalaa ɠa ɠeke suziɠa ga naama nui ná-faa, GALA ná-geezuɠeelaiti gaazu. <verse eid="LUK 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 12:9"/>Kɛlɛ zɔi é ɠɛlɛzu bà nuiti gaazu, kɛlɛi ɠa wo naama nui ʋa GALA ná-geezuɠeelaiti gaazu. <verse eid="LUK 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 12:10"/>Tama zɔi nɔpɛ é kpɔɛ wosu Nu ná-Doun Zunui laalɔɠɔma, naama nui zuvaa ɠa yɛ, kɛlɛ zɔi é woo ɲɔu wosu Zɛnvu Ɲadegai laalɔɠɔma, naama nui zuvaa la yɛga.<verse eid="LUK 12:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 12:11"/>«Siɛgi zu ti liizu la ga woye GALA dɛbi ʋɛlɛiti bu, ɓaa kundiɠiiti ta zobobɛ nuiti kakala, à mina yiizoolɛ ga ʋelei wa woozuɠula la, ɓaa nii wa bo. <verse eid="LUK 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 12:12"/>Mazɔlɔɔ naama yeeɠɛɠalai nɔ zu, Zɛnvu Ɲadegai ɠa wo ɠala ga nii maanɛai ga wo bo.»<verse eid="LUK 12:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Faalaalii é ʋilɛ <optbreak/> ɠimalala ɓɛtɛ nui ʋa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 12:13"/>Nu ɠila ge yɛni bɛbɛi zaama, é ɠɛ Yesu ma: «Kalamɔn, bo kɛ̀ɛloin ma, é gi-ɠɛɛ ʋoganii ɠaaɠwɛ gi yɔɠɔzu.» <verse eid="LUK 12:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 12:14"/>Yesu gooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «Ɓɛ ɠa é sèiɗa ga wa-lukpɔɠaaleʋe nui, ɓaa wo-ɠɔli gaaɠwɛɛ nui?» <verse eid="LUK 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 12:15"/>Naa ʋoluma é ɠɛni ti pɛ ma: «À dama kpaan ga ɓɔɠɔ, koozu yii pɛ ma, tɔɔzei nui yɛnvui la ɠilini sɔlɔɔgi ʋa, anɛɛ ɓalaa ma nu wola ɓɛtɛʋɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 12:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 12:16"/>É niima vaalaalii woni ti ma, é ɠɛ ma: «Kpɛtɛ nui ta ɠɛni ná, nii ná-kpalagi wola ɓɛtɛni. <verse eid="LUK 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 12:17"/>É ɓɔɠɔ ɠaazaɠani, é ɠɛ ma: ‹Nà kɛ ɠale? Mazɔlɔɔ ada wola la mɔ zèa, ʋɛ nà nà-kpalagi zu aniiti pu ná.› <verse eid="LUK 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 12:18"/>Naa ʋoluma é ɠɛni ma: ‹Nii gè kɛɛzu, naa ɠa ga, gè nà-kotaiti golo, gè ma wolaiti to, gè nà-moloi ta kɔ̀ligi mɔtaiti pɛ pu ti zu. <verse eid="LUK 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 12:19"/>Nà ɠɛ niina ɓɔɠɔ ma: Ee, anii wola mɔinɗa è ya kona mɔinmɔin daawu. Looɠo, è laami, è ɓɔɔle, è koozunɛɛi ɠula.› <verse eid="LUK 12:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 12:20"/>Kɛlɛ GALA ge ɠɛni ma: ‹Ɠimalala nui, za ɓidii nɔ è-yɛnvui ɠa ɠula è zu, naazu nii pɛ è gaalɛai ba, ɓɛ ɠa naati ta yɛ zea?› <verse eid="LUK 12:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 12:21"/>Ʋele ɠana a ɗa ɠɛ la ga nui naa, nii é naavoloi ɠaalɛɛzu ba ɓɔɠɔ ʋɛ, kɛlɛ é la ga kpɛtɛ nu GALA gaazu.»<verse eid="LUK 12:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nu la GALA da</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:25-34">Matiyo 6:25-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 12:22"/>Naa ʋoluma, Yesu ɠɛni ná-kaladopoiti ma: «Naa ɠa é ba, nà bosu wo ma ga: À mina yiizoolɛ ga ɠɔnɔgi ma vaa, nii wo ɓɛdɛi ba wo ʋa zɛnvui wo, ɓaa maaɠili zɔɔlaiti wo-ɓusɛi vaa zu. <verse eid="LUK 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 12:23"/>Mazɔlɔɔ nu yɛnvui leʋegɛ ɠɔnɔgi ʋa, nu ɓusɛi leʋegɛ maaɠili zɔɔlaiti ba. <verse eid="LUK 12:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 12:24"/>À kalawɔniiti pɛtɛ dɛɛ. Ti la molo vazasu, ti la molo leʋezu, daamiani makɛ ʋɛlɛ la ti ya, molo ɠota la ti ya. Tama GALA ka ti ɠɔnɔkulazu. Wo vizɔgɛ wɔniiti ba! <verse eid="LUK 12:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 12:25"/>Tɔun vɔlɔ wo zaama, ɓɛ ɠa a zoo ná-ziizoolɛi zu, é ta ɓɔ sii ma voloiti ba?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:25 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">é ta ɓɔ sii ma voloiti ba</char><char style="ft" closed="false">: Tati pelei taɠili ɓalaa ka ga nii: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">é ta lo sɔlegi la ga zeelo gila kɛɠala</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 12:26"/>Ni wa ma, wo la ziɛzu faa yɔɠɔfɛlɛ koi naati bu, lee vaa zu wa yiizoolɛ ga fai mɔtaiti?<verse eid="LUK 12:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 12:27"/>«À pɛtɛ dɛɛ, ʋelei tufa ʋuaiti ti wɔɔlɔzu la. Ti la botii ɠɛɛzu, ti la ɓalaa seɠe vɛlɛzu. Tama nà bosu wo ma ga: Anɛɛ Salomɔn ɓɔɠɔi yɛgɛ ná-lɛbiyai pɛ su, kɛlɛ é la ɓɔɠɔ maaɠilini pɛ, é ʋa zeeli ti ɠila kpalaa su. <verse eid="LUK 12:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 12:28"/>Ni GALA ka dɔɓɔzu lufai maaɠilizu ɠana, nii é ná za, lina é ʋaazu ʋilisu abui zu, é la wo maaɠilia, é ʋa leʋe tufai ʋa ɓaa? Ee, wa-ɠidaaleʋei lɔiʋɛ dɛ ɗɛ!<verse eid="LUK 12:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 12:29"/>«Wɔun, à mina naa ɠaiziɛ, nii wa mi, ta nii wa kpɔle. À mina yiizoolɛ. <verse eid="LUK 12:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 12:30"/>Tɔɔzei, zii ɠiligiti pɛ ka ta ɗa naama aniiti gaiziɛ. Kɛlɛ wo-Ɠɛɛ kwɛni ga wo ɓɛdɛi ɠa naati ba. <verse eid="LUK 12:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 12:31"/>À GALA ná-masadai mu gaiziɛ, naa ʋoluma naati ta la maazu, é ve wo ya.<verse eid="LUK 12:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Naavoloi makɛ vai geeɠɔlɔgi zu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:19-21">Matiyo 6:19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 12:32"/>«À mina lua, ma ɓulukoni, tɔɔzei nɛɛʋɛ wo-Ɠɛɛ ʋɛ ga é masadai ve wo ya. <verse eid="LUK 12:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 12:33"/>À wo-ɠɔligiti pɔdi, wo ma naavoloi ve bala nuiti bɛ ga faaɓɔɠɔ. À wali ʋuu ɓɔlɔiti kpɛtɛ ɓɔɠɔ ʋɛ, niiti ti la ɠoloɠologa, wo naavoloi ɠaalɛ ba geeɠɔlɔgi zu, nii é la ɓega, ʋɛ unma nu la ná, ta ɓaɠaɓaɠa la ani ɠoloɠologa ná pɛ. <verse eid="LUK 12:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 12:34"/>Mazɔlɔɔ ʋɛ wa-naavoloi ná, miná ɠa wo-yii ná ɓalaa.»<verse eid="LUK 12:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Faalaalii é ʋilɛ gwɛlɛ ɓɔɠɔmai ʋa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 12:35"/>«À ɠɛʋele ɓɛtɛ, wo zaamaɠili, wa-lanboiti gaazogai ɠɛ de. <verse eid="LUK 12:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 12:36"/>Wo ɠɛ ga botiɠɛ nuiti kɛʋele, niiti ti ti-maliɠii ɠalema ziɛgi maaɓɔunsu, é zeɠe vulu ɠɛɛzuʋɛ, naa ɠa a kɛ a ʋaana nɔ feya, é pɛlɛi laaloɠa, ti daalao tuɠɔ. <verse eid="LUK 12:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 12:37"/>Undaanɛ nu ɠa ga botiɠɛ nui niiti ti-maliɠii ʋaazu, é ti ɠa ɠaazu ɠa! Gè bo wo ma ga gaamai, toɠa zaamaɠili, é ti zei daami laɓalii ɠakala, é ʋa, é ɗa ti maaleʋebo. <verse eid="LUK 12:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 12:38"/>É ʋaani ga kua zaamai ɓaa gosui yeeɠɛɠalai, ni nɔ a ʋaana, é ti ɠa ɠaazu ɠa, ti undaanɛɛʋɛ. <verse eid="LUK 12:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 12:39"/>À nii ɠaaɠa ga pagɔ: Ni pɛlɛ kɛɛɠɛi ɠɛni kwɛɛni yeeɠɛɠalai nii unma nui ʋaazu ma, a la ɠaazuɓa, nii a kɛ é mina ná-pɛlɛi yɛ ná, naa ʋa daaɠale. <verse eid="LUK 12:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 12:40"/>Wa ɓalaa, à ɠɛʋele ɓɛtɛ, mazɔlɔɔ Nu ná-Doun Zunui ɠa ʋaazu yeeɠɛɠalai ta ma, nii wo la vɔlɔ ɠisiɛni su pɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 12:40"/></para>
  <para style="s">Botiɠɛ nu ʋagɔi ta botiɠɛ nu ɲɔi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:45-51">Matiyo 24:45-51</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 12:41"/>Piyɛlɛ gaazaɠani, é ɠɛ ma: «Màliɠii, gá ɠa è naama vaalaalii wosu gi ma, ɓaa ɛsɛ pɛ be?»<verse eid="LUK 12:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 12:42"/>Maliɠii ɠɛni ma: «Naavolo unda nui ɓɛ ɠa mu é ga wooɠɛɠila nui ta keleɠelegai, nii maliɠii seiɗai ná-botiɠɛ nuiti unda, nii a kɛ é ɠɔnɔgi ve ɛsɛ zea, yeeɠɛɠalai ma nii soloogai? <verse eid="LUK 12:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 12:43"/>Undaanɛ nu ɠa ga naama wotiɠɛ nui, siɛgi zu maliɠii ʋaazu la, é ka, é ɗa naa ɠɛ, nii ma levei veai zea. <verse eid="LUK 12:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 12:44"/>Gè bo wo ma ga gaamai, maliɠii ɠa sei kɔligiti pɛ unda. <verse eid="LUK 12:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 12:45"/>Kɛlɛ ni botiɠɛ nui naa ɠa ɠɛɛna ɓɔɠɔ ma: ‹Màliɠii la ʋaazu fala,› é tɔɔzei niina ga é ɗa botiɠɛ zunuiti ta ma anzanuiti doɠa, é ɗa daami wola wo, é ɗa dɔɔi ɓɔle, naa ɗa so, <verse eid="LUK 12:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 12:46"/>naazu maliɠii ɠa ʋaazu, foloi botiɠɛ nui ɠi ge la ba la, yeeɠɛɠalai nii é la kwɛɛ. Maliɠii ɠa faa zei ma ga gola, é so, ʋelei nu a ɗa kidaaleʋelala nuiti so da.<verse eid="LUK 12:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 12:47"/>«Botiɠɛ nui nii é maliɠii yiimai ɠwɛɛgai, tama é la kɛʋele ɓɛtɛ nɔpɛ kɛɛni, ta é la naa yiimai ɠɛɛni, toɠa loɠa ga kpakɔ ɲɛ mɔinmɔin. <verse eid="LUK 12:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 12:48"/>Kɛlɛ zɔi é la maliɠii yiimai ɠwɛɛni, tama é doɠa vaiti kɛ, naa la kpakɔ ɲɛ mɔinmɔin sɔlɔɔga. Zɔi GALA ge ani mɔinmɔin feai zea, ma mɔinmɔin maa ɠa loli naa ma. Zɔi GALA ge ma mɔinmɔin kalivaai ma, toɠa ma mɔinmɔin maaɠaazaɠabo naa ma.»<verse eid="LUK 12:48"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ɠa paai ga zeeɠaaɠwɛɛi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:34-36">Matiyo 10:34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 12:49"/>«Pàaʋɛ ga gè abui lo eteai ʋa, tama wɔin ɠa mà ga é zo niina! <verse eid="LUK 12:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 12:50"/>Kɛlɛ ɓatizei ta ɠa ná nii maanɛai ga gè sɔlɔɔ dɛ. Kidaaʋili gola ɠa mà eyɛsu naa laazeeli! <verse eid="LUK 12:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 12:51"/>Wa ɠisiɛzu ga nɔ̀un paaʋɛ ziilɛi feezu eteai ʋɛ ɓaa? Ɓa-o, nà bosu wo ma ga: Zeeɠaaɠwɛɛi mu ka pàai la. <verse eid="LUK 12:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 12:52"/>Tɔɔzei za ʋoluma, nu lɔɔlugɔ a ɠɛna pɛlɛ ɠilagi wu, ti yeeɠaa ɠa ɠwɛɛ su, saʋagɔi ɠɛ felegɔi laalɔɠɔma, felegɔi ɠɛ saʋagɔi laalɔɠɔma. <verse eid="LUK 12:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 12:53"/>Doun kɛɛɠɛi ɠa ɠɛ doun zunui laalɔɠɔma, doun zunui ɠɛ kɛɛɠɛ laalɔɠɔma, doun dee ɠa ɠɛ doun anzanui laalɔɠɔma, doun anzanui ɠɛ dee laalɔɠɔma, leemɔɔin ɠa ɠɛ ná-doun anzai laalɔɠɔma, loun anzai ɠɛ deemɔɔn laalɔɠɔma.»<verse eid="LUK 12:53"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yeeɠɛɠalai ɠwɛɛ fai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:2-3">Matiyo 16:2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 12:54"/>Yesu ɠɛni ʋolu bɛbɛi ma: «Wa tonaɓiingi ɠaana, é ɗa wuzeɠe folo liizu ʋelei, wa ɗa ɠɛ ma gaamago: ‹Tonai ɠa ʋaazu,› tama naa ʋa. <verse eid="LUK 12:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 12:55"/>Wa fiilɛi ɠaana, é zeɠezu ga lɛkpɛmaʋɛ nu yeezazu ʋelei, wo ɠɛ ma: ‹Diegi ɠa ʋaazu zeizu,› diegi ma ge zei. <verse eid="LUK 12:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 12:56"/>Woovele nuiti, wo zoogɛ zooi ta geeɠɔlɔgi ɠaa vaiti gaaɠaazu, lee vaa zu wo la zoosu wo ʋa niima yeeɠɛɠalai zu vaiti gaaɠa mu?»<verse eid="LUK 12:56"/></para>
  <para style="s">À yɔɠɔzuɓɛtɛ wa wo-ɓɔɛɲɔɠɔi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:25-26">Matiyo 5:25-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 12:57"/>«Lee vaa zu ɓalaa wa ɓɔɠɔi wo la zɔɠɔzuɠulai ɠɛa ga ʋelei soloogai la? <verse eid="LUK 12:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 12:58"/>Ni nui ta a è maaɓaazaɠa laana, wa ma, wo ɗa li ʋɔɔma tukpɔɠaaleʋe nui ɠakala, ɠaaɓa, wo yɛ pelei zu, è wo yɔɠɔzuɓɛtɛ, naa ɠa a kɛ é mina è ve tukpɔɠaaleʋe nui ya, naa ʋa è ve salaʋusui ya, naa ʋa è ʋili kasoi ɠa. <verse eid="LUK 12:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 12:59"/>Tama gè bo è ma: È la ɠulaa kasoi ɠa pɛ, kɛni ɗa ɓena ga ɗa walii pɛ sala.»<verse eid="LUK 12:59"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="LUK 13"/>
  <para style="s">Nu ziɛ ʋelei maavalibo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 13:1"/>Naama ziɛgi zu, nui tanigaa ti ʋaani, ti Galilé nuiti ta-vai zuɠula Yesu ma, niiti Pilate ti ʋaani, ti ɠɛai ma ta-zalaɠai ɠulazu. <verse eid="LUK 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 13:2"/>É ti wooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «Wa ɠisiɛzu ga Galilé nui naati ti ɠɛni ga kotoba nu, é leʋe Galilé nui zɔiti pɛ ba, naa ɠa é kɛa ti nuuma ɓɔlɔi zɔlɔɔgai ɓaa? <verse eid="LUK 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 13:3"/>Ɓa-o, gè bo wo ma, ni wo la wo-ziɛ ʋelei maavaliboni, wo pɛ wo undaa ɠa ʋilisu ga ti ɠɛʋele. <verse eid="LUK 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 13:4"/>Nu puugɔ maazu lɔsaʋai (18), niiti Silowe ʋɛlɛ gaaɠoozagi looni ti ma, é ti ʋa, wa ɠisiɛzu ga ti ɠɛni ga sɔba nu, é leʋe Zeluzalɛme nuɓusɛi mɔtaiti pɛ ba ɓaa? <verse eid="LUK 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 13:5"/>Ɓa-o, gè bo wo ma, ni wo la wo-ziɛ ʋelei maavaliboni, wo pɛ wo undaa ɠa ʋilisu ga ti ɠɛʋele.»<verse eid="LUK 13:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Faalaalii é ʋilɛ <optbreak/> kooleɠoole gului ʋa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 13:6"/>É niima vaalaalii ɓalaa boni, é ɠɛ ma: «Zunui ta kooleɠoole gulu ɠila siinni ná-leezɛn ɓelei zu. É ʋaani ga é ma waai ta ɠula, kɛlɛ é la tanɔpɛ kaani. <verse eid="LUK 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 13:7"/>É ɠɛni kpele makɛ nui ma naazu: ‹Wɛlɛ, é ɠɛa ga kona saʋagɔ, gè ɗa ʋa kooleɠoole gului nii ma waai ʋolu, nà ma, gè la ani ɠaazu ga. Pɔ mu, lee vaa zu a zooi maazeɠe nɔ fuun?› <verse eid="LUK 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 13:8"/>Kɛlɛ kpele makɛ nui ɠɛni ma: ‹Kalamɔn, zɛ ná ɲɔmɔ ɠona gilagi, nà zeɠei leʋezu, gè kaku ma, gè kpoɠa pɔlɔi ʋu su. <verse eid="LUK 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 13:9"/>Tanisu toɠa waa ʋelela ʋelei, ni naa la ɠɛɛni, ɗa pɔ niina.› »<verse eid="LUK 13:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu seeɓɛ anzanui ɠɛdɛ fai <optbreak/> dooɠo foloi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 13:10"/>Dooɠo foloi ta, Yesu ɠɛni kalagi wosu GALA dɛbi ʋɛlɛi gila bu. <verse eid="LUK 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 13:11"/>Anzanui ɠila ge ɠɛni ná, nii zɛnvu ɲɔi ta ɠɛni su, naa seeɓɛi ʋilini ma, é kɛɛni su ga kona puugɔ maazu lɔsaʋa (18). Kpiligai, é la ɠɛni zoosu é ʋa ɠaalɔ pɛ. <verse eid="LUK 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 13:12"/>Yesu kaai ma, é ɓɔɛni pɔ, é ɠɛ ma: «Anzanui, é viega ɗa-zeeɓɛi zu.» <verse eid="LUK 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 13:13"/>Naa ʋoluma é yeeiti daani ma. Gaamago nɔ, naa ɠaalɔni, é zɔle, é ɗa lɛbiyai ve GALA bɛ.<verse eid="LUK 13:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 13:14"/>Kɛlɛ GALA dɛbi ʋɛlɛi ma ɠundiɠii yiiɠaawanani, tɔɔzei Yesu kɛdɛgi woni dooɠo foloi. É ɠɛni bɛbɛi ma: «Botiɠɛ voloi ɠa lɔzita. À ɗa ʋa wo ɠɛdɛ fai ma naama voloi gila su, kɛlɛ dooɠo foloi laade.» <verse eid="LUK 13:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 13:15"/>Maliɠii gooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «Woovele nuiti! Wo ɠilagilagi, dooɠo foloi, wo la ɗa ga wa-nikɛiti ɓaa wa-zoovalegiti fiega ta-laami aniɲakai ʋa, wo ʋa li ga tiye kpɔɔle wosuʋɛ ɓaa? <verse eid="LUK 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 13:16"/>Anzanui tɛi ma, Abalaame mavofodai, nii Setana ɠɛa gilini kona puugɔ maazu lɔsaʋa (18) laawu, é la vizɔni ɓaa ga é vie dooɠo foloi?» <verse eid="LUK 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 13:17"/>Naama wooɠaaʋotegi unfegi yeini ga sili nuiti pɛ. Kɛlɛ bɛbɛi wola ɠoozunɛɛni, tɔɔzei faa ʋapa golaiti ba, é ɠɛni kɛɛzu.<verse eid="LUK 13:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Faalaalii é ʋilɛ <optbreak/> mutaalede kaei ta lɛʋɛi ʋa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:31-33">Matiyo 13:31-33</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="MRK 4:30-32">Maleke 4:30-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 13:18"/>Yesu ɠɛni ma: «GALA ná-masadai ɠulaʋɛ ga ɓɛgele? Nà pokɔɠɔsu ɓɛgele ma? <verse eid="LUK 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 13:19"/>Kulaʋɛ ga mutaalede kae ɠilagi, nii zunui ta seɠeni, é sin ná-kpelei zu. É ʋɔnɔni, é ɠɛ ga gulu, wɔniiti ti ɗa laɠagi lo ma ɓekegiti su.»<verse eid="LUK 13:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 13:20"/>Yesu ɠɛni ti ma mɔnɔ: «Nà GALA ná-masadai ʋokɔɠɔsu ɓɛgele ma? <verse eid="LUK 13:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 13:21"/>Kulaʋɛ ga lɛʋɛi, nii anzanui ta seɠeni, é ti ɠaayɔ ta ɓulu vukɔ mɔinmɔingi. Gaaɓelagi, ɓulu vukɔ ɠaayɔgai naa pɛ ge ɓokoloni.»<verse eid="LUK 13:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">À lɛ ga daa lɔizu ʋelei</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:13-14">Matiyo 7:13-14</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 7:21-23">21-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 13:22"/>Yesu ɠɛni leʋesu taa wolaiti ta taa goiti su, é ɗa kalagi wo, é ɗa li ga Zeluzalɛme ʋele. <verse eid="LUK 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 13:23"/>Nui ta ɠɛni ma: «Màliɠii, nui tago nɔ ɠa é ɠizosu ɓaa?» É ti wooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ti ma: <verse eid="LUK 13:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 13:24"/>«À ɠaaɓa, wo lɛ ga daa lɔizu ʋelei, tɔɔzei gè bo wo ma, nu mɔinmɔin ka kɔɠɔ ga ti lɛ, kɛlɛ ti la zooga. <verse eid="LUK 13:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 13:25"/>Siɛgi zu pɛlɛ kɛɛɠɛi wuzeɠezu la, é pɛlɛi laaɠulu, wo yɛ eteaʋɛ, wo tɔɔzei niina ga daaloɠaa, wo ɗa ɠɛ ma: ‹Màliɠii, pɛlɛi laalao gi ʋɛ.› Toɠa wo wooɠaaʋote naazu ga: ‹Gè la wo zeɠezu ɠwɛɛ.› <verse eid="LUK 13:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 13:26"/>Naama ziɛgi zu, wa ʋaazu ɠɛɛzu ma: ‹Kɛbɛ tama ade ɠɛni daamii ta kpɔɔlei wosu ʋɔɔma, è ɠɛni kalagi wosu gá-ɠoi yɔɠɔzuʋɛti.› <verse eid="LUK 13:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 13:27"/>Toɠa ɠɛ wo ma: ‹Gè bo wo ma, gè la wo zeɠezu ɠwɛɛ. À maaɠooza bà, wɔi pɛ wo ga telebotala nuiti.›<verse eid="LUK 13:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 13:28"/>«Miná ɠa gɔlɔi ta ɲiiga ziɛgai ɠa ɠɛ ná, siɛgi zu wo Abalaame, Izaake, ta Zakɔɓe ta GALA goo wo nuiti pɛ kaazu la GALA ná-masadai zu, wa ma, wo ʋiligai ya etea ʋelei. <verse eid="LUK 13:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 13:29"/>Nuiti ta zeɠe folo ɠulazu ʋelei ta folo liizu ʋelei, é ɓɔ nu ɠɔʋɛzu ʋelei ta nu yeezazu ʋelei ʋa, ti ʋa, ti zei fɛti laamii wo taɓalii ɠakala GALA ná-masadai zu. <verse eid="LUK 13:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 13:30"/>Naazu nu ɠaaɓelagi tanigaa ta ɠɛ ga ma mɔungiti, ma mɔungi tanigaa ti ɠɛ ga ma ɠaaɓelagiti.»<verse eid="LUK 13:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ɠɔlɔ vai Zeluzalɛme ná-faa zu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:37-39">Matiyo 23:37-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 13:31"/>Naama yeeɠɛɠalai zu, Faliziɛin tanigaa ti maaɓuɠani Yesu ʋa, ti ɠɛ ma: «Zeɠe ʋɛ, è li ada ɠili, tɔɔzei Elɔde ɠa pɔ ga é è ʋa.» <verse eid="LUK 13:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 13:32"/>Kɛlɛ Yesu ti wooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ti ma: «À li, wo ɠɛ zazago zuwuzui naa ma: Nà inɛgiti kpɛɛzu, nà nuiti kɛdɛsu za ta lina, foloi zaʋasiɛi nà nà-botii ɠaaɓela niina. <verse eid="LUK 13:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 13:33"/>Kɛlɛ kɛni gè ziɛ za ta lina, naa ʋɛɛ lina ɠa leʋena ʋa, tɔɔzei é la zolooni ga GALA goo wo nu nɔpɛ ge za Zeluzalɛme ʋolu.<verse eid="LUK 13:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 13:34"/>«Ee, Zeluzalɛme, Zeluzalɛme, ɗɛi ɗa ɗa GALA goo wo nuiti paa, è ɗa yɛ naati sɔɔzu ga kɔtui eyɛsu ti za, niiti GALA ge ti leʋesu è ma! Wɔin wola ɠɛa mà ga gè è zu nuɓusɛiti gaalɛ ba kòbaʋɛ, eɠɛʋelei tɛɛ leei a ɗa ma yiʋoiti gaalɛ la ba koʋegiti bu! Kɛlɛ wo la vaani bu pɛ! <verse eid="LUK 13:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 13:35"/>Wɛlɛ, wa-ʋɛlɛi wuuɲakai ɠana yɛ. Gè bo wo ma, wo la mɔ ɠaazulaa mà pɛ, eyɛsu voloi wa ɠɛ la ma: ‹Maliɠii tuya loo naama nui ʋɛ, nii é ʋaazu daaseigi zu!›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 118:26">Guy 118:26</ref></char>.</char></note>»<verse eid="LUK 13:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="LUK 14"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu seeɓɛ nui taɠili kɛdɛ fai <optbreak/> dooɠo foloi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 14:1"/>Dooɠo foloi ta, Yesu lɛɛni Faliziɛinti ta-ɠundiɠii gila ná-pɛlɛi wu ga ti daamii wo. Niiti ti ɠɛni ná, naati ti ɠɛni pɛtɛsu. <verse eid="LUK 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 14:2"/>Zunui ɠila ge loni kakala, nii fe seeɓɛi ɠɛni ba. <verse eid="LUK 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 14:3"/>Yesu kpɔɛi zeɠeni, é ɠɛ tɔ kalamɔinti ta Faliziɛinti ma: «Tɔgi vaaʋɛ nɛi bu ga nu nu ɠɛdɛ dooɠo foloi?» <verse eid="LUK 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 14:4"/>Kɛlɛ ti maaɠɛni kpɔ. Yesu seeɓɛ nui zoni naazu, é kɛdɛ, é naa ɠaaɠale ma. <verse eid="LUK 14:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 14:5"/>Naa ʋoluma é ɠɛni ti ma: «Ɓɛ ɠa é wo zaama, ni ná-doun zunui ɓaa ná-nikɛi ɠa loona ziɛyeɠei zu, é la kulaa su gaama, anɛɛ dooɠo foloi ʋe?» <verse eid="LUK 14:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 14:6"/>Kɛlɛ ti la ɠɛni zooni ti ʋa naama wooɠaaʋotegi ve zea.<verse eid="LUK 14:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ɓɔɠɔmaayeii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 14:7"/>Yesu kaai ma ga nui niiti ti loligai daami wosuʋɛ, ti pɛ ti ɠɛni lɛbiya zeizuʋɛti nɔ ɠaiziɛzu, é niima vaalaalii woni ti ma, é ɠɛ ma: <verse eid="LUK 14:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 14:8"/>«Ni nui ta ɠa è lolina vulu laamii wosuʋɛ, mina li, ɗa ʋa zei ʋelela ɓɔkpɔgi ma, nii a kɛ ni é nui taɠili toligɛ, nii gaazu unfegi wɔɔlɔai ɗɔnɔi ʋa, <verse eid="LUK 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 14:9"/>wo loli nui mina ʋa, é ʋa ɠɛ è ma: ‹Seizuʋɛ nii ve zunui nii ya.› Ɗa ɠɛ unfesu naazu, siɛgi zu è liizu la zeizu ʋoluzu ɓɔkpɔgi ma. <verse eid="LUK 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 14:10"/>Kɛlɛ ni è loligɛ, li, è zei ʋoluzuʋɛ, naazu siɛgi zu è loli nui ʋaazu la, é ɠɛ è ma: ‹Bɔɛ, wuzeɠe, è lɛ ʋelelaʋɛ.› Naa ɠa ɠɛ è ʋɛ ga lɛbiya vaa wola, naama nuiti pɛ gaazu, wa niiti wo zeini daami wosuʋɛ. <verse eid="LUK 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 14:11"/>Tɔɔzei zɔi nɔpɛ é ɓɔɠɔ wokomaalɛɛzu, naa maa ɠa yei, zɔi é ɓɔɠɔmaayeizu, naa unbu ɠa zeɠe.»<verse eid="LUK 14:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 14:12"/>É ɠɛni ɓalaa toli nui ma: «Ni ɗa ɠɔnɔ golai ɓɛtɛna foloi ɓaa kpɔkɔi, mina naati toli, niiti ti ga è-wɔɔlaiti, è-ɠɛɛlointi, ɗa-nuiti, ɓaa è-zeiɲɔɠɔi niiti ti ɓɛtɛai, naa ɠa a kɛ tiya ɓalaa ti mina ʋa è lolisu, ti kɛɠala ɠɛ è ʋɛ. <verse eid="LUK 14:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 14:13"/>Kɛlɛ ɗa fɛti laamii ɓɛtɛna, bala nuiti toli, ta maalɛɠɛfɛ nuiti, ta dɛkpu nuiti, naa ʋɛɛ gaazuɠole nuiti ba. <verse eid="LUK 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 14:14"/>È undaa ɠa nɛ, tɔɔzei zobo ge la ti ʋɛ, ti ʋa kɛɠala ɠɛ è ʋɛ. Potogi ɠa ve è ya, siɛgi zu telebo nuiti ti wuzeɠezu la, ti ɠula saai ya.»<verse eid="LUK 14:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Faalaalii é ʋilɛ <optbreak/> daami wolai ʋa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:1-10">Matiyo 22:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 14:15"/>Zɔiti ti daamii woni, naa gila ge naama wooiti mɛnigai ma, é ɠɛni Yesu ma: «Undaanɛ nu ɠa ga naama nui, nii a daamii wo GALA ná-masadai zu.» <verse eid="LUK 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 14:16"/>Yesu ɠɛni ma: «Zunui ta daamii wola ɠɛʋele ɓɛtɛni, é zɛba é nu mɔinmɔin toli. <verse eid="LUK 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 14:17"/>Daami yeeɠɛɠalai zeeliai ma, é ná-botiɠɛ nui leʋeni ga naa ɠɛ nuiti ma, ti loligai: ‹À ʋaana, tɔɔzei ɠɔnɔgi ɠɛʋele ɓɛtɛʋɛ niina.› <verse eid="LUK 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 14:18"/>Naati pɛ ti tɔɔzeini ga woozuɠulaga. Nu mɔungi ɠɛni botiɠɛ nui ma: ‹Gè kpala gila geyaʋɛ, kɛni gè li, gè wɛlɛ ná, nà è maanɛɛnɛzu, soma è màavaayɛ.› <verse eid="LUK 14:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 14:19"/>Taɠili ge ɠɛ ma: ‹Gè wozawoli nikɛ puugɔ ɠeyaʋɛ, kɛni gè ti ɠɔɠɔ, nà è maanɛɛnɛzu, soma è màavaayɛ.› <verse eid="LUK 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 14:20"/>Taɠili ge ɠɛ ma mɔnɔ: ‹Anzai vulua nɔ ɠa bɛ̀ feya, naa maaʋele ma, gè la zooga liizu.›<verse eid="LUK 14:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 14:21"/>«Botiɠɛ nui ɠaleni ma, é naama ʋoluvaawogi wo maliɠii ma. Pɛlɛ kɛɛɠɛi wola yiiɠaawanani, é ɠɛ ná-botiɠɛ nui ma: ‹Li fala taazuʋɛ ma ɠoi zaamaʋɛti, ta koi yɔɠɔzu ʋeleiti ma, è bala nuiti toli, ta maalɛɠɛfɛ nuiti, ta gaazuɠole nuiti, naa ʋɛɛ dɛkpu nuiti ba.› <verse eid="LUK 14:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 14:22"/>Naa ʋoluma botiɠɛ nui ʋaani, é ɠɛ ma: ‹Màliɠii, nii è deveai, naa ɠɛa, kɛlɛ seizu ɲakai ta ɠa dɛ ná.› <verse eid="LUK 14:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 14:23"/>Pɛlɛ kɛɛɠɛi ɠɛni botiɠɛ nui ma: ‹Li pele wolaiti ta pele goiti su, è nuiti toli ga maaɓa, ti lɛ, naa ɠa a kɛ nà-pɛlɛi wuulaave. <verse eid="LUK 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 14:24"/>Tɔɔzei gè bo wo ma ga gaamai, nui niiti ti loliga ɠɛa de, tanɔpɛ ge la niima ɠɔnɔgi ta ɠɔɠɔga.› »<verse eid="LUK 14:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nii Yesu ná-kaladopoi maanɛai ga é kɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:37-38">Matiyo 10:37-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 14:25"/>Bɛbɛ wolai ɠɛni Yesu ʋolu pelei zu, é ɠaaʋoteni ti ma, é ɠɛ ti ma: <verse eid="LUK 14:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 14:26"/>«Zɔi é ʋaazu pɔ̀, kɛni gè nɛɛ bɛ é leʋe kɛɛɠɛ ta dee ʋa, ta anzai ta ná-dointi, naa ʋɛɛ kɛɛɠɛlointi ta baazeelaiti ba, ta tɔ ɓɔɠɔi yɛnvui ʋa, ni naa laade é la zooga ɠɛɛzu ga nà-kaladopo. <verse eid="LUK 14:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 14:27"/>Zɔi é la zaa wului zeɠeni, é ʋa ʋilɛ pòlu, é la zooga ɠɛɛzu ga nà-kaladopo.<verse eid="LUK 14:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 14:28"/>«Wo zaama, zɔi é pɔ ga é pɛlɛ ɠaaɠooza to, kɛbɛ toɠa ɗa zei dɛ, é gaalugi wo, é ɠɛ kwɛɛ nii liegɔi é ʋaazu dɔɔzu, é pɛtɛ ɓalaa ni zobo ka bɛ, é botii naa ɠaaɓela, kɛlɛ? <verse eid="LUK 14:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 14:29"/>Ni naa laade, a seɓasemai laana, toɠa ɠale botii wu, naa ʋoluma zɔiti pɛ ta ɠɛ pɛtɛsu, ta ɗa ɲɛɛɠula su, <verse eid="LUK 14:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 14:30"/>ti ɗa ɠɛ ma: ‹Wɛlɛ zunui nii ʋa, é pɛlɛ logi lɔɔzeiɗai, é la zooni é ʋa gaaɓela.›<verse eid="LUK 14:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 14:31"/>«Ɓaa masagi ɓɛ ɠa, ni toɠa pɔ é li ga kɔɔi bɔɔla masagi laalɔɠɔma, é la ɗa ga zei dɛ, é faiti buuɓɛ ga pagɔ, é ɠɛ kwɛɛ ni toɠa zoo liizu ga nu waapuugɔ (10.000), é ziɛ siliɲɔɠɔi wu, nii é ʋaazu tɔun pɔ ga nu waaʋuufelegɔ (20.000)? <verse eid="LUK 14:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 14:32"/>Ni a kaana ga é la ziaa kɔɔi wu, siɛgi zu zɔi maaɠoozaai la dɛ, toɠa ɗa zɔɠɔzuɓɛtɛ nu ɠila teʋe, é ziilɛigi ɠaiziɛ ti yɔɠɔzu. <verse eid="LUK 14:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 14:33"/>Ʋele ɠana é la mu, wo zaama, zɔi nɔpɛ é la ɠɛlɛni zeaɠɔligi pɛ ba, naa la zooga é ʋa ɠɛ ga nà-kaladopo.<verse eid="LUK 14:33"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kpoloi nii tosu la ba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:13">Matiyo 5:13</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="MRK 9:50">Maleke 9:50</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 14:34"/>«Kpoloi ʋagɛ. Kɛlɛ ni kpoloi ná-ɲɛmigi ɠa ɠulana ba, nu ɠa zoo feezu zea ɠale ʋolu? <verse eid="LUK 14:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 14:35"/>É la mɔ ʋani zooi ʋɛ, é la mɔ ʋani kpoɠa pɔlɔi ʋɛ, nu ɠa ɗa pili ya eteaʋɛ. Zɔi faa mɛni goiyeɠe ba, naama nui nii mɛni.»<verse eid="LUK 14:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="LUK 15"/>
  <para style="s">Faalaalii é ʋilɛ baalagi ʋa nii toai ya, <optbreak/> é ɠa ʋolu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:12-14">Matiyo 18:12-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 15:1"/>Mulu zo nuiti ta kotoba nuiti ti ɠɛni maaɓuɠazu ba ga ti goomɛni. <verse eid="LUK 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 15:2"/>Faliziɛinti ta tɔ kalamɔinti ti ɠɛni unsuyelii losu, ti ɗa ɠɛ ma: «Zunui nii ɠa yeezeizu kotoba nuiti bu, ti ɗa daamii wo ta naati.»<verse eid="LUK 15:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 15:3"/>Kɛlɛ Yesu niima vaalaalii woni ti ma, é ɠɛ ma: <verse eid="LUK 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 15:4"/>«Wo zaama zunui ɓɛ ɠa, ni baala ungila (100) ka ɠɛ zea, gila ge loo ya, ni é la puutaaʋuugɔ maazu taaʋuugɔiti (99) zɛga daami wosuʋɛ, é ʋa li zɔ ɠilagi ɠaiziɛzu, nii toai ya, eyɛsu é ka? <verse eid="LUK 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 15:5"/>Siɛgi zu é kaazu la, toɠa pɛɛ ɠɔma ga koozunɛɛi. <verse eid="LUK 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 15:6"/>A ɠalena ma pɛlɛi wu, toɠa ɗa bɔɔlaiti ta seiɲɔɠɔiti toli pɔ bɛ, é ɠɛ ti ma: ‹Ade ɠoozunɛ ʋɔɔma, mazɔlɔɔ gè nà-baalagi ɠaa ʋolu, nii é ɠɛa looni ya.› <verse eid="LUK 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 15:7"/>Gè bo wo ma, ʋele nɔ ɠana koozunɛɛi ɠa ɠɛ la geeɠɔlɔgi zu, kotoba nu ɠila kpegi naa faa zu, nii é siɛ ʋelei maavalibosu, é leʋe telebo nu ʋuutaaʋuugɔ maazu taaʋuugɔiti (99) ba, niiti ti ɓɛdɛ la ba ga ti ti-ziɛ ʋelei maavalibo.»<verse eid="LUK 15:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Faalaalii é ʋilɛ wali ɠaei ʋa nii toai ya, <optbreak/> é ɠa ʋolu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 15:8"/>«Ɓaa ni wali ɠae puugɔ a ɠɛna anzanui ɠila zea, gila ge loo ya, é la lanboi ɠaazoga, é ʋa pɛlɛi wu ɓale ɓaa, eyɛsu é ka? <verse eid="LUK 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 15:9"/>Siɛgi zu é kaazu la, toɠa bɔɔlaiti ta seiɲɔɠɔiti toli, é ɠɛ ti ma: ‹Ade ɠoozunɛ ʋɔɔma, tɔɔzei gè nà-wali ɠaei ɠaa ʋolu, nii é ɠɛa looni ya.› <verse eid="LUK 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 15:10"/>Gè bo wo ma, ʋele nɔ ɠana, koozunɛɛi ɠa ɠɛ la GALA ná-geezuɠeelaiti gaazu, kotoba nu ɠila kpegi naa faa zu, nii é siɛ ʋelei maavalibosu.»<verse eid="LUK 15:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Faalaalii é ʋilɛ zunu loungoi ʋa nii toai ya, <optbreak/> é ɠale ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 15:11"/>Yesu ɠɛni ma mɔnɔ: «Doun zunu felegɔ ɠɛni zunu ɠila zea. <verse eid="LUK 15:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 15:12"/>Loungo gelei ɠɛni kɛɛɠɛ ma: ‹Nɔ̀nɔi veena poganii zu.› Doun kɛɛɠɛi ɗa kɔligiti gaaɠwɛ su ná-doun zunu felegɔiti ba.<verse eid="LUK 15:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 15:13"/>«Folo mɔinɗa la vɔlɔ leʋeni, loungoi nɔnɔiti pɛ gaalɛɛni ba, é li zou ɠili su, ɠoozama, ʋɛ é ná-naavoloiti pɛ gaaʋalani ba ná, ziimaɠɛɛ wolai zu. <verse eid="LUK 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 15:14"/>Kpegai ma ga ti pɛ dɔ, pulu wolai looni naama yooi zu, anii pɛ ge tɔɔzeini ga ʋalaga zea. <verse eid="LUK 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 15:15"/>É liini, é ɓɔɠɔ ɠaliva zooi naa zu nui gila ma, naa teʋe ná-boigiti makɛsuʋɛ dɔɓɔi zu. <verse eid="LUK 15:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 15:16"/>Wɔin ɠɛni ma ga é ɠogi laave ga boigiti kɔnɔgi, kɛlɛ nu nɔpɛ ge la ɠɛni ani nɔpɛ feezu zea.<verse eid="LUK 15:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 15:17"/>«É tɔɔzeini ga ɠisiaa, é ɠɛ ɓɔɠɔ ma: ‹Botiɠɛ nui mɔinʋɛ kɛ̀ɛ ya, ti daamii wosu mɔtai yɛ, nɔ̀un, gè ʋɛ, gè ɗa za ga pului. <verse eid="LUK 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 15:18"/>Nà wuzeɠezu, gè li kɛ̀ɛ ʋɔ bɛ, gè ɠɛ ma: Kɛ̀ɛ, gè kotoi ɠɛa GALA daalɔɠɔma, é ʋɛɛ è ʋa. <verse eid="LUK 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 15:19"/>Màa la mɔ nɛɛni, gè ʋa loli ga è-loun zunu. Ʋelei è ɗa-wotiɠɛ nuiti sosu da, sò ɠana.› <verse eid="LUK 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 15:20"/>É wuzeɠeni, é li kɛɛɠɛ ʋɔ bɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 15:20">«É yɛni poun, kɛɛɠɛ kaa, maawɔin naa zo, é ɓizɛ, é li, é daaɠomi, é nɛɛnɛ. <verse eid="LUK 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 15:21"/>Doun zunui ɠɛni ma: ‹Kɛ̀ɛ, gè kotoi ɠɛa GALA daalɔɠɔma, é ʋɛɛ è ʋa. Màa la mɔ nɛɛni, gè ʋa loli ga è-loun zunu.› <verse eid="LUK 15:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 15:22"/>Kɛlɛ doun kɛɛɠɛi ɠɛni ná-botiɠɛ nuiti ma: ‹À ʋa fala ga ɗobo papagi, wo too kɔba, wo balaɠaegi lɔ zeeɓeɠai ʋa, wo saʋalagi lɔ kɔɠɔa. <verse eid="LUK 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 15:23"/>À ʋa ga nikɛ yiʋoi nii gulɔai, wo paa, ade daamii wo, de koozunɛɛi ɠula. <verse eid="LUK 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 15:24"/>Tɔɔzei wɛlɛ dòun zunui ʋa, é ɠɛa zaani, é wuzeɠea, é ɠula saai ya, é ɠɛa looni ya, é ɠaa ʋolu.› Ti tɔɔzeini ga koozunɛɛi ɠulaa.<verse eid="LUK 15:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 15:25"/>«Tama doun zunu mɔungi ɠɛni kpalagaʋɛ. Siɛgi zu é ʋaa la, é maaɓuɠa pɛlɛi ʋa, é gɛingɛin ganigiti ta kua wo tugi mɛnini. <verse eid="LUK 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 15:26"/>É botiɠɛ nui gila tolini, é gaazaɠa ga nii kɛai, naa bo ma. <verse eid="LUK 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 15:27"/>Naa ɠɛni ma: ‹È-leɠei ɠa galegai ma, é ʋa, tɛi tama kɛdɛgai ʋa, è-ɠɛɛ nikɛ yiʋoi ʋaaʋɛ, nii gulɔai.› <verse eid="LUK 15:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 15:28"/>É yiiɠaawanani, é ɠɛlɛ tɛɛ vai ʋa pɛlɛi wu. Kɛɛɠɛ ɠulani tolisu ga é lɛ. <verse eid="LUK 15:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 15:29"/>Kɛlɛ é kɛɛɠɛ wooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: ‹Kona mɔinmɔin ka gè ɗa botii ɠɛ è ʋɛ, kaipa gè la dɛ ɗa-levei gila kpalaa koloɠoloni, tama kaipa è la dɛ ɓalaa boli yiʋo veeni zèa, gi ʋa koozunɛɛi ɠula gá bɔ̀ɔlaiti. <verse eid="LUK 15:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 15:30"/>Kɛlɛ tɛi è-loin ɠalega ma, é ʋa, nii é è-ɠɔligiti pɛ suɠoloɠologai koloɠolo anzanuiti polu, tɔ ɠa è nikɛ yiʋoi ʋaazu bɛ, nii gulɔai!› <verse eid="LUK 15:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 15:31"/>Kɛɛɠɛ ɠɛni ma: ‹Dòun, ɗɔun ɗa bà yeenɔpɛ, tama nii kpein é zèa, ɗa ɠa ɗɔnɔ ga ti pɛ. <verse eid="LUK 15:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 15:32"/>Kɛlɛ kɛni ada la ɠoozunɛ, de fɛtii ɠula, tɔɔzei wɛlɛ è-leɠei ʋa, é ɠɛa zaani, é wuzeɠea, é ɠula saai ya, é ɠɛa looni ya, é ɠaa ʋolu.› »<verse eid="LUK 15:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="LUK 16"/>
  <para style="s">Faalaalii é ʋilɛ botiɠɛ nui ʋa gola ɠeleɠelegai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 16:1"/>Naa ʋoluma Yesu ɠɛni ná-kaladopoiti ma: «Naavolo nu wolai ta ɠɛni ná, nii naavolo unda nu ɠɛni zea, ti naa maalɔɔni ma ga toɠa ná-naavoloi zuɠoloɠolosu. <verse eid="LUK 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 16:2"/>É naa lolini, é ɠɛ ma: ‹Lee ɠa gè mɛnisu, é ʋilɛ è ʋa? Ʋaana, è ʋoluvaawo, é lo ɗa-naavolo makɛ pelei ʋa, tɔɔzei è la zooga zeizu nà-naavoloi unda.›<verse eid="LUK 16:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 16:3"/>«Naavolo unda nui ɠisiɛni, é ɠɛ ɓɔɠɔ ma: ‹Lee ɠa gè ʋaazu kɛɛzu, tɔɔzei màliɠii sèɠea ná-naavoloi unda? Gè ʋa li tii ɠɛɛzuʋɛ ɓaa? Gè la zooni naa la. Gè ʋa ɠɛ ga fali wo nu ɓaa? Naa ɠa zèa ga unfegi. <verse eid="LUK 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 16:4"/>Gè kwɛni niina, nii gè ʋaazu kɛɛzu, nii a kɛ siɛgi zu màliɠii kùlazu la ná-naavoloi unda, gè numaa zɔlɔɔ, niiti ta ɠɛ yeezeizu bù ta-ʋɛlɛiti bu.›<verse eid="LUK 16:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 16:5"/>«É maliɠii ná-kuye nuiti pɛ tolini, é ɠɛ ma mɔungi ma: ‹È-ma ɠuyei ɠa ga dielegɔ wo yɔɠɔzu, wa màliɠii?› <verse eid="LUK 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 16:6"/>Naa gooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: ‹Gulɔ ɠɔɠɔ gani ɲɛ ungila (100).› É ɠɛ naa ma: ‹Ɗa-zɛʋɛi zeɠe, è zei fala, è sɛʋɛ su ga puulɔɔlugɔ (50).› <verse eid="LUK 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 16:7"/>Naa ʋoluma, é ɠɛni taɠili ma: ‹Ɗa ma, è-ma ɠuyei ɠa ga dielegɔ?› Naa gooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: ‹Molo ɓɔlɔ ungila (100).› Naavolo unda nui ɠɛ ma: ‹Ɗa-zɛʋɛi zeɠe, è sɛʋɛ su ga puulɔsaʋa (80).›<verse eid="LUK 16:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 16:8"/>«Naavolo unda nui naa, nii é ɠɛni ga ladalala nui, maliɠii maamusɛni tɔɔzei é faiti kɛɛni ga kiseimai. Tɔɔzei niima eteai zu nuɓusɛiti ta ɠiseizu ma faiti su, ti yɔɠɔzu ta ti-wɔɔlaiti, é leʋe wozakalagi nɔnɔ ma lointi ba. <verse eid="LUK 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 16:9"/>Nɔ̀un, nà bosu wo ma ga: À wɔɔlaa ɠaiziɛ ga eteai niizu naavoloiti, naa ɠa a kɛ siɛgi zu ti ɓesu la wo ya, ti yeezei wo wu ɠɔoɠɔ pɛlɛiti bu.<verse eid="LUK 16:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 16:10"/>«Zɔi é ga lada nu faa goi zu, naa ɠa ga lada nu faa wolai ɓalaa su. Zɔi ma é ga ladalala nui faa goi zu, toɠa ga ladalala nui faa wolai ɓalaa su. <verse eid="LUK 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 16:11"/>Ni mu wo la ɠɛni ga lada nu eteai niizu naavoloiti su, ɓɛ ɠa a naavolo ɠiteiti kaliva wo ma? <verse eid="LUK 16:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 16:12"/>Ni mu wo la ɠɛni ga lada nu boa naavoloiti su, ɓɛ ɠa a wo ɓɔɠɔ gelei ve wo ya?<verse eid="LUK 16:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 16:13"/>«Botiɠɛ nu nɔpɛ ge la zooga botii ɠɛɛzu maliɠii felegɔ ʋɛ ʋɔɔma. Kɛni nɔ é gila wɔinzeɠe, é zɔi nɛɛ ʋɛ, ɓaa é ɠili zɔi ʋa kpaan, é zɔi ʋɛlɛlala. Wo la zooga botii ɠɛɛzu GALA ta naavoloi ʋɛ ʋɔɔma.»<verse eid="LUK 16:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Tɔgi ta GALA ná-masadai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:12-13">Matiyo 11:12-13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:31-32">5:31-32</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="MRK 10:11-12">Maleke 10:11-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 16:14"/>Faliziɛinti ti naama wooiti mɛnigai ma, ti ɲɛɛɠulani Yesu zu, mazɔlɔɔ naavoloi nɛɛʋɛ ti ʋɛ. <verse eid="LUK 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 16:15"/>Yesu ɠɛni ti ma: «Wa ɓɔɠɔ ɠɛɛzu ga telebo nuiti nuɓusɛiti gaazu, kɛlɛ GALA ge wo-yiimaʋɛti kwɛɛ. Mazɔlɔɔ nii nuiti ti kaazu ga faa ɓiigi, naa ʋɛlɛzeɠeʋɛ GALA bɛ.<verse eid="LUK 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 16:16"/>«Tɔgi ta GALA goo wo nuiti ta-yeeɠɛɠalai ʋaaʋɛ, é zeeli Zan ná-yeeɠɛɠalai ma. Kaipa niina é ʋaani, GALA ná-masadai ma Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi laa ɠa zeelizu, tama ɛsɛ pɛ ka leʋesu ga ná-zeeɠaaɓaai, é ʋa lɔ masadai zu. <verse eid="LUK 16:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 16:17"/>Geeɠɔlɔgi ta zooi leʋesu la ɓaani, é ʋa zeeli tɔgi ma zɛʋɛ ɠaei gila kpalaa too vai ʋa ya.<verse eid="LUK 16:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 16:18"/>«Zɔi nɔpɛ é ɠɛlɛzu anzai ʋa, é taɠili sei, é wɛɛnziɛgi ɠɛa. Zɔi ma é anzanu zeizu, nii sinigi ɠɛlɛai ba, tɔ ɓalaagi wɛɛnziɛgi ɠɛa.»<verse eid="LUK 16:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Naavolo nui ta bala nui Lazaal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 16:19"/>«Naavolo nui ta ɠɛni ná, nii folo-o-folo maaɠilini ga seɠe laa ɓaaɓaagiti ti wola ʋagai, é ɠɛni ná-eteai ɠɛɛzu gaanɛɛi zu, é ɗa laami ga pagɔ. <verse eid="LUK 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 16:20"/>Bala nui ta ɠɛni laani ná-kpogi wu, daaseigi ga Lazaal, palai ɠɛni kɔlɔgi ma ná pɛ, <verse eid="LUK 16:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 16:21"/>wɔin ɓena ɠɛ ma ga é pului zeɠe ɓɔɠɔ ma ga daamiani ɓulukpulugi niiti ti ɠɛni ɠulazu naavolo nui ná-taɓalii ɠa, ti ɗa loo. Naa ʋoluma gilɛiti ti ɠɛni ʋaazu, ti ɗa ná-palaiti gaaɠɔmɔ.<verse eid="LUK 16:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 16:22"/>«Bala nui zaani, geezuɠeelaiti ti seɠe, ti lii la Abalaame ɠoba. Naavolo nui ɓalaa zaani, maaɠulu. <verse eid="LUK 16:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 16:23"/>É yɛni gɔvɛalaazu kpɔlɔi zu, é ɠaazuwuzeɠe, é Abalaame ɠa, Lazaal koba. <verse eid="LUK 16:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 16:24"/>É ɓainni, é ɠɛ ma: ‹Kɛ̀ɛ, Abalaame, màawɔinɠa. Lazaal leʋe, é yeeɓeɠai ʋilɛ ziɛi ɠa, é nɛ̀gi maayɛɓɛ kae! Tɔɔzei nà wola ɓɔlɔzu abuzogi nii zu.›<verse eid="LUK 16:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 16:25"/>«Abalaame gooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: ‹Dòun, ɠizɛ su ga è ɗa-undaanɛɛi zɔlɔɔni, siɛgi zu è ɠɛni la vulua, naama ziɛgi zu Lazaal ɠɛni daanɔɠɔwogi zu. Kɛlɛ toɠa ná-gaanɛɛnɛi zɔlɔɔsu ʋɛ niina, ɗa ma, è ɗa zoolɛ ga ʋe. <verse eid="LUK 16:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 16:26"/>Naa pɛ poluma, kpokula zeɠe wolai ɠa ade yɔɠɔzu, naa ɠa a kɛ, zɔiti ta ɠɛ pɔ ga ti zeɠe wo ʋɔ pelei, ti ʋa gi ʋɔ bɛ, ti mina zoo, niiti ɓalaa ta ɠɛ ti zeɠe gi ʋɔ pelei, ti ʋa miná ʋele, ti mina zoo.›<verse eid="LUK 16:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 16:27"/>«Naavolo nui ɠɛni ma: ‹Kɛ̀ɛ Abalaame, nà è maanɛɛnɛzu mu, soma è Lazaal leʋe kɛ̀ɛ ʋɛlɛi wu, <verse eid="LUK 16:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 16:28"/>mazɔlɔɔ kɛɛɠɛloun lɔɔlugɔ ɠa zèa ná. É li, é ɓɔɛ ti ʋɔ, nii a kɛ ti mina ʋa daanɔɠɔwo adaʋɛ tɛi.› <verse eid="LUK 16:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 16:29"/>Abalaame gooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: ‹Moizeni ta GALA goo wo nuiti ta-zɛʋɛiti ta ti ya. Ti woilo naati goo ma.› <verse eid="LUK 16:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 16:30"/>É ɠɛ naa ma: ‹Naa la kula ɠɛa su, kɛ̀ɛ Abalaame, kɛlɛ ni gɔvɛi ta ɠa liina ti ʋɔ, ta ti-ziɛ ʋelei maavalibo.› <verse eid="LUK 16:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 16:31"/>Abalaame ɠɛni ma: ‹Ni ti la woiloni Moize woo ma ta GALA goo wo nuiti, anɛɛ ɓalaa gɔvɛi ta ɠa é wuzeɠezu, ti la laa da pɛ.› »<verse eid="LUK 16:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="LUK 17"/>
  <para style="s">Ɠɛɛɠɛlointi zɔɠɔzu vaiti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:6-7">Matiyo 18:6-7</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 18:21-22">21-22</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="MRK 9:42">Maleke 9:42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 17:1"/>Yesu ɠɛni ná-kaladopoiti ma: «Kɛɛɠeleɠele ge la ná, kɛni faiti ti ʋa, niiti ta nuiti too kotoi zu. Kɛlɛ maanɔɠɔ ɠa naama nui ʋɛ, nii é zɔiti toozu kotoi zu. <verse eid="LUK 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 17:2"/>A la vizɔ naama nui ma ga kɔtu wolai ɠili kɔgi ʋa, ti pili kpoloɗɛi wu, kɛlɛ é mina niima loungoi ɠila kpalaa too kotoi zu. <verse eid="LUK 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 17:3"/>Tɔ ɠa é ba, à ɓɔɠɔ zo kpaan. Ni è-ɠɛɛloin ɠa koto ɠɛɛna, zelii lo ma. Ni a ziɛ ʋelei maavalibona, suvaayɛ. <verse eid="LUK 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 17:4"/>Ni a kotoi ɠɛɛna è laalɔɠɔma ga seizu lɔfela foloi ma, seizu lɔfelai pɛ su é ɗa ʋa è ʋɔ, é ɗa bo ga toɠa siɛ ʋelei maavalibo, kɛni è suvaayɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 17:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kidaaleʋei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 17:5"/>Keelaiti ti ɠɛni Maliɠii ma: «Ta ɓɔ gá-ɠidaaleʋei ʋa.» <verse eid="LUK 17:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 17:6"/>Maliɠii ti wooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ti ma: «Ni wa-ɠidaaleʋei ɠɛni ga mutaalede kaei ɠɛʋele, wa la zoo ɠɛɛzu sikɔmɔɔl gului nii ma: ‹Lɔɔɠula miná, è li, è ɓadɔ kpoloɗɛi wu,› a la ɠolo wo ʋɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 17:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Botiɠɛ nui losuʋɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 17:7"/>«Tanisu, ni botiɠɛ nu a ɠɛna wo gila zea, é ɗa wozai woli, ɓaa é ɗa togani ɓulugiti makɛ, siɛgi zu naa zeɠezu la kpalagaʋɛ, é ʋa, anɠɛ nɛi toɠa ɗa ɠɛ naa ma gaamago: ‹Ʋa fala, è zei daami wosuʋɛ›? <verse eid="LUK 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 17:8"/>Ɓa-o, toɠa ɗa ɠɛ ma: ‹Nà-kpɔkɔ ɠɔnɔgi ɓɛtɛ bɛ̀, ɓɔɠɔ maaɠili, è ɗa màaleʋebo, eyɛsu gè ɓe ga laamii, gè ɓɔɔle. Naa ʋoluma ɗɔun ɗa ʋa niina, è laami, è ɓɔɔle.› <verse eid="LUK 17:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 17:9"/>Kɛbɛ é la ʋaazu naa mamasu, naama wotii ɠɛɛ vai zu, nii é naa leveai ma, kɛlɛ? <verse eid="LUK 17:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 17:10"/>Wa ɓalaagi, ni wa naa nɔ ɠɛɛna, nii wo leveai ma, à ɠɛ ɓɔɠɔ ma: ‹Gá ga botiɠɛ nu ɲakaiti, gi naa nɔ ɠɛɛʋɛ, nii maa ɠɛni nɛɛni gi kɛ.› »<verse eid="LUK 17:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Gee nu puugɔi ɲade fai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 17:11"/>Yesu liizuʋɛ Zeluzalɛme, é ɠɛni Galilé yooi ta Samali yooi maaleʋesu. <verse eid="LUK 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 17:12"/>Tɛi é ɠɛni lɛɛzu taai ta zu, gee nu puugɔ daaɠomini, ti lo ɠoozama. <verse eid="LUK 17:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 17:13"/>Ti wooɠulani, ti ɠɛ ma: «Maliɠii, Yesu, gi maawɔinɠa.» <verse eid="LUK 17:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 17:14"/>É ti ɠaai ma, é ɠɛni ti ma: «À li, wo ɓɔɠɔ lɛ ga zalaɠa ɠula nui.» Ti liizuʋɛ, ti kaani ga ti ɲadega.<verse eid="LUK 17:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 17:15"/>Ti zaama, gila ge pɛtɛni ga é ɠɛdɛga, é ɠaleni ma ga ʋoluʋelei, é GALA dɛbi ga woo wola. <verse eid="LUK 17:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 17:16"/>É laaʋɛɛni kpulu Yesu ɠɔɠɔwu, é naa mama. É ɠɛni ga Samali nu.<verse eid="LUK 17:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 17:17"/>Yesu kpɔɛi zeɠeni, é ɠɛ ma: «Nu puugɔi pɛ ge la ɲadeni ɓaa? Mini ɠa mu mɔta taaʋuugɔiti ti ná? <verse eid="LUK 17:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 17:18"/>Tanɔpɛ ge la zɔlɔɔni, nii a ʋa ʋolu, é lɛbiyai ve GALA bɛ, kɛni wɛɛin nii nɔ?» <verse eid="LUK 17:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 17:19"/>Naa ʋoluma, é ɠɛni naa ma: «Wuzeɠe, è li, ɗa-ɠidaaleʋei è ʋaloa.»<verse eid="LUK 17:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">GALA ná-masadai ʋaa vai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:23-28">Matiyo 24:23-28</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 24:37-41">37-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 17:20"/>Faliziɛinti ti gaazaɠani, ti ɠɛ ma: «Siɛ kpɛgele ɠa GALA ná-masadai ʋaazu la?» É ti wooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ti ma: «GALA ná-masadai la ʋaazu, è ʋa ɠɛ ani nu kaazu ga ɠaazu. <verse eid="LUK 17:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 17:21"/>Daa la ɠɛa ga: ‹À wɛlɛ, toɠa ʋɛ!›, ɓaa: ‹Toɠa munu!›, mazɔlɔɔ GALA ná-masadai ɠa wo zaama.»<verse eid="LUK 17:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 17:22"/>É ɠɛni kaladopoiti ma: «Yeeɠɛɠalai ta ʋaazu, wɔin ɠa ɠɛ wo ma ga wo ɠaazula Nu ná-Doun Zunui ma, anɛɛ folo ɠila daawu, kɛlɛ wo la kaa. <verse eid="LUK 17:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 17:23"/>Ta ɠɛ wo ma naazu: ‹À wɛlɛ ʋɛ!›, ɓaa: ‹À wɛlɛ munu!›. Kɛlɛ à mina li, à mina ɓizɛ. <verse eid="LUK 17:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 17:24"/>Tɔɔzei ʋelei mainmain a ɗa saɠa la, é ɗa volo geeɠɔlɔgi ɠilazuʋɛ ɠwɛgi ma, é zeeli zɔɔla ʋelei, ʋele ɠana Nu ná-Doun Zunui a ɠɛ la ná-foloi zu. <verse eid="LUK 17:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 17:25"/>Kɛlɛ kɛni dɛ é ɓɔlɔ gola, niizuʋɛ nuɓusɛiti ti ɠɛlɛ ba.<verse eid="LUK 17:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 17:26"/>«Nu ná-Doun Zunui ná-siɛgi zu, faiti ta ɗa ɠɛ, eɠɛʋelei é ɠɛni ɠɛɛzu la Nowe ná-yeeɠɛɠalai zu. <verse eid="LUK 17:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 17:27"/>Nuiti ti ɠɛni daamii wosu, ti ɗa kpɔɔleiti bo, ti ɗa anzaiti fulu ɓɔɠɔ ʋɛ ta ti-lointi bɛ, eyɛsu naama voloi zeeli, yeei Nowe lɛɛni la kein wolai zu. Ziɛve golai ʋaani, é ti pɛ undaaʋili.<verse eid="LUK 17:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 17:28"/>«Toɠa ɠɛ ga Lote ná-siɛgi zu ɠɛʋele. Nuiti ti ɠɛni daamii ta kpɔɔlei wosu, ti ɗa aniiti geya, ti ɗa pɔdii loo, ti ɠɛni aniiti siinsu, ti ɗa pɛlɛiti to. <verse eid="LUK 17:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 17:29"/>Kɛlɛ voloi Lote ɠulani la Sɔdɔme ʋa, GALA ge timini abui ʋuuni, é ɠula geeɠɔlɔgi zu eɠɛ tonai, é ti pɛ undaaʋili. <verse eid="LUK 17:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 17:30"/>Ʋele ɠana a ɠɛ la, voloi Nu ná-Doun Zunui ɠulazu la kɛlɛma.<verse eid="LUK 17:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 17:31"/>«Naama voloi, ni nui ta a ɠɛna dooɠo bosuʋɛ ná-pɛlɛ ɠɔmaʋɛ, zeaɠɔligiti ti pɛlɛi wu, é mina yei ɠasɔ zeɠezu pɛlɛi wu. Zɔi ɓalaagi a ɠɛ kpalagaʋɛ, naa mina ɠale ma ʋoluʋelei. <verse eid="LUK 17:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 17:32"/>À ɠizɛ naa zu, nii é ɠɛɛni ga Lote anzai! <verse eid="LUK 17:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 17:33"/>Zɔi é pɔ ga é ɓaa zɛnvui maazu, toɠa ʋala ma. Kɛlɛ zɔi a ʋala zɛnvui ma, toɠa ɓaa maazu. <verse eid="LUK 17:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 17:34"/>Gè bo wo ma, naama ɓidii, nu felegɔ ɠa ɠɛ laani bete ɠilagi zu, gilagi ɠa zeɠe, zɔi yɛ ná. <verse eid="LUK 17:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 17:35"/>Anzanu felegɔ ɠa ɠɛ moloi ziɠazu ʋɔɔma, gilagi ɠa zeɠe, zɔi yɛ ná. <verse eid="LUK 17:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 17:36"/>[Zunu felegɔ ɠa ɠɛ kpalagaʋɛ, gilagi ɠa zeɠe, zɔi yɛ ná.]»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Wooi niiti ti [ ] kpaku felegɔiti zɔɠɔzu, naati ti la sɛʋɛ wɔlɔmai tanigaa zu.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 17:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 17:37"/>Kaladopoiti ti gaazaɠani, ti ɠɛ ma: «Màliɠii, mini ɠa naama vai ʋaazu ɠɛɛzu ná?» É ti wooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «Ʋɛ nɔpɛ ani ʋoomai ná, miná ɠa ɗuaiti ta ɗa ɠaalɛ ba ná.»<verse eid="LUK 17:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="LUK 18"/>
  <para style="s">Faalaalii é ʋilɛ tukpɔɠaaleʋe nui ʋa <optbreak/> nii é la luazu GALA ba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 18:1"/>Yesu faalaali ɠila boni ná-kaladopoiti ma, é dɛɛ ga maanɛɛʋɛ ti GALA fali ɠɔ, ti mina iɲɔteʋe. <verse eid="LUK 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 18:2"/>É ɠɛni ti ma: «Tukpɔɠaaleʋe nui ta ɠɛni taai ta zu, nii é la ɠɛni luazu GALA ba, ta é la ɠɛni unfesu nu nɔpɛ ma. <verse eid="LUK 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 18:3"/>Poanzai ta ɓalaa ɠɛni taai naa zu, nii é ɠɛni ʋaazu valafala, é ɗa ɠɛ tukpɔɠaaleʋe nui ma: ‹Nɔ̀nɔi ʋotokula sìli nui ma.› <verse eid="LUK 18:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 18:4"/>Suɠoozani, é ɗa ɠɛlɛ. Naa ʋoluma, é ɠɛni ɓɔɠɔ ma: ‹Anɛɛ ni gè la luazu GALA ba, ta gè la unfesu nu nɔpɛ ma, <verse eid="LUK 18:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 18:5"/>kɛlɛ tɛi poanzai nii ɗa ɓɔi dà, nà nɔnɔi ʋotokulazu, ni naa laade, toɠa ɠɛ ʋaazu yeenɔpɛ, é ɗa kpɔ̀lɔ.› »<verse eid="LUK 18:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 18:6"/>Maliɠii ɠɛni ma ʋolu: «À naa mɛni, nii telebotala lukpɔɠaaleʋe nui bosu. <verse eid="LUK 18:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 18:7"/>Niiti GALA ge yiimazeɠeai ga tiye, é la naati tɔnɔi ʋotokula ɓaa, niiti ti wooɠulazu ma folo ʋɛɛ kpidi ʋa? É la ɓɔga ti ʋa fala ɓaa? <verse eid="LUK 18:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 18:8"/>Gè bo wo ma, toɠa tɔnɔi ʋotokula ga suvilɛ. Kɛlɛ siɛgi zu Nu ná-Doun Zunui ʋaazu la, toɠa kidaaleʋei ɠa nɛi eteai zu?»<verse eid="LUK 18:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Faalaalii é ʋilɛ Faliziɛin ta mulu zo nui ʋa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 18:9"/>É niima vaalaalii woni mɔnɔ, é ʋilɛ naama nuiti ba, niiti ti kaazu ga ti lelebogɛ, naa ʋolu ti ɗa zɔiti bɛlɛlala, é ɠɛ ti ma: <verse eid="LUK 18:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 18:10"/>«Yeeta, zunu felegɔ liini GALA sei ʋɛlɛi wu, GALA fali vai ma. Zɔi ɠɛni ga Faliziɛin, zɔi ɠɛ ga mulu zo nui. <verse eid="LUK 18:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 18:11"/>Faliziɛin loni, é ɗa GALA fali ɠisu, é ɠɛ ma: ‹Ee, GALA, nà è mamasu, gè la ga zɔiti kɛʋele, niiti ti ga tooma nuiti, telebotala nuiti, ta wɛɛnziɛ nuiti. È mama gè la ga mulu zo nui tɛi kɛʋele. <verse eid="LUK 18:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 18:12"/>Nà ɗa zugi zo fele, dɔɔɠɔi laawu, nà ɗa sɔ̀lɔɔ ganii ma ʋuusiɛi pɛ fe è ya.› <verse eid="LUK 18:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 18:13"/>Kɛlɛ mulu zo nui loni yɛ, zii la ɠɛni lɔɔni vɔlɔ é ʋa wɛlɛ geezu. É yiilaʋɛ loɠani, é ɠɛ ma: ‹GALA, màawɔinɠa, nɛ̀i gè ga kotoba nui.› <verse eid="LUK 18:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 18:14"/>Gè bo wo ma, zunui tɛi ge ɠaleni ma ná-koizu, telebogai GALA gaazu, kɛlɛ naa la ɠɛni ga Faliziɛin. Zɔi nɔpɛ é ɓɔɠɔ wokomaalɛɛzu, naa maa ɠa yei, zɔi é ɓɔɠɔmaayeizu, unbu ɠa zeɠe.»<verse eid="LUK 18:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu yeezei vai doungoiti bu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Matiyo 19:13-15</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="MRK 10:13-16">Maleke 10:13-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 18:15"/>Nuiti ti ʋaani ɓalaa ga ɲiimiɓɔlegiti pɔ, nii a kɛ é yeela ti ma. Kɛlɛ kaladopoiti ti miná ɠaai ma, ti ɠɛni zelii losu naati ma. <verse eid="LUK 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 18:16"/>Kɛlɛ Yesu doungoiti tolini, é zɛba é ɠɛ nuiti ma: «À ɓe doungoiti ba, ti ʋa pɔ̀. À mina pele leʋe ti luɠɔ, tɔɔzei GALA ná-masadai ɠa ga naati tɔnɔ, niiti ti ga ti ɠɛʋele. <verse eid="LUK 18:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 18:17"/>Gè bo wo ma ga gaamai, zɔi nɔpɛ é la yeezeini GALA ná-masadai wu ga doungoi ɠɛʋele, naama nui la lɔa su pɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 18:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Naavolo nuiti ta GALA ná-masadai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Matiyo 19:16-30</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="MRK 10:17-31">Maleke 10:17-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 18:18"/>Kundiɠi gila ge Yesu ɠaazaɠani, é ɠɛ ma: «Kalamɔn ʋagɔi, leeni ɠa nà kɛ, gè ʋa ɠɔoɠɔ zɛnvui zɔlɔɔ ga nɔ̀nɔ?» <verse eid="LUK 18:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 18:19"/>Yesu ɠɛni ma: «Lee vaa zu è tòlisu ga nu ʋagɔi? Nu nɔpɛ ge la ʋani, kɛni GALA gila kpe. <verse eid="LUK 18:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 18:20"/>È deveiti kwɛni: Mina wɛɛnziɛ bo, mina nu ʋaa, mina unma wo, mina zɛɛ zeele woo wo, è-ɠɛɛ lɛbi ta è-lee.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 20:12-16">Ɛgz 20:12-16</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:16-20">TSV 5:16-20</ref></char>.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 18:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 18:21"/>É ɠɛni Yesu ma: «Gè naama leveiti pɛ soga kaite mà loungo ziɛgi zu.»<verse eid="LUK 18:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 18:22"/>Yesu gooi mɛnigai ma, é ɠɛni ma: «Faa ɠila ka dɛ ʋoluzu, nii è la dɛ kɛɛni: È-ɠɔligiti pɛ pɔdi, è ma naavoloi ɠaaɠwɛ bala nuiti ba, naazu ɗa naavolo zɔlɔɔ geeɠɔlɔgi zu. Naa ʋoluma, ʋa, è ʋilɛ pòlu.» <verse eid="LUK 18:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 18:23"/>É naa mɛnigai ma, ziiɓɔlɔni gola, tɔɔzei é ɠɛni ga kpɛtɛ nu wola.<verse eid="LUK 18:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 18:24"/>Siɛgi zu Yesu kaani la, é ɠɛni ma: «Kpɛtɛ nuiti dɔɔ vai wola ɓaaʋɛ GALA ná-masadai zu! <verse eid="LUK 18:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 18:25"/>Tɔɔzei ɲɔmɛi leʋe fai la ɓaani sɛɠilɛ zeɠei zu, é ʋa zeeli kpɛtɛ nui lɔɔ vai zu GALA ná-masadai zu.»<verse eid="LUK 18:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 18:26"/>Zɔiti ti ɠɛni goomɛnisu, naati ti ɠɛni ma: «Ɓɛ ɠa mu a zoo ɠizosu?» <verse eid="LUK 18:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 18:27"/>Yesu ɠɛni ti ma: «Nii é la zooga é ʋa ɠɛ nuɓusɛiti zea, GALA ka zoo naa ɠɛɛzu.»<verse eid="LUK 18:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 18:28"/>Piyɛlɛ ɠɛni ma: «Gá ma? Gi gi-ɠɔligiti zɛga ná, gi ʋilɛ è ʋolu.» <verse eid="LUK 18:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 18:29"/>Yesu ɠɛni ti ma: «Gè bo wo ma ga gaamai, zɔi nɔpɛ é zeɠezu ná-pɛlɛi ʋa, anzai ɓaa kɛɛlointi ba, sɔlɔɔ nuiti ɓaa dointi ba, GALA ná-masadai maaʋele ma, <verse eid="LUK 18:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 18:30"/>ma nui ɠa ʋaazu naati ma mɔinmɔin sɔlɔɔsu niima yeeɠɛɠalai zu, ta toɠa ɠɔoɠɔ zɛnvui zɔlɔɔ etea niinɛi zu é ʋaazu.»<verse eid="LUK 18:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu saa vai <optbreak/> ta buzeɠe vai wo fai ʋolu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Matiyo 20:17-19</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="MRK 10:32-34">Maleke 10:32-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 18:31"/>Yesu keela puugɔ maazu felegɔiti (12) tolini yɛ, ti maaɠelesa ge leʋe, é ɠɛ ti ma: «À woilo, ada lɛɛzu Zeluzalɛme, tama nii pɛ GALA goo wo nuiti ti sɛʋɛai, é ʋilɛ Nu ná-Doun Zunui ʋa, ti pɛ daa ɠa zeeli. <verse eid="LUK 18:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 18:32"/>Tɔɔzei toɠa lɔ zii ɠiligiti zeezu, ti ɲɛɛɠula su, ti poomu, ti laaɗɛi ʋu ma, <verse eid="LUK 18:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 18:33"/>ta ɓena ga doɠa ga kpakɔi, ti paa. Naa ʋoluma, foloi zaʋasiɛi toɠa wuzeɠe, é ɠula saai ya.» <verse eid="LUK 18:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 18:34"/>Kɛlɛ kaladopoiti ti la ɠɛni naama wooiti gaaɠaani. Poluʋɛ lɔɔɠuni ti ʋa, ti la ɠɛni kwɛɛ, nii naama wooiti ti bosu.<verse eid="LUK 18:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Gaazuɠole nui ʋalo vai Zeliko</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Matiyo 20:29-34</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="MRK 10:46-52">Maleke 10:46-52</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 18:35"/>Tɛi Yesu ɠɛni maaɓuɠazu Zeliko ʋa, gaazuɠole nu ɠila ge ɠɛni zeini pele ɠobaʋɛ, é ɗa falii wo. <verse eid="LUK 18:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 18:36"/>É bɛbɛi wooi mɛnigai ma, ti ɗa leʋe, é gaazaɠagi woni ga leeni ɠa é ɠɛɛzu. <verse eid="LUK 18:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 18:37"/>Ti ɠɛni ma: «Nazalɛte nui Yesu ɠa é leʋesu.»<verse eid="LUK 18:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 18:38"/>É kpeei looni, é ɠɛ ma: «Davide ná-Doun Zunui, Yesu, gàazumaawɔinɠa!» <verse eid="LUK 18:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 18:39"/>Zɔiti ti ɠɛni ziɛzu ʋelelaʋɛ, naati ti ɠɛni zelii losu ma, ga é maaɠɛ kpɔ, kɛlɛ tɔun é ɠɛni wooɠulazu sɛsɛ, é ɗa ɠɛ ma: «Davide ná-Doun zunui, gàazumaawɔinɠa!»<verse eid="LUK 18:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 18:40"/>Yesu loni, é deve ga ti ʋaa la pɔ. É maaɓuɠaai ma ba, Yesu gaazaɠani, é ɠɛ ma: <verse eid="LUK 18:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 18:41"/>«Lee ɠa è pɔ ga gè kɛ è ʋɛ?» É gooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «Màliɠii, va bu ga gè wozaɠaa ʋolu.» <verse eid="LUK 18:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 18:42"/>Yesu ɠɛni ma: «Wozaɠa ʋolu. Tɛi è laa dà, è ʋaloa.» <verse eid="LUK 18:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 18:43"/>Gaamago nɔ, é wozaɠaani ʋolu, é ʋilɛ Yesu ʋolu, é ɗa GALA dɛbi. Bɛbɛi miná ɠaani, tiya ɓalaa ti ɗa GALA maamusɛ.<verse eid="LUK 18:43"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="LUK 19"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu ta Zasé</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 19:1"/>Yesu lɛɛni Zeliko taazuʋɛ, é taai maaleʋe. <verse eid="LUK 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 19:2"/>Zunui ta ɠɛni ná daaseigi ga Zasé, é ɠɛni ga mulu zo nuiti ta-ɠundiɠii, naa ʋoluma é ɓɛtɛni gola. <verse eid="LUK 19:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 19:3"/>É ɠɛni pɔ ga é kwɛɛ, ɓɛ ɠa é ga Yesu. Kɛlɛ bɛbɛi maaʋele ma, é la ɠɛni zooni, tɔɔzei kpuɠaa ɠɛni de. <verse eid="LUK 19:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 19:4"/>É ɓizɛni, é li ʋelelaʋɛ, é lɛ sikɔmɔɔl gului zu ga é Yesu ɠa, tɔɔzei naa ɠɛni leʋesu ga ná ʋele.<verse eid="LUK 19:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 19:5"/>Yesu zeeliai ma náʋɛ, é ɠaazuwuzeɠeni, é ɠɛ Zasé ma: «Zasé, ʋilɛ fala, mazɔlɔɔ è-ma wɛɛn ɠa ga ze za.» <verse eid="LUK 19:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 19:6"/>Zasé zuvilɛni ga ʋilɛga, é yeezei Yesu wu ga koozunɛ.<verse eid="LUK 19:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 19:7"/>Zɔiti pɛ ti miná ɠaani, ti ɠɛni unsuyelii losu, ti ɗa ɠɛ ma: «É lia, é ɠɛ ga kotoba nui nuu ma wɛɛin.» <verse eid="LUK 19:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 19:8"/>Kɛlɛ Zasé wuzeɠeni, é lo Maliɠii ɠaazu, é ɠɛ ma: «Màliɠii, woilo, nà kɔligi ɠilazuʋɛ pɛ fe ga vebɛanii bala nuiti bɛ. Zɔi nɔpɛ nà ɠɛ looni ma, nà nɔnɔi ʋotogi ve zea ga seizu naanigɔ.»<verse eid="LUK 19:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 19:9"/>Yesu ɠɛni ma: «Kizogi lɛa pɛlɛi nii wu za, mazɔlɔɔ zunui nii ɓalaa ka ga Abalaame mavofodai ta. <verse eid="LUK 19:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 19:10"/>Tɔɔzei Nu ná-Doun Zunui ʋaaʋɛ naati gaiziɛzu, é ti ɠizo, niiti ti loai ya.»<verse eid="LUK 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Faalaalii é ʋilɛ <optbreak/> botiɠɛ nu saʋagɔiti ba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 25:14-30">Matiyo 25:14-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 19:11"/>Tɛi nuiti ti ɠɛni woilosu naama wooiti ma, Yesu faalaali ɠila boni ti ma mɔnɔ, tɔɔzei maaɓuɠani niina Zeluzalɛme ʋa, tama nuiti ti ɠɛni ɠisiɛzu ga GALA ná-masadai ɠa ɠulazu kɛlɛma gaamanɔ. <verse eid="LUK 19:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 19:12"/>É ɠɛni ti ma: «Zunui ta ɠɛni ná, nii é zɔlɔɔni seizumaanɛ pɛlɛi wu. É wuzeɠeni, é li zou zu, ʋɛ ná maaɠoozaai, nii a kɛ é masadai zɔlɔɔ, naa ʋoluma toɠa ʋa niina. <verse eid="LUK 19:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 19:13"/>É ʋa ɠɛ é li, é ná-botiɠɛ nu puugɔ lolini, é wali ɠae puugɔ ɠaaɠwɛ ti ʋa, é ɠɛ ti ma: ‹À ɗa suyaaɠo, pàa laa yɔɠɔzu.›<verse eid="LUK 19:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 19:14"/>«Kɛlɛ seiɲɔɠɔiti ti wɔinzeɠeni, ti keela ʋilɛni polu, ti ɠɛ ma: ‹Gi la pɔ ga zunui nii ʋa masadai ɠɛ gi unda.›<verse eid="LUK 19:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 19:15"/>«É masadai zɔlɔɔgai ma, é ɠale ma, é ná-botiɠɛ nuiti tolini, niiti é wali veeni ti ya, é ɠɛ ti ɠonabo bɛ, é ʋilɛ yaaɠolai ʋa, ti kɛai.<verse eid="LUK 19:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 19:16"/>«Ma mɔungi ʋaani, é ɠɛ ma: ‹Màliɠii, ɗa-wali ɠae ma lɔnɔgi ɠɛɛʋɛ ga wali ɠae puugɔ.› <verse eid="LUK 19:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 19:17"/>Masagi ɠɛ ma: ‹Naa ʋagɛ, botiɠɛ nu ʋagɔi. Tɛi è ɠɛa ga lada nu faa goi zu, gè è zeiɗa taa wola puugɔ unda.›<verse eid="LUK 19:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 19:18"/>«Felesiɛi ɓalaa ʋaani, é ɠɛ ma: ‹Màliɠii, ɗa-wali ɠae ma lɔnɔgi ɠɛɛʋɛ ga wali ɠae lɔɔlugɔ.› <verse eid="LUK 19:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 19:19"/>Masagi ɠɛ ma: ‹Ɗa ɓalaa, gè è zeiɗa taa wola lɔɔlugɔ unda.›<verse eid="LUK 19:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 19:20"/>«Taɠili ge ʋaani, é ɠɛ ma: ‹Màliɠii, wɛlɛ ɗa-wali ɠaei ʋa, nii gè makɛgai ba seɠe zakpai zu. <verse eid="LUK 19:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 19:21"/>Mazɔlɔɔ gè ɠɛni luazu è ʋa, tɔɔzei ɗa ga zunui nii ná-fai wola ɓaai. Nii è la daani, naa ɠa ɗa ɗa seɠe. Moloi è la fazani, naa ɠa ɗa ɗa teʋe.›<verse eid="LUK 19:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 19:22"/>«Masagi ɠɛni ma: ‹Botiɠɛ nu ɲɔuɲɔugi! Nà è lukpɔɠaaleʋezu ga è-laawooi nɔ. È ɠɛa kwɛɛni ga nà ga zunui nii ná-fai wola ɓaai, gè ɗa naa zeɠe, nii gè la daani, gè ɗa moloi leʋe, nii gè la fazani. <verse eid="LUK 19:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 19:23"/>Lee vaa zu è la ɓena li ga nà-walii, è ʋa da ɓangei la? Naazu, siɛgi zu nà la ɠalena ma, nà la kula ta maalamai.›<verse eid="LUK 19:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 19:24"/>«É ɠɛni koba nuiti ma: ‹À wali ɠaei ɠula zea, wo fe zɔi ya, nii puugɔi zea.› <verse eid="LUK 19:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 19:25"/>Naati ti ɠɛ ma: ‹Wali ɠae puugɔ ɠa é naa ya!› <verse eid="LUK 19:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 19:26"/>É ɠɛni ti ma: ‹Gè bo wo ma, zɔi ani zea, ta ɠa ve naa ya ʋolu. Kɛlɛ zɔi ani la zea, anɛɛ zɔɔgoi é zea, naa ɠa ɠula zea. <verse eid="LUK 19:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 19:27"/>Zɔiti ma ti ga sìli nuiti, niiti ti la ɠɛa pɔ ga gè ʋa masadai ɠɛ ti unda, à ʋa ga tiye ʋɛ, wo ti ɠɔdaaleʋe gàazu.› »<verse eid="LUK 19:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu lɛɛ vai Zeluzalɛme</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Matiyo 21:1-11</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Maleke 11:1-11</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Zan 12:12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 19:28"/>Yesu naama wooiti bogai ma, é toni da, é ɗa li ga Zeluzalɛme ʋele. <verse eid="LUK 19:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 19:29"/>Siɛgi zu é maaɓuɠani la Ɓɛtefazé ʋa ta Ɓetani, Wolive ɠizei ɠobaʋɛ, Yesu ná-kaladopo felegɔ leʋeni, <verse eid="LUK 19:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 19:30"/>é ɠɛ ti ma: «À li taa goi nii zu, é wo luɠɔ. Wa lɛɛna, wa soovale ziʋoi ta ɠaazu, giliai, nii nu nɔpɛ ge la dɛ zeini kɔma. À fie, wo ʋaa la ʋɛ. <verse eid="LUK 19:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 19:31"/>Ni nu a wo ɠaazaɠana ga: ‹Lee vaa zu wo fiesu?›, wa ɠɛ ma: ‹Màliɠii ɓɛdɛi ɠa ba.› »<verse eid="LUK 19:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 19:32"/>Keelai niiti ti liini, ti faiti kaani nɔ, ʋelei Yesu boni la ti ma. <verse eid="LUK 19:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 19:33"/>Tɛi ti ɠɛni soovale ziʋoi viesu, ma nuiti ti ɠɛni ti ma: «Lee vaa zu wo soovale ziʋoi viesu?» <verse eid="LUK 19:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 19:34"/>Ti naati gooɠaaʋoteni, ti ɠɛ ma: «Màliɠii ɓɛdɛi ɠa ba.»<verse eid="LUK 19:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 19:35"/>Ti liini ga soovale ziʋoi Yesu ʋɔ, ti ta-zeɠe wolaiti pɛ kɔma, ti Yesu lɛ, ti sei kɔma. <verse eid="LUK 19:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 19:36"/>A la ɠɛna ziaa, nuiti ti ɗa ta-zeɠe wolaiti pɛɛ pelei zu. <verse eid="LUK 19:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 19:37"/>É maaɓuɠaai ma Zeluzalɛme ʋa, Wolive wulu ɓelei ma ɠizei yeizuʋɛ, kaladopoiti ti-ma ʋɛbɛ wolai laaveni ga koozunɛɛi, ti tɔɔzei ga GALA maamusɛa ga woo wola, tɔɔzei laavɔɔ vaiti ba, niiti ti ti ɠaani. <verse eid="LUK 19:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 19:38"/>Ti ɠɛni ɠɛɛzu ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 19:38">«Maliɠii tuya loo masagi ʋɛ, nii é ʋaazu daaseigi zu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 19:38">Ziilɛigi ɠɛ geeɠɔlɔgi zu, lɛbiyai ɠɛ GALA bɛ geeɠɔlɔgi ungaʋɛ!»<verse eid="LUK 19:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 19:39"/>Faliziɛin tanigaa ti ɠɛni bɛbɛi zaama, ti ɠɛni Yesu ma: «Kalamɔn, zelii lo ɗa-ɠaladopoiti ma, ti maaɠɛ kpɔ!» <verse eid="LUK 19:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 19:40"/>Yesu ti wooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ti ma: «Gè bo wo ma ga gaamai, ni ta maaɠɛna kpɔ, kɔtuiti ka ta ɠɛ ɓainsu!»<verse eid="LUK 19:40"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ɠɔlɔ vai Zeluzalɛme ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 19:41"/>Tɛi Yesu ɠɛni maaɓuɠazu taai ʋa, é kaai ma, é ɠɔlɔni ná-faa zu. <verse eid="LUK 19:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 19:42"/>É ɠɛni ma: «Ni ɗa ɓalaa è ɠɛni kwɛɛni naama volo nuu, ʋelei ɗa ziilɛigi zɔlɔɔ da! Kɛlɛ wɛlɛna kae, é lɔɔɠua è ʋa. <verse eid="LUK 19:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 19:43"/>Foloi tanigaa ta ʋaazu è ma, siɛgi zu è zili nuiti ti è maaɠakusu la ga kɔɔɠɔ aniiti, ti è zei kɛlɛ su, ti ɗa è ɓakpa pele ungi pɛ su. <verse eid="LUK 19:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 19:44"/>Ta wo zuɠoloɠolo mɛtu, wa ɗa-nuɓusɛiti, ti la ɗa-ɠɔtui gila kpalaa zɛga laani bɔɔla maazu, tɔɔzei è la kɛɛni, è ʋa naama voloi ɠwɛɛ, yeei GALA ge ʋaa la è ʋɔ.»<verse eid="LUK 19:44"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu pɔdi loo nuiti kpɛɛ vai <optbreak/> GALA sei ʋɛlɛi wu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-17">Matiyo 21:12-17</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="MRK 11:15-19">Maleke 11:15-19</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Zan 2:13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 19:45"/>Yesu lɛɛni GALA sei ʋɛlɛi ma ɠoizuʋɛ, é tɔɔzei ga yaaɠoiti kpɛa, <verse eid="LUK 19:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 19:46"/>é ɠɛ ti ma: «Sɛʋɛʋɛ GALA Sɛʋɛi zu ga: ‹Nà-pɛlɛi ɠa loli ga GALA fali ʋɛlɛi.›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:46 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 56:7">Eza 56:7</ref></char>.</char></note> Kɛlɛ wɔun, wo ná ɠɛa ga toosu nuiti dɔɔɠuzuʋɛ.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:46 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="JER 7:11">Zel 7:11</ref></char>.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 19:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 19:47"/>Folo-o-folo Yesu ɠɛni kalagi wosu GALA sei ʋɛlɛi wu. Zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠiiti ta tɔ kalamɔinti, naa ʋɛɛ nuɓusɛiti ta-ɠundiɠiiti ba, ti ɠɛni keleɠele gaiziɛzu ga ti pa. <verse eid="LUK 19:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 19:48"/>Kɛlɛ ti la ɠɛni kwɛɛ, ʋelei ta kɛɛ la, tɔɔzei nuɓusɛiti pɛ goiloga ɠɛni de goo ma.<verse eid="LUK 19:48"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="LUK 20"/>
  <para style="s">Mini ɠa Yesu ná-zobogi zeɠezu ná?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Matiyo 21:23-27</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Maleke 11:27-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 20:1"/>Tɛi Yesu ɠɛni nuiti kalasu naama voloi gila GALA sei ʋɛlɛi wu, é ɗa Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi laazeeli, zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠiiti ta tɔ kalamɔinti, naa ʋɛɛ totuɠɔiti ba, ti maaɓuɠani ba, <verse eid="LUK 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 20:2"/>ti ɠɛ ma: «Bo gi ma: Zobo kpɛgele ɠa è niima vaiti kɛɛzu la? Ɓɛ ɠa é ma zobogi vea è ya?»<verse eid="LUK 20:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 20:3"/>É ti wooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ti ma: «Nà ɓalaa, gaazaɠa gila ka bɛ̀ ga gè bo wo ma. <verse eid="LUK 20:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 20:4"/>Ɓɛ ɠa é zobogi veeni Zan ʋɛ ga é ɗa ɓatizei wo? GALA ge ɠɛni de, ɓaa nuiti kɛni de?»<verse eid="LUK 20:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 20:5"/>Ti yɛ sulatilatisu yɔɠɔzu, ti ɗa ɠɛ ma: «Ni ada ɠɛɛna ma: ‹GALA ge ɠɛni de,› toɠa ɠɛ ade ma: ‹Lee vaa zu mu wo la ɠɛni laani Zan la?› <verse eid="LUK 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 20:6"/>Kɛlɛ ada ɠɛɛna ma mɔnɔ: ‹Nuiti kɛni de,› nuɓusɛiti pɛ ta ade zɔɔ ga kɔtui, tɔɔzei ti pɛ ti laaʋɛ da ga Zan ɠɛni ga GALA goo wo nu.» <verse eid="LUK 20:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 20:7"/>Ti zɛba ti gooɠaaʋote, ti ɠɛ ma: «Gi la kwɛni.»<verse eid="LUK 20:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 20:8"/>Yesu ɠɛni ti ma: «Nɔ̀un nà ɓalaa gè la zobogi nii zeɠezu lɛa ga woye pɛ, nii gè niima vaiti kɛɛzu la.»<verse eid="LUK 20:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Faalaalii é ʋilɛ <optbreak/> kpele makɛ nu ɲɔiti ba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Matiyo 21:33-46</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Maleke 12:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 20:9"/>Yesu tɔɔzeini ga niima vaalaalii woga bɛbɛi ma, é ɠɛ ma: «Zunu ɠila ge leezɛn ɓelei laani, é kaliva kpele makɛ nua ma, é li zou ɠili su, é lɛbi ná. <verse eid="LUK 20:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 20:10"/>Naama waai ɠula yeeɠɛɠalai zeeliai ma, é botiɠɛ nu leʋeni kpele makɛ nuiti ma, ga ti daamiizuʋɛ ve kpele ɠaawaai zu. Kɛlɛ kpele makɛ nuiti ti botiɠɛ nui loɠani, ti zeaɲakai ɠaaɠale ma. <verse eid="LUK 20:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 20:11"/>Kpele kɛɛ nui botiɠɛ nui velesiɛi leʋeni ʋolu. Kpele makɛ nuiti ti doɠani ɓalaa, ti poomu, ti zeaɲakai ɠaaɠale ma. <verse eid="LUK 20:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 20:12"/>Kpele kɛɛ nui zɛba é botiɠɛ nui zaʋasiɛi leʋe, kpele makɛ nuiti ti maawana ɓalaa, ti pili ya.<verse eid="LUK 20:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 20:13"/>«Kpele kɛɛ nui ɠɛni ma: ‹Lee ɠa nà kɛ? Nà nɛ̀ɛbɛ loun zunui leʋesu, tanisu ta unfe naa ma.› <verse eid="LUK 20:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 20:14"/>Kɛlɛ tɛi kpele makɛ nuiti ti kaani nɔ feya, ti ɠɛni ɓɔɠɔ ma: ‹Pogani zeɠe nui ɠa. Ade paa, de ná-poganii zeɠe ga adɔnɔ.› <verse eid="LUK 20:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 20:15"/>Ti kulani kpelei ʋa, ti paa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:15">«Lee ɠa kpele kɛɛ nui a kɛ ga tiye? <verse eid="LUK 20:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 20:16"/>Toɠa ʋa, é kpele makɛ nui naati paa, naa ʋoluma é kpelei ɠaliva taɠiligaa ma.» Ti naama wooiti mɛnigai ma, ti ɠɛni ma: «Naa la ɠɛa pɛ!»<verse eid="LUK 20:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 20:17"/>Kɛlɛ Yesu wɛlɛni ti ɠaazu, é ɠɛ ti ma: «GALA gooi nii ʋoluʋɛ ɠa ga lee mu:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 20:17">‹Kɔtui nii pɛlɛ lo nuiti ti ɠɛlɛni ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 20:17">naa ɠa kɛai ga sɔɓelama ɠɔtu wolai›?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 118:22">Guy 118:22</ref></char>.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 20:17"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 20:18"/>Zɔi nɔpɛ é loozu kɔtui nii ma, naama nui ɠa ɓulukpulu. Zɔi nɔpɛ kɔtui nii a loo ma, ma nui wolowolo.»<verse eid="LUK 20:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 20:19"/>Tɔ kalamɔinti ta zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠiiti ti ɠɛni pɔ ga ti yeeʋɛɛ ma gaamanɔ, kɛlɛ ti luani bɛbɛi ʋa. Tɔɔzei ti gaaɠaani ga tiya ɠa Yesu faalaalii naa wogai ta-vaa zu.<verse eid="LUK 20:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mului zala vai Sezaal ma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Matiyo 22:15-22</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Maleke 12:13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 20:20"/>Ti tɔɔzeini naazu ga wɛlɛa Yesu ma fɛfɛ. Naa maaʋele ma, ti nui tanigaa leʋeni Yesu ma, niiti ti ɓɔɠɔ ɠulani eɠɛ telebo nu. Naati ti ʋaani ga ti Yesu zo tɔ ɓɔɠɔi daawooiti ba, ti ʋa dɔ zou zɛʋɛ ɠundiɠii yeezu, nii zobogi bɛ ga é ma lukpɔi ɠaaleʋe. <verse eid="LUK 20:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 20:21"/>Naama nuiti ti gaazaɠani, ti ɠɛ ma: «Kalamɔn, gi kwɛni ga ɗa ɓɔɛzu, è ɗa kalagi wo sɔledai zu, naa ʋoluma è la zeelɔzɔɠɔzu ɠɛɛzu nuiti ba, kɛlɛ ɗa kalagi wosu ga gaamai pɛ, é lo naa ʋa, ʋelei GALA ge pɔ ga nu ziɛ la. <verse eid="LUK 20:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 20:22"/>Bo gi ma mu: Tɔgi vaaʋɛ nɛi bu ga ade mului zala Wɔlɔme masagi Sezaal ma, ɓaa de mina sala ma?»<verse eid="LUK 20:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 20:23"/>Kɛlɛ Yesu ta-yaava ɠeleɠelegi ɠaani. É ti wooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ti ma: <verse eid="LUK 20:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 20:24"/>«À wali ɠae gila dɛɛ lɛɛ ga ze. Ɓɛ maaniini ta daasei ka é ma?» Ti gooɠaaʋoteni, ti ɠɛ ma: «Sezaal ʋe.»<verse eid="LUK 20:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 20:25"/>É ɠɛni ti ma naazu: «Deɠɛmu, nii é ga Sezaal nɔnɔi, à naa ve Sezaal ya, nii é ga GALA nɔnɔi, wo naa ve GALA zea.» <verse eid="LUK 20:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 20:26"/>Ti la ɠɛni zooni ti ʋa so ná-kpɔɛzuɠulai tanɔpɛ su bɛbɛi ɠaazu. Kɛlɛ tɔun ti laavɔɔni ga ná-gooɠaaʋotegi, ti maaɠɛ kpɔ.<verse eid="LUK 20:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Maaɠaalii é lo gɔvɛiti buzeɠe vai ʋa saai ya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Matiyo 22:23-33</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Maleke 12:18-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 20:27"/>Saduseyɛinti ti ʋaani pɔ bɛ. Naati ka ti ɠɛ gɔvɛiti ti la wuzeɠezu, ti ʋa ɠula saai ya. Ti niima ɠaazaɠagi woni da, ti ɠɛ ma: <verse eid="LUK 20:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 20:28"/>«Kalamɔn, Moize ná-sɛʋɛiti su, é niima levei veeni ade ya, é ɠɛ ma: ‹Ni zunui ta kɛɛɠɛloin a zaana, anzai bɛ, tama é la doun yɛni ga ʋoluʋelei, zunui naa maanɛɛʋɛ ga é ná-poanzai zei ga anza, nii a kɛ é kɛɛɠɛloin ma zuwui makɛ.›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 25:5">TSV 25:5</ref></char>.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 20:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 20:29"/>Tama, ɠɛɛɠɛloun lɔfela ɠɛni ná. Ma mɔungi vului ɠɛɛni, é za, é la doun yɛni. <verse eid="LUK 20:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 20:30"/>Felesiɛi poanzai zei, <verse eid="LUK 20:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 20:31"/>saʋasiɛi ɓalaa, ti lɔfela pɛ ti kɛɛni ɠana nɔ, ti pɛ ti za, ti la doun yɛni. <verse eid="LUK 20:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 20:32"/>Gaaɓelasu, anzanui ɓalaa za. <verse eid="LUK 20:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 20:33"/>Siɛgi zu niina gɔvɛiti ti wuzeɠezu la, ti ɠula saai ya, ɓɛ ɠa nɔnɔ ɠa ɠɛ ga anzai? Tɔɔzei seiʋɛ ti lɔfela pɛ bɛ ga anza?»<verse eid="LUK 20:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 20:34"/>Yesu ti wooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «Niima eteai zu nuɓusɛiti ta anzaiti seizu, anzanuiti ti ɗa zei zinigiti bɛ. <verse eid="LUK 20:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 20:35"/>Kɛlɛ niiti ta zoloo ga ti tɔnɔ zɔlɔɔ etea niinɛi zu é ʋaazu, gɔvɛiti buzeɠe ziɛgi zu, ti ɠula saai ya, naati ti la mɔ anza zeɠea, ti la mɔ zeiɗa zini bɛ. <verse eid="LUK 20:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 20:36"/>Ti la mɔ zooga ɓalaa zaazu, tɔɔzei ta ɠɛ eɠɛ geezuɠeelaiti. Ta ɠɛ ga GALA dointi, mazɔlɔɔ ti wuzeɠea, ti ɠula saai ya. <verse eid="LUK 20:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 20:37"/>Moize kulaʋɛ kɛlɛma kpezekele ga gɔvɛiti ta wuzeɠe, ti ɠula saai ya, ga naama wooi maaʋele nii é sɛʋɛni, é lo kpɔvɔ goi ʋa, siɛgi zu é Maliɠii lolisu la ga Abalaame, Izaake, ta Zakɔɓe ta-ƓALAGI.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 3:6">Ɛgz 3:6</ref></char>.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 20:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 20:38"/>GALA ge la ga gɔvɛiti ta-ƓALA, kɛlɛ toɠa ga fulu nuiti ta-ƓALAGI. Mazɔlɔɔ nuiti pɛ ta vulua GALA gaazu.»<verse eid="LUK 20:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 20:39"/>Tɔ kalamɔin tanigaa ti ɠɛni ma: «Kalamɔn, è ɓɔɛʋɛ ga pagɔ.» <verse eid="LUK 20:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 20:40"/>Mazɔlɔɔ ti yii la mɔ ɠɛni lɔɔzu, ti ʋa gaazaɠa.<verse eid="LUK 20:40"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kilista ta Davide ti yɔɠɔzuʋɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Matiyo 22:41-46</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Maleke 12:35-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 20:41"/>Yesu ɠɛni ti ma: «Toɠa ɠale, Kilista ɠa loli ga Davide mavofodai? <verse eid="LUK 20:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 20:42"/>Tɔɔzei Davide ɓɔɠɔi ɠa bosu GALA Sɛʋɛi ma wuye zɛʋɛi zu, é ɠɛ ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 20:42">‹Maliɠii GALA ge ɠɛni Màliɠii ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 20:42">Zei zèezazuʋɛ,<verse eid="LUK 20:42"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 20:43"/>eyɛsu gè è zili nuiti kɛ ga ɗa-ɠɔɠɔloma anii.›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:42-43 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Guy 110:1</ref></char>.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 20:43"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 20:44"/>Davide ɠa tolisu ga tɔun Maliɠii, é leʋe ɠale mu, é ɗa ɠɛ ga naa mavofodai?»<verse eid="LUK 20:44"/></para>
  <para style="s">Tɔ kalamɔinti ta-ʋeelalai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Matiyo 23:1-36</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Maleke 12:38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 20:45"/>Siɛgi zu bɛbɛi pɛ ge ɠɛni woilosu la goo ma, Yesu ɠɛni ná-kaladopoiti ma: <verse eid="LUK 20:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 20:46"/>«À dama ga tɔ kalamɔinti, niiti ti-yiimai ga ti ɗa ziɛziɛ seɠe wolaiti su, ta ti wɔinɗai ga ti ɗa ti luʋɔ kɛlɛmaʋɛti. Lɛbiya zeizuʋɛti nɛai ti ʋɛ GALA dɛbi ʋɛlɛiti bu, ta seizu ʋagɔiti fɛti laami wosuʋɛti. <verse eid="LUK 20:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 20:47"/>Ti ɗa poanzaiti kɔligiti kula ti ya, ti ɗa GALA fali zuɠoozagiti kɛ, nii a kɛ nuɓusɛiti ti ʋa ɗa ti ɠa. Ta-ʋeelalai wola ɠa ɲɔu ti ma.»<verse eid="LUK 20:47"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="LUK 21"/>
  <para style="s">Poanzai ná-GALA kɔɔi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:41-44">Maleke 12:41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 21:1"/>Yesu ɠaazuwuzeɠeni, é naavolo nuiti ka, ti ɗa ta-vebɛaniiti dɔ GALA kɔɔ aniɲakai zu. <verse eid="LUK 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 21:2"/>É wɛlɛni ɓalaa, é poanzai gila ka, nii é ɠɛni ga bala nui, é ɗa wali ɠae go felegɔ lɔ su. <verse eid="LUK 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 21:3"/>É ɠɛni ma: «Gè bo wo ma ga gaamai, poanzai tɛi é ga bala nui, é feeʋɛ é leʋe ɛsɛ pɛ ba. <verse eid="LUK 21:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 21:4"/>Mazɔlɔɔ zɔiti ti waliiti feeʋɛ, nii ti ɓɛdɛ la ɠɛa ba. Kɛlɛ tɔun, anɛɛ balagɛ, é kɔnɔgi pɛ feeʋɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 21:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">GALA sei ʋɛlɛi ɠoloɠolo fai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:1-2">Matiyo 24:1-2</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="MRK 13:1-2">Maleke 13:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 21:5"/>Nui tanigaa ti ɠɛni GALA sei ʋɛlɛi ʋa pelei zuɠulazu, ʋelei maaɠiliai la ga kɔtu ʋapagiti, ta ani ʋapagiti niiti nuiti ti ʋaazu la ga vebɛaniiti. Yesu ɠɛni ti ma: <verse eid="LUK 21:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 21:6"/>«Foloi tanigaa ta ʋaazu, nii ɠani wo kaazu, kɔtu ɠila kpalaa ge la yɛga laani bɔɔla maazu, ti pɛ ta lokasu.»<verse eid="LUK 21:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Maanɔɠɔiti ta faaɓaagiti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:3-14">Matiyo 24:3-14</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="MRK 13:3-13">Maleke 13:3-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 21:7"/>Ti gaazaɠani, ti ɠɛ ma: «Kalamɔn, yeelɛ ɠa naama vai ʋaazu ɠɛɛzu la? Naa ʋoluma poogi ma ɓɛgele ɠa nu a kwɛɛ da ga naama vaiti ta ga ʋa ɠɛɛzu?» <verse eid="LUK 21:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 21:8"/>É ti wooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ti ma: «À dama, nu nɔpɛ ge mina wo ɠaka. Tɔɔzei nu mɔinmɔin ka kpɛtɛ ɠisu ga ti ʋa dàaseigi zu, ti ɗa ɠɛ ma: ‹Nà ɠa gè ga Kilista,› ta ‹Yeeɠɛɠalai zeelia!› À mina ʋilɛ ti ʋolu. <verse eid="LUK 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 21:9"/>Siɛgi zu wo kɔɔiti maawoo mɛnisu da, ta faa wuuleegiti, à mina lua. Mazɔlɔɔ kɛni naama vaiti ti ɠɛ, kɛlɛ naa lɛi é ʋa ɠɛ ɠɛɛzu ga gaaɓelagi gaamanɔ.»<verse eid="LUK 21:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 21:10"/>Naa ʋoluma, é ɠɛni ti ma: «Zii ta ɠa wuzeɠe bɔɔla zii laalɔɠɔma, masadai ta ɠa wuzeɠe bɔɔla masadai laalɔɠɔma. <verse eid="LUK 21:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 21:11"/>Zou ɓali wolaiti ta ɗa ɠɛ, pulu wolaiti ti ɗa loo ada mɔinmɔin, ta ɗɔfɔ zeeɓɛiti ti ɗa ʋa. Maalua vaiti ta poo golaiti ta ɗa zeɠe geeɠɔlɔgi zu, ti ɗa ʋa.<verse eid="LUK 21:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 21:12"/>«Kɛlɛ naati ti ʋa ɠɛ ti ɠɛ, ta wo zo, ti wo wɔinzeɠe, ti li ga woye tukpɔɠaaleʋezuʋɛti, GALA dɛbi ʋɛlɛiti bu, ti wo ʋili kasoiti ga. Ta li ga woye masagiti ta kundiɠiiti kakala nɔ̀un maaʋele ma. <verse eid="LUK 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 21:13"/>Naa ɠa zobogi ve wo ʋɛ, wo zeele wooi wo ti ma. <verse eid="LUK 21:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 21:14"/>À da ɠisu ga wo mina yiizoolɛ ma yeeluɠɔ ga ʋelei wa woozuɠula la. <verse eid="LUK 21:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 21:15"/>Mazɔlɔɔ nà daaʋɛ ta ɠigi ve wo ya, niiti wo zili nuiti ti la zooga losu ti luɠɔ, ɓaa ti ʋa maaɠaali. <verse eid="LUK 21:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 21:16"/>Wo zɔlɔɔ nui, ta wo-ɠɛɛlointi, naa ʋɛɛ wa-nuiti ta wo-wɔɔlaiti ba, ta wo ɠwɛɛ, ti tanigaa ʋaa wo zaama. <verse eid="LUK 21:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 21:17"/>Ɛsɛ pɛ ka wo wɔinzeɠe nɔ̀un maaʋele ma. <verse eid="LUK 21:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 21:18"/>Kɛlɛ anɛɛ wo unma undeɠai gila kpalaa ge la loa ya. <verse eid="LUK 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 21:19"/>Wa lona kpaan, wa wo-yɛnvui ɠizo.»<verse eid="LUK 21:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Zeluzalɛme ɠoloɠolo fai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:15-21">Matiyo 24:15-21</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="MRK 13:14-19">Maleke 13:14-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 21:20"/>«Siɛgi zu wo Zeluzalɛme ɠaazu la, maaɠakugai ga kɔɔɓɔgiti, à kwɛɛ naazu ga koloɠolo fai maaɓuɠaa. <verse eid="LUK 21:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 21:21"/>Naazu zɔiti ta ɠɛ Zudé, naati ti ʋela, ti lɛ gizeiti ma. Niiti ta ɠɛ Zeluzalɛme taa zaamaʋɛ, naati ti ɠula taai ʋa. Zɔiti ta ɠɛ kpalagiti su, ti mina ɠale ma taazuʋɛ. <verse eid="LUK 21:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 21:22"/>Mazɔlɔɔ naati ta ɠɛɛzu ga GALA ná-doɠa wo foloiti, nii a kɛ nii kpein sɛʋɛai, ti laazeeli. <verse eid="LUK 21:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 21:23"/>Naama voloiti su, maanɔɠɔi ɠa ɠɛ koma anzanuiti bɛ ta zɔiti ti ɲiimi veezu, mazɔlɔɔ nimiza wolai ɠa ɠɛ zooi nii zu, ta GALA ná-ziiɠaawanai ɠa ɠɛ su nuɓusɛiti ma. <verse eid="LUK 21:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 21:24"/>Ta za ga boɠa zɔkpɔi, ta ɠɛ ga kɔɔ luɔiti, ti li ga tiye zou ɠilagilagi pɛ su. Zii ɠiligiti ta ɠɔɠɔziɛ Zeluzalɛme zu, eyɛsu zii ɠiligiti ta-yeeɠɛɠalai ɓe.»<verse eid="LUK 21:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nu ná-Doun Zunui ʋaa vai ʋolu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:29-31">Matiyo 24:29-31</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="MRK 13:24-27">Maleke 13:24-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 21:25"/>«Poogiti ta ɠɛ foloi, alugi ta somideɠaiti su. Zooi ma zii ɠiligiti ta ɠɛ koozuʋili golai zu, ti la kwɛɛga nii ta zoo kɛɛzu, tɔɔzei kpoloɗɛ lugi ʋa, ta ma lakpatakpa golaiti. <verse eid="LUK 21:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 21:26"/>Nuiti su ɠa vidi ga maanɔɠɔ wolai ʋa luabai, nii é ʋaazu zooi ɠɔlɔkɔlɔma ná pɛ, mazɔlɔɔ geeɠɔlɔgi zu zɛbɛiti ta ɲiikpi. <verse eid="LUK 21:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 21:27"/>Naazu, ta ʋaazu Nu ná-Doun Zunui ɠaazu, é ɗa ʋa tonaɓiingi maazu ga zɛbɛi ta lɛbiya wolai. <verse eid="LUK 21:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 21:28"/>Siɛgi zu wo naama vaiti kaazu la, ti tɔɔzei ga ti ɗa ɠɛ, à ɠaalɔ, wo wɔungi wuzeɠe, mazɔlɔɔ wa-unmɔɔgi maaɓuɠaa.»<verse eid="LUK 21:28"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kalagi nu a sɔlɔɔ kooleɠoole gului ʋa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:32-35">Matiyo 24:32-35</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="MRK 13:28-31">Maleke 13:28-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 21:29"/>Yesu faalaali ɠila boni ti ma, é ɠɛ ma: «À kooleɠoole gului ʋɛtɛ dɛɛ, ta guluiti pɛ. <verse eid="LUK 21:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 21:30"/>Siɛgi zu ti lɛnusu la, wa ɓɔɠɔi wo kwɛni naazu ga foɠoi maaɓuɠaa. <verse eid="LUK 21:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 21:31"/>Ʋele nɔ ɠana é la, siɛgi zu wo niima vaiti kaazu la, ti ɗa ɠɛ, à kwɛɛ ga GALA ná-masadai maaɓuɠaa. <verse eid="LUK 21:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 21:32"/>Gè bo wo ma ga gaamai, yamanii nii la ɓega ga leʋe, eyɛsu niima vaiti pɛ ti ɗa ɠɛ. <verse eid="LUK 21:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 21:33"/>Geeɠɔlɔgi ta zooi ta leʋe, kɛlɛ nɔ̀un daawooiti ti la leʋega pɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 21:33"/></para>
  <para style="s">Tɛnɛgi é lo gwɛlɛ ɓɔɠɔmai ʋa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 21:34"/>«À wɛlɛ ɓɔɠɔ ma, nii a kɛ wo mina ɓɔɠɔ ɠidaaʋili ga faa lateʋegaiti ta dɔɔzodai, naa ʋɛɛ etea yiizoolɛiti ba, nii a kɛ niima voloi mina ɠula wo viliba, <verse eid="LUK 21:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 21:35"/>ga balii ɠɛʋele, mazɔlɔɔ toɠa ʋaazu eteai ɠɔlɔkɔlɔma, nuɓusɛiti pɛ ma. <verse eid="LUK 21:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 21:36"/>À wɛlɛ ɓɔɠɔ ma mu, wo GALA fali ɠɛ siɛnɔpɛ su, naa ɠa a kɛ wo zɛbɛi zɔlɔɔ, wo ziɛ naama vaiti pɛ bu, wo zoo wo lo Nu ná-Doun Zunui ɠakala.»<verse eid="LUK 21:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 21:37"/>Yesu ɠɛni ná-foloiti seɠezu, é ɗa kalagi wo GALA sei ʋɛlɛi wu, kɛlɛ kpɔkɔi é ɠɛni ɠulazu, é li, é ɲi Wolive wulu ɓelei ma ɠizei ma. <verse eid="LUK 21:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 21:38"/>Nuɓusɛiti ma, ti ɠɛni ʋaazu ga sobuzobui GALA sei ʋɛlɛi wu, nii a kɛ ti woilo gooi ma.<verse eid="LUK 21:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="LUK 22"/>
  <para style="s">Yaavai ɠili vai Yesu ma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Matiyo 26:1-5</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Maleke 14:1-2</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Zan 11:45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 22:1"/>Ɓului nii lɛʋɛ la su, naama vɛtii, daaseigi ga <char style="w">Pakegi</char>, naa maa ɠɛni ɓuɠazu. <verse eid="LUK 22:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 22:2"/>Zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠiiti ta tɔ kalamɔinti ti ɠɛni keleɠele gaiziɛzu, ʋelei ta Yesu ʋaa la, tɔɔzei ti ɠɛni luazu nuɓusɛiti ba.<verse eid="LUK 22:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Zudase yeezei vai Yesu yaava vai wu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:14-16">Matiyo 26:14-16</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="MRK 14:10-11">Maleke 14:10-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 22:3"/>Naama yeeɠɛɠalai Setana lɔɔni keela puugɔ maazu felegɔi (12) ɠila su, Zudase, nii é lolisu ga Isekaliyɔte. <verse eid="LUK 22:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 22:4"/>Zudase liini, ti zoloo su ta zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠiiti, naa ʋɛɛ GALA sei ʋɛlɛi maaɓɛɛ ɠundiɠiiti ba, ʋelei a zoo é Yesu lɔ la ti yeezu. <verse eid="LUK 22:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 22:5"/>Ti wola ɠoozunɛɛni, ti minazeɠe bɛ ga ti wali ve zea. <verse eid="LUK 22:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 22:6"/>É yeezeini naa wu, é tɔɔzei ga yeeɠɛɠala ʋagɔ ɠaiziaa, é ʋa Yesu lɔ ti yeezu, bɛbɛi mina faa ɠwɛɛ su.<verse eid="LUK 22:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ta kaladopoiti <optbreak/> ti Pake daamii ɠɛʋele ɓɛtɛ vai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:17-25">Matiyo 26:17-25</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="MRK 14:12-21">Maleke 14:12-21</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Zan 13:21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 22:7"/>Ɓului nii lɛʋɛ la su, naama vɛti voloi zeelini, yeei ti maanɛɛni la ga ti Pakegi ma ʋaala ziʋoi ʋaa. <verse eid="LUK 22:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 22:8"/>Yesu Piyɛlɛ ta Zan leʋeni naazu, é ɠɛ ti ma: «À li, wo <char style="w" lemma="Pakegi">Pake</char> daamii ɠɛʋele ɓɛtɛ ade ʋɛ, ade ʋa mi.» <verse eid="LUK 22:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 22:9"/>Ti ɠɛni ma: «Mini ɠa è pɔ ga gi kɛʋele ɓɛtɛ ná?»<verse eid="LUK 22:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 22:10"/>É ɠɛni ti ma: «Wa lɛɛna taazuʋɛ, wa ɠomi wa zunui ta, ziɛ liɠii unma. À ʋilɛ polu, pɛlɛi wuʋɛ é lɛɛzu ná. <verse eid="LUK 22:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 22:11"/>Naa ʋoluma wo ɠɛ pɛlɛ kɛɛ nui ma: ‹Kalamɔn ɠɛ: Pɛlɛi ɠa mini, ʋɛ gè ʋaazu <char style="w" lemma="Pakegi">Pake</char> daamii wosu ná, gá nà-kaladopoiti?› <verse eid="LUK 22:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 22:12"/>Zunui naa ɠa geezu ʋɛlɛ wolai wu lɛɛzu ga woye, ʋɛ ná wuuɓɛtɛai. Miná ɠa wa kɛʋele ɓɛtɛi ɠɛ ná.»<verse eid="LUK 22:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 22:13"/>Ti liini, ti fai pɛ kaani nɔ ga ʋelei Yesu boni la ti ma. Ti <char style="w" lemma="Pakegi">Pake</char> daamii ɠɛʋele ɓɛtɛni.<verse eid="LUK 22:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Maliɠii ná-Pake daamii ɠaaɓelagi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:26-30">Matiyo 26:26-30</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="MRK 14:22-25">Maleke 14:22-25</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1 Kolɛnte 11:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 22:14"/>Yeeɠɛɠalai zeeliai ma, Yesu zeini daami laɓalii ɠakala ta keelaiti. <verse eid="LUK 22:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 22:15"/>É ɠɛni ma: «Wɔin ɠɛa mà gola ga ade <char style="w" lemma="Pakegi">Pake</char> daamii nii wo ʋɔɔma, aisa gè ʋa ɓɔlɔ. <verse eid="LUK 22:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 22:16"/>Gè bo wo ma, gè la mɔ ta mia, eyɛsu daazeeli GALA ná-masadai zu.»<verse eid="LUK 22:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 22:17"/>Naa ʋoluma, é ziawɔi zeɠeni. Kpegai ma ga mamagi ve GALA bɛ, é ɠɛni ti ma: «À nii zeɠe, wo ɓɔɔle la wo pɛ. <verse eid="LUK 22:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 22:18"/>Mazɔlɔɔ, gè bo wo ma, é zo za ma, é li naa luɠɔ, gè la mɔ ansaɠɔ gwaai ma ɗɛi ta ɓɔlea pɛ, eyɛsu GALA ná-masadai ʋa.»<verse eid="LUK 22:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 22:19"/>Naa ʋoluma, é ɓului zeɠeni. Kpegai ma ga mamagi ve GALA bɛ, é galeɠaleni, é fe ti ya, é ɠɛ ti ma: «Nii ɠa é ga kpùsɛi, feai wo ma vaa ma. À nii ɠɛ, wo ɠizɛ sù.»<verse eid="LUK 22:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 22:20"/>Ʋele nɔ ɠana ɓalaa, daamii ʋoluma, é ziawɔi zeɠeni, é ɠɛni ti ma: «Ziawɔi nii ɠa é ga minazeɠe niinɛi, daazeeliai ga mà ɲamai maaʋele, nii puai wo ʋɛ.<verse eid="LUK 22:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 22:21"/>«Kɛlɛ yàava nui ɠa zeini taɓalii ɠakala, gi ɗa laamii ʋɔɔma. <verse eid="LUK 22:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 22:22"/>Tama, Nu ná-Doun Zunui ɠa za, pelei GALA ge deveai la. Kɛlɛ maanɔɠɔi ɠa naama nui luɠɔ, nii é ʋaazu dɔɔzu sili nuiti zeezu.»<verse eid="LUK 22:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 22:23"/>Ti tɔɔzeini ga ti ɗa ɓɔɠɔ ɠaazaɠa ga ɓɛ ɠa é ti zaama, é ʋaazu niima vai ɠɛɛzu.<verse eid="LUK 22:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ɓɛ ɠa bɔɔlɔai ɛsɛ pɛ ba?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 22:24"/>Maaɠaalii ta wuzeɠeni ɓalaa naazu kaladopoiti zɔɠɔzu ga ti ʋa kwɛɛ zɔi bɔɔlɔai ti zaama. <verse eid="LUK 22:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 22:25"/>Yesu ɠɛni ti ma: «Zii ɠiligiti ta-masagiti ta ɓɔɠɔ ɠɛɛzu ga ti-maliɠiiti, zɔiti ti zeizu nuɓusɛiti unga, naati ta lolisu ga faa ʋagɔ ɠɛɛ nuiti. <verse eid="LUK 22:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 22:26"/>Wɔun, naa ta mina ɠɛ wo zaama. Zɔi bɔɔlɔai wo zaama, naa ɠɛ eɠɛ doungoi. Deve wo nui ɠɛ eɠɛ botiɠɛ nui. <verse eid="LUK 22:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 22:27"/>Mazɔlɔɔ ɓɛ ɠa bɔɔlɔai, zɔi é daamii wo taɓalii ɠa, ɓaa zɔi é maaleʋebogi wosu? Zɔi é daami wosuʋɛ kɛlɛ? Nà ma, nà wo zaama ga maaleʋebo nu.<verse eid="LUK 22:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 22:28"/>«Wa ɠa wo yiilɔa pòlu nà-kpɔlɔiti su. <verse eid="LUK 22:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 22:29"/>Naa ɠa é ba, nà masadai veezu wo ya, pelei Kɛ̀ɛ fea la zèa, <verse eid="LUK 22:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 22:30"/>wa daamii ta kpɔɔlei wo nà-taɓalii ɠa nà-masadai zu, wo zei masa kpɔkpɔgiti ga, wo ɗa Izilayɛle woloda puugɔ maazu felegɔiti (12) tukpɔɠaaleʋe.»<verse eid="LUK 22:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu bo fai ga <optbreak/> Piyɛlɛ ɠa ʋaazu ɠɛlɛzu ba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Matiyo 26:31-35</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Maleke 14:27-31</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Zan 13:36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 22:31"/>«Simon, Simon, woilo, Setana wo maavaliʋɛ ga é wo ɠaavɛ, eɠɛʋelei molo ɠaavɛɛ nui a ɗa kɛ la. <verse eid="LUK 22:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 22:32"/>Kɛlɛ gè GALA faliʋɛ è ʋɛ, Simon, nii a kɛ ɗa-ɠidaaleʋei mina ɲɛɛlɛ. Ɗa ma, ɗa ɠalena ma ʋolu, è-ɠɛɛlointi sɛbɛlɔ.»<verse eid="LUK 22:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 22:33"/>Piyɛlɛ ɠɛni ma: «Màliɠii, kɛ̀ʋele ɓɛtɛʋɛ ga de li ʋɔɔma kasoi ɠa, anɛɛ ɓalaa de za.» <verse eid="LUK 22:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 22:34"/>Yesu ɠɛni ma: «Gè bo è ma, Piyɛlɛ, tɛɛ zinɛi la ɓɔɛa za, ni è la ɠɛlɛni bà, ná zeizu ʋa ɠɛ saʋa, ga è la kwɛ̀ɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 22:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Wali ʋuu ɓɔlɔi, ta ɓɔlɔi, <optbreak/> naa ʋɛɛ boɠa zɔkpɔi ʋa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 22:35"/>Naa ʋoluma, Yesu ɠɛni ti ma: «Siɛgi zu gè wo leʋeni la, wali ʋuu ɓɔlɔ la wo ya, ɓaa ɓɔlɔ, ɓaa saʋala, leeni ɠa wo ʋalani ma?» Ti ɠɛni ma: «Ani nɔpɛ.» <verse eid="LUK 22:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 22:36"/>É ɠɛni ti ma: «Kɛlɛ niizu, zɔi wali ʋuu ɓɔlɔ zea, é seɠe, zɔi ɓɔlɔ zea ɓalaa, é seɠe. Zɔi boɠa zɔkpɔ la zea, é ná-seɠe wolai ʋɔdi, é ta ɠeya. <verse eid="LUK 22:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 22:37"/>Gè bo wo ma, kɛni GALA Sɛʋɛi zu wooi nii laazeeli nà-eteai zu, naa ɠa ga: ‹É ɠaaluni tɔ koloɠolo nuiti saama.› Faiti ti woni nà-faa zu, ti laa ɠa zeeli.» <verse eid="LUK 22:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 22:38"/>Kaladopoiti ti ɠɛni ma: «Màliɠii, wɛlɛ boɠa zɔkpɔ felegɔ ʋa.» É ɠɛni ti ma: «Naa kula ɠɛa su.»<verse eid="LUK 22:38"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu GALA fali vai Wolive wulu ɓelei ma ɠizei ma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Matiyo 26:36-46</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Maleke 14:32-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 22:39"/>Yesu ɠulani, é li Wolive wulu ɓelei ma ɠizei ma, eɠɛʋelei a ɗa kɛ la pɔlɔma. Ná-kaladopoiti ti ʋilɛni polu. <verse eid="LUK 22:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 22:40"/>Ti zeeliai ma miná, é ɠɛni ti ma: «À GALA fali, naa ɠa a kɛ wo mina loo tɛgai zu.»<verse eid="LUK 22:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 22:41"/>É maaɠoozani ti ʋa, ti yɔɠɔzuʋɛ ɠɛ ga kɔtu ʋili daa ɠila kɛɠala, é ʋilɛ ɲiibiɠa, é GALA fali, <verse eid="LUK 22:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 22:42"/>é ɗa ɠɛ ma: «Ee, Kɛ̀ɛ, ni ɗa kɛɛna, soolɛi ma ɗaawɔi nii maaɠooza bà. Kɛlɛ anɛɛ naa ʋe, zìima vai mina ɠɛ, kɛni ɗɔnɔi nɔ.» <verse eid="LUK 22:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 22:43"/>[Geezuɠeelai ta ɠulani bɛ kɛlɛma naazu, é ɗa sɛbɛlɔ. <verse eid="LUK 22:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 22:44"/>Tɛi ziiɓɔlɔi ɠɛni Yesu ma, é ɠaaɓaani GALA falii zu. Ma vɔdɔi ɠɛni eɠɛ ɲamai, é ɗa ʋilɛ peinpein zooi ma.]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:43-44 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Wooi niiti ti [ ] kpaku felegɔiti zɔɠɔzu, naati ti la sɛʋɛ wɔlɔmai tanigaa zu.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 22:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 22:45"/>Kpegai ma ga GALA fali, é wuzeɠeni, é ɠale ma kaladopoiti pɔ bɛ, é ti ɠa ɲiizu ziiɓɔlɔi maaʋele ma. <verse eid="LUK 22:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 22:46"/>É ɠɛni ti ma: «Lee ʋe wo ɲiizu? À wuzeɠe, wo GALA fali, naa ɠa a kɛ wo mina loo tɛgai zu.»<verse eid="LUK 22:46"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu zo fai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Matiyo 26:47-56</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Maleke 14:43-50</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="JHN 18:3-11">Zan 18:3-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 22:47"/>Yesu ɠɛni dɛ ɓɔɛzu nɔ, eyɛsu bɛbɛi unkula. Zudase loni ti luɠɔ, keela puugɔ maazu felegɔi (12) ɠila ge ɠɛni de. É maaɓuɠani Yesu ʋa ga é nɛɛnɛ ga daaʋɛ komagai. <verse eid="LUK 22:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 22:48"/>Yesu ɠɛni ma: «Zudase, daaʋɛ komagai ɠa è Nu ná-Doun Zunui yaavazu la ɓaa?»<verse eid="LUK 22:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 22:49"/>Yesu ɠoba nuiti ti naama vai ɠaai ma, nii é ɠɛni ʋaazu ɠɛɛzu, ti ɠɛni ma: «Màliɠii, gá zoo gi boɠa zɔkpɔi ʋili ɓaa?» <verse eid="LUK 22:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 22:50"/>Ti ɠila ge boɠa zɔkpɔi ʋilini zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠi wolai ná-duɔi ma, é naa yeezazu ʋele woii leʋe ba. <verse eid="LUK 22:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 22:51"/>Kɛlɛ Yesu kpɔɛi zeɠeni, é ɠɛ ti ma: «À zɛ ná ɠana!» É yeevɔɔɠuni zunui naa woii ʋa, é kɛdɛ.<verse eid="LUK 22:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 22:52"/>Naa ʋoluma, Yesu ɠɛni zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠiiti ma, ta GALA sei ʋɛlɛi maaɓɛɛ ɠundiɠiiti, naa ʋɛɛ totuɠɔiti ba, ti ʋaani daalɔɠɔma: «Wo ʋaaʋɛ ga boɠa zɔkpɔiti ta kpekpe kpuɠaiti, eɠɛ toosu nu zo faa? <verse eid="LUK 22:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 22:53"/>Folo-o-folo gè ɠɛa wo ʋa GALA sei ʋɛlɛi ma ɠoizuʋɛ, wo la sòni názu. Kɛlɛ yeeɠɛɠalai nii ɠa ga wɔnɔ, é ɠɛ ga kpidii ná-zobogi nɔnɔ.»<verse eid="LUK 22:53"/></para>
  <para style="s">Piyɛlɛ ɠɛlɛ vai Yesu ʋa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:57-58">Matiyo 26:57-58</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 26:69-75">69-75</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="MRK 14:53-54">Maleke 14:53-54</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 14:66-72">66-72</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="JHN 18:12-18">Zan 18:12-18</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 22:54"/>Ti Yesu zoni, ti lii la zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠi wolai ná-koizuʋɛ. Piyɛlɛ ʋilɛni ti ʋolu ɠoozama. <verse eid="LUK 22:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 22:55"/>Tɛi ti abui ɠaazoni koi zaamaʋɛ, ti zei ma, Piyɛlɛ zeini ti zaama. <verse eid="LUK 22:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 22:56"/>Botiɠɛ anzanu ɠila ge kaani zeini abui ɠoba, é ɠaazulo ba, é ɠɛ ma: «Zunui nii ɓalaa ɠɛni ba.» <verse eid="LUK 22:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 22:57"/>Kɛlɛ Piyɛlɛ zeɠeni ga, é ɠɛ ma: «Anzanu, gè la zunui nii ɠwɛɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 22:57"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 22:58"/>Ná tago kɛai ma, taɠili ge kaani, é ɠɛ ma: «Ɗa ɓalaa, ɗa ga niima nuiti ti ta.» Kɛlɛ Piyɛlɛ ɠɛni ma: «Gè la ga ti ta.»<verse eid="LUK 22:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 22:59"/>Ná tago kɛai ma, taɠili ge maaɓakpani, é ɠɛ ma: «Gaamazu, zunui nii ɓalaa ɠɛni ba, tɔɔzei toɠa ga Galilé nu.» <verse eid="LUK 22:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 22:60"/>Kɛlɛ Piyɛlɛ ɠɛni ma: «Gè la vɔlɔ kwɛni nii è bosu.» Gaamago nɔ, é yɛni ɓɔɛzu, tɛɛ zinɛi ɓɔɛ. <verse eid="LUK 22:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 22:61"/>Maliɠii latini, é wɛlɛ Piyɛlɛ ʋa. Piyɛlɛ ɠigi looni Maliɠii wooi zu, nii é boni ma ga: «Za, tɛɛ zinɛi ʋa ɠɛ é ɓɔɛ, ɗa ʋaazu ɠɛlɛzu bà ná zeizu ɠɛ saʋa.» <verse eid="LUK 22:61"/><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 22:62"/>É ɠulani, é wɔlɔ ga gola.<verse eid="LUK 22:62"/></para>
  <para style="s">Salaʋusuiti ti ɲɛɛɠula vai Yesu zu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:67-68">Matiyo 26:67-68</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="MRK 14:65">Maleke 14:65</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 22:63"/>Nui niiti Yesu ɠɛni ti ya, ti ɠɛni ɲɛɛɠulazu su, ti ɗa doɠa. <verse eid="LUK 22:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 22:64"/>Ti ɠɛni seɠei ʋɛɛzu gaazu, ti ɗa gaazaɠa, ti ɗa ɠɛ ma: «Ɓɛ ɠa é è loɠaai? Naama nui lɛ ga giye!» <verse eid="LUK 22:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 22:65"/>Ti woo ɲɔu mɔinmɔin kiligaa woni daalɔɠɔma.<verse eid="LUK 22:65"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu tukpɔɠaaleʋe nu wolaiti kakala</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Matiyo 26:59-66</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Maleke 14:55-64</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">Zan 18:19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 22:66"/>Geelaalaogai ma, nuɓusɛiti ta-lotuɠɔiti ta zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠiiti, naa ʋɛɛ tɔ kalamɔinti ba, ti ɠaalɛɛni ba, ti li ga Yesu ta-lukpɔɠaaleʋezuʋɛ, <verse eid="LUK 22:66"/><verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 22:67"/>ti ɠɛ ma: «Ni ɗa ɠa è ga Kilista, naa wo gi ma.» Yesu ɠɛ ti ma: «Gè bo pa de wo ma, wo la laa nɔ̀un da, <verse eid="LUK 22:67"/><verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 22:68"/>ni nà ma, nà wo ɠaazaɠana, wo la gòoɠaaʋotega. <verse eid="LUK 22:68"/><verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 22:69"/>Kɛlɛ za ʋoluma, Nu ná-Doun Zunui ɠa ɠɛ zeini Zɛbɛsu ƓALAGI yeezazuʋɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 22:69"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 22:70"/>Ti ɠɛni ma: «Ɗa ga GALA Doun Zunui mu ɓaa?» É ti wooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «Wa ɓɔɠɔi wo boga, wo ɠɛ nà ʋe.» <verse eid="LUK 22:70"/><verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 22:71"/>Ti ɠɛni ɓɔɠɔ ma: «Ada ɓɔɠɔi ade mɛniga da. Zeele ɓɛgele ɠa ade ɓɛdɛi ba niina?»<verse eid="LUK 22:71"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="LUK 23"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu ɠɛɛ vai Pilate ɠakala</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Matiyo 27:1-2</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Maleke 15:1-5</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="JHN 18:28-38">Zan 18:28-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 23:1"/>Ti pɛ ti wuzeɠeni ʋɔɔma, ti li ga Yesu Pilate ʋɔ. <verse eid="LUK 23:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 23:2"/>Ti tɔɔzeini miná ga maalɔa, ti ɗa ɠɛ ma: «Gi zunui nii zogɛ, é ɗa gá-nuɓusɛiti kaka, é ɠɛ naati ti mina mului zala Sezaal ma, tɔ vɔlɔ é ɠɛ toɠa ga Kilista, masagi.»<verse eid="LUK 23:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 23:3"/>Pilate gaazaɠani, é ɠɛ ma: «Ɗa ɠa è ga Zuifuiti ta-masagi?» Yesu gooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «Ɗa ɓɔɠɔi è boga.» <verse eid="LUK 23:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 23:4"/>Pilate ɠɛni zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠiiti ma, ta bɛbɛiti: «Gè la peelalazu nɔpɛ kaazu zunui nii ʋa.»<verse eid="LUK 23:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 23:5"/>Kɛlɛ ti maaɓakpani, ti ɠɛ ma: «Toɠa nuɓusɛiti kalasu ga kpakagi. É zoni Galilé yooi zu, é leʋeteʋe Zudé yooi zu ná pɛ, é zeeli ʋɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 23:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Elɔde ɠakala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 23:6"/>Pilate naa mɛnigai ma, é gaazaɠagi woni, ni zunui nii ɠa ga Galilé nu. <verse eid="LUK 23:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 23:7"/>Kwɛɛgai ma bɛ ga naa ɠa Elɔde ná-kuɠui zu, é Yesu leʋeni naa ma. Elɔde ɠɛni ɓalaa Zeluzalɛme naama ziɛgi zu.<verse eid="LUK 23:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 23:8"/>Elɔde Yesu ɠaai ma, gola ɠoozunɛɛni, mazɔlɔɔ kaite wɔin ɠɛni ma ga é Yesu ɠa, tɔɔzei naa maawooi ʋa, é mɛnini, é ɠɛni pɔ ga é naa ná-laavɔɔ vai ta ɠɛɛzu ɠa. <verse eid="LUK 23:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 23:9"/>É lɛbini Yesu ɠaazaɠasu, kɛlɛ naa la ɠɛni gooɠaaʋoteni ga woo ɠila kpalaa. <verse eid="LUK 23:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 23:10"/>Zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠiiti ta tɔ kalamɔinti ti ɠɛni ná nɔ ga ti ɗa Yesu maalɔ ga zɛbɛi. <verse eid="LUK 23:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 23:11"/>Elɔde ta ná-salaʋusuiti ti bɛlɛlalani. Ti ɲɛɛɠulaai ma su, ti seɠe ʋapagi looni kɔba, é teʋe Pilate ma. <verse eid="LUK 23:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 23:12"/>Naama voloi Pilate ta Elɔde ti ɠɛni ga bɔɔlamaiti, tɛigiti ti zilini ga ɓɔɠɔ mɔungi zu.<verse eid="LUK 23:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu zaa vai leve vai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-26">Matiyo 27:15-26</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="MRK 15:6-15">Maleke 15:6-15</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="JHN 18:39-19:16">Zan 18:39—19:16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 23:13"/>Pilate zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠiiti gaalɛɛni ba, ta kundiɠiiti, naa ʋɛɛ nuɓusɛiti ba, <verse eid="LUK 23:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 23:14"/>é ɠɛ ti ma: «Wo ʋaaʋɛ ga zunui nii pɔ̀, wo ɠɛ toɠa nuɓusɛiti kakasu. Tama gè gaazaɠaga wo ɠaazu, gè la sɔ nɔpɛ kaani naama vaiti pɛ su, niiti wo maalɔɔzu su. <verse eid="LUK 23:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 23:15"/>Elɔde ɓalaa ge la sɔ kaani ba, mazɔlɔɔ é teʋegɛ gi ma ʋolu. Gaamazu, zunui nii la faa nɔpɛ kɛɛni, nii nu ɠa paa su. <verse eid="LUK 23:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 23:16"/>Nà kɛɛzu, ti doɠa nɔ ga kpakɔi, naa ʋoluma gè pilɛ.» <verse eid="LUK 23:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 23:17"/>[Fɛti ɠilagilagi pɛ su, kɛni é ɓena kasoɠa nu ɠila pilɛ ti ʋɛ.]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Wooi niiti ti [ ] kpaku felegɔiti zɔɠɔzu, naati ti la sɛʋɛ wɔlɔmai tanigaa zu.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 23:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 23:18"/>Kɛlɛ ti pɛ ti ɠɛni ma, ʋɔɔma: «Zunui nii ʋa, è Ɓalaɓase ʋilɛ gi ʋɛ.» <verse eid="LUK 23:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 23:19"/>Zunui naa ʋilini kasoi ɠa wutugi maaʋele ma, é ʋilini taazuʋɛ, ta nu ʋaa vai.<verse eid="LUK 23:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 23:20"/>Kɛlɛ tɛi wɔin ɠɛni Pilate ma ga é Yesu ʋilɛ, é ɓɔɛni ʋolu bɛbɛi ʋɔ. <verse eid="LUK 23:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 23:21"/>Kɛlɛ ti ɓainni, ti ɠɛ ma: «Kpadɔ! Kpadɔ saa wului ma!»<verse eid="LUK 23:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 23:22"/>Pilate ɠɛni ti ma, ná zaʋasiɛi zu: «Faa ɲɔi ɓɛgele ɠa é kɛai? Gè la sɔ nɔpɛ kaani ba, nii nu ɠa paa su. Nà ʋaazu kɛɛzu mu, ti doɠa ga kpakɔi, naa ʋoluma gè pilɛ.» <verse eid="LUK 23:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 23:23"/>Kɛlɛ ti wola laaɓakpani ma ga kpee wolai, ti ɠɛ ma kɛni é ɓadɔ saa wului ma. Ti-wooi ɠɛni liizu ga ɓikpiga. <verse eid="LUK 23:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 23:24"/>Pilate deveni ga nii ti suvalizu, é naa ɠɛ ti ʋɛ. <verse eid="LUK 23:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 23:25"/>É naama nui ʋilɛni, nii ti maaɠaazaɠaboni, nii é ɠɛni kasoi ɠa wutu fai ta nu ʋaa vai zu. Kɛlɛ é Yesu lɔɔni ti yeezu, ti-yiimai ɠɛ la.<verse eid="LUK 23:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ɓadɔ vai saa wului ma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Matiyo 27:32-44</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Maleke 15:21-32</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Zan 19:17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 23:26"/>Tɛi ti ɠɛni liizu la, ti zunui ta ɠaani, é ɗa zeɠe kpalagaʋɛ, Silɛne nu ɠɛni de, daaseigi ga Simon. Ti soni, ti Yesu zaa wului la kɔma ga é ʋilɛ da naa ʋolu. <verse eid="LUK 23:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 23:27"/>Nuɓusɛi ma ʋɛbɛ wolai ʋilɛni polu, ta anzanuiti, naati ti ɗa yiilaʋɛti doɠa, ti ɗa ɓɔɠɔ maawɔin ná-faa zu. <verse eid="LUK 23:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 23:28"/>Yesu latini ti ma, é ɠɛ ma: «Zeluzalɛme anzanuiti, à mina wɔlɔ bɛ̀, kɛlɛ à wɔlɔ ɓɔɠɔ ʋɛ ta wo-lointi bɛ. <verse eid="LUK 23:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 23:29"/>Tɔɔzei foloi tanigaa ta ʋaazu, toɠa wo ga: ‹Undaanɛ nu ɠa ga doun zɔlɔɔtala anzanuiti, ta niiti ti la ɓɔɠɔ loun zɔlɔɔni, ti la ta laani ɠɔɠɔ ma.› <verse eid="LUK 23:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 23:30"/>Naama ziɛgi zu nuiti ta ɗa ɠɛ gizeiti ma: ‹À loo gi ma,› ti ɗa ɠɛ gize goiti ma: ‹À gi maalɔɔɠu!›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="HOS 10:8">Woz 10:8</ref></char>.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 23:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 23:31"/>Mazɔlɔɔ ni nii ɠa ɠɛɛzu ga gulu wundui, lee ɠa é ʋaazu ɠɛɛzu ga gulu vɔɔi?»<verse eid="LUK 23:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 23:32"/>Naama yeeɠɛɠalai nɔ zu, ti ɠɛni liizu ga faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nu felegɔ, ti ʋaa vai zu ʋɔɔma ta Yesuni. <verse eid="LUK 23:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 23:33"/>Ti zeeliai ma, naama adɛ ná laaseigi ga «Unkala Kae», ti kpadɔni miná saa wului ma. Ti ti ɓadɔni ʋɔɔma saa wuluiti ma ta faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nu felegɔ, gilagi ɠɛni zeezazu ʋelei, zɔi ɠɛ kɔʋɛzu ʋelei. <verse eid="LUK 23:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 23:34"/>Yesu ɠɛni ma: «Kɛ̀ɛ, ti zuvaayɛ, tɔɔzei nii ti kɛɛzu, ti la kwɛɛ.» Salaʋusuiti ti ná-seɠeiti gaaɠwɛɛni ʋa ga kpakutoomai.<verse eid="LUK 23:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 23:35"/>Nuɓusɛi ɠɛni loni, é ɗa wɛlɛ. Kundiɠiiti mu ti ɠɛni ɲɛɛɠulasui ɠɛɛzu, ti ɗa ɠɛ ma: «É zɔiti kizoga, é ɓɔɠɔ ɠizona, ni toɠa ga Kilista, GALA ná-ziimazeɠegi!» <verse eid="LUK 23:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 23:36"/>Salaʋusuiti ɓalaa ti ɠɛni ɲɛɛɠulazu su, ti maaɓuɠani ba ga ti dɔɔ ɓodai ve zea. <verse eid="LUK 23:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 23:37"/>Ti ɗa ɠɛ ma: «Ni ɗa ga Zuifuiti ta-masagi, ɓɔɠɔ ɠizona!»<verse eid="LUK 23:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 23:38"/>Sɛʋɛi ɠɛni ɓalaa un maazuʋɛ ga: «Nii ɠa é ga Zuifuiti ta-masagi».<verse eid="LUK 23:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 23:39"/>Faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nu felegɔi niiti ti ɠɛni saa wului ma, naa ɠilagi ɠɛni poomusu, é ɗa ɠɛ ma: «Ɗa lɛi è ʋa ɠɛ ga Kilista ɓaa? Ɓɔɠɔ ɠizo dɛɛ, ɗa ɓɔɠɔgoi, è gá ɓalaa, gi ɠizo!» <verse eid="LUK 23:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 23:40"/>Kɛlɛ bɔɔlai zelii loni ma, é ɠɛ ma: «È la luazu GALA ba, ɗɛi ɗa ɓalaa è niima zii ʋeelala ɠilagi zu? <verse eid="LUK 23:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 23:41"/>Dɔnɔi zɔlegɛ, tɔɔzei da naa zɔlɔɔsu, nii soloogai da-ɠɛɛwotiiti ma, kɛlɛ tɔun nɔnɔi, é la faa ɲɔu nɔpɛ kɛɛni.» <verse eid="LUK 23:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 23:42"/>Naa ʋoluma é ɠɛni ma: «Yesu, ɠizɛ sù, siɛgi zu è ʋaazu la ɗa-masadai zu.» <verse eid="LUK 23:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 23:43"/>Yesu gooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «Gè bo è ma ga gaamai, ɗa ɠɛ bà za nɔ, GALA ná-taa ʋagɔi zu.»<verse eid="LUK 23:43"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu zaa vai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Matiyo 27:45-56</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Maleke 15:33-41</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Zan 19:28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 23:44"/>Folo gaalɔgai ma ziɛgi zu, kpidii ʋɛɛni zooi zu ná pɛ, eyɛsu lɛlɛi zaʋasiɛi ma kpɔkɔ voloi. <verse eid="LUK 23:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 23:45"/>Foloi dɔɔni ma, GALA sei ʋɛlɛi wu ɠwɛpele seɠezuɠoozagi ʋalini su fele zaamazuʋɛ. <verse eid="LUK 23:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 23:46"/>Yesu kpee wolai looni, é ɠɛ ma: «Ɠɛɛɠɛ, nà zɛ̀nvui ɠalivaazu è ma.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:46 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 31:6">Guy 31:6</ref></char>.</char></note> Naama wooiti boga ʋoluma, zii looni.<verse eid="LUK 23:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 23:47"/>Wɔlɔme zalaʋusu ɠundiɠii fai naati kaai ma, niiti ti ɠɛɛni, é lɛbiyai veeni GALA bɛ, é ɠɛ ma: «Gaamazu, zunui nii ɠɛa ga telebo nu.» <verse eid="LUK 23:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 23:48"/>Bɛbɛi niiti ti ʋaani nu ʋaazuʋɛ miná ɠaazu, ti ɠaleni ma ga gaazuɠilii, ti ɗa yiilaʋɛti doɠa. <verse eid="LUK 23:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 23:49"/>Yesu ɠaazuɠwɛɛgiti pɛ, ta anzanui niiti ti ɠɛni polu, kaite é zo Galilé yooi zu, naati ti loni ɠoozama, ti ɗa naama vaiti ka, niiti ti ɠɛni ɠɛɛzu.<verse eid="LUK 23:49"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu maaɠulu vai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Matiyo 27:57-61</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Maleke 15:42-47</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Zan 19:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 23:50"/>Zunu ɠila ge ɠɛni tukpɔɠaaleʋe nu wolaiti saama, daaseigi ga Zozɛfe, é ɠɛni ga nu ʋagɔ ta telebo nu, <verse eid="LUK 23:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 23:51"/>ná-taazuʋɛ ɠɛni ga Zuifu laai nii daa ga Alimaté, é la ɠɛni yeezeini bɔɔlaiti ta-levei ta ma ɠɛɛwotiiti bu, é ɠɛni GALA ná-masadai maaɓɔunsu kitogi zu. <verse eid="LUK 23:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 23:52"/>É liini, é Yesu ma ʋoomai maavali Pilate ma. <verse eid="LUK 23:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 23:53"/>É kulani saa wului ma, é maavelevele ga geze zeɠei, é da kaba niinɛi ta zu, nii bɔai fasai ʋa, ʋɛ nu nɔpɛ ge la dɛ laani ná. <verse eid="LUK 23:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 23:54"/>Dooɠo foloi ma ɠɛʋele ɓɛtɛ voloi ɠɛni de, dooɠo foloi ɠɛnina tɔɔzeizu.<verse eid="LUK 23:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 23:55"/>Anzanui niiti ti yɛni Yesu ʋolu, kaite é zo Galilé yooi zu, naati ti ʋilɛni Zozɛfe ʋolu, ti kabai ʋɛtɛ, ta ʋelei Yesu ma ʋoomai laai la su. <verse eid="LUK 23:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 23:56"/>Ti ɠaleni ma, ga ti tufa maku nɛɛnɛgi ta gulɔ maku nɛɛnɛgiti kpɛtɛ. Dooɠo foloi ti looɠoni, eɠɛʋelei devei bogai la.<verse eid="LUK 23:56"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="LUK 24"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu wuzeɠe vai, <optbreak/> é ɠula saai ya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-10">Matiyo 28:1-10</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Maleke 16:1-8</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Zan 20:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 24:1"/>Dɔɔɠɔi ma volo mɔungi sobuzobui, ti liini kabalaʋɛ ga tufa maku nɛɛnɛgiti, niiti ti ti ɓɛtɛni. <verse eid="LUK 24:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 24:2"/>Ti kɔtui ɠilikiligai ɠaani, seɠeai kabai la. <verse eid="LUK 24:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 24:3"/>Ti lɔɔni su, kɛlɛ ti la ɠɛni Maliɠii Yesu ma ʋoomai ɠaani su. <verse eid="LUK 24:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 24:4"/>Tɛi ti ɠidaaʋilini ga naama vai, zunu felegɔ ɠulani kɛlɛma ti ʋɛ, ti ɠɔba zeɠeiti ti ɠɛni volozu. <verse eid="LUK 24:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 24:5"/>Dualuagi maaʋele ma, ti unpilɛni zooi ma. Naati ti ɠɛni ti ma: «Leeni ʋe zɔi é vulua, wo naa ɠaiziɛzu gɔvɛiti saama? <verse eid="LUK 24:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 24:6"/>É la mɔ ʋɛ, é wuzeɠea, é ɠula saai ya. À ɠitoo gooi zu, kɛai ma wo ʋa Galilé yooi zu, <verse eid="LUK 24:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 24:7"/>é ɠɛni ɠɛɛzu ma: ‹Kɛni ta Nu ná-Doun Zunui lɔ kotoba nuiti zeezu, é ɓadɔ saa wului ma, foloi zaʋasiɛi é wuzeɠe, é ɠula saai ya.› » <verse eid="LUK 24:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 24:8"/>Ti-ɠi ge looni naazu Yesu wooiti su.<verse eid="LUK 24:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 24:9"/>Ti zeɠeni kabalaʋɛ, ti li, ti naa pɛ bo kaladopo puugɔ maazu ɠilagiti ma (11), ta zɔiti pɛ ma. <verse eid="LUK 24:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 24:10"/>Niiti ti naama vaiti boni keelaiti ma, ti ɠɛni ga: Magedala nui Mali, ta Zane, naa ʋɛɛ Zake dee Mali ʋa, ta anzanu ɠiligi zɔiti ɓalaa ti ɠɛni ti ʋolu. <verse eid="LUK 24:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 24:11"/>Kɛlɛ naama wooiti ti ɠɛni ti ɠaazu eɠɛ kpɔɛ ɲaka, ti la ɠɛni laani anzanui naati gooi la. <verse eid="LUK 24:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 24:12"/>[Kɛlɛ Piyɛlɛ wuzeɠeni, é ɓizɛ, é li kabalaʋɛ. É unmaalaagai ma, é la ɠɛni ani ɠili kaani, kɛni seɠe zakpaiti nɔ. Naa ʋolu, é zeɠeni ná, daavɔai ga naama vai, nii é ɠɛɛni.]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Wooi niiti ti [ ] kpaku felegɔiti zɔɠɔzu, naati ti la sɛʋɛ wɔlɔmai tanigaa zu.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 24:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ɠula vai kɛlɛma <optbreak/> kaladopo felegɔiti bɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:12-13">Maleke 16:12-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 24:13"/>Naama volo ɠilagi nɔ, kaladopo felegɔ ɠɛni liizu taa goi ta zu, ná laa ga Emawuse. Ná maaɠoozani Zeluzalɛme ʋa ga kilo puugɔ maazu felegɔ (12) ɠɛɠala. <verse eid="LUK 24:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 24:14"/>Ti ɠɛni yɛpɛzu ga naama vaiti pɛ, niiti ti leʋegai. <verse eid="LUK 24:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 24:15"/>Ti ɠɛai ma yɛpɛzu, Yesu ɓɔɠɔgoi maaɓuɠani ti ʋa, ti ɗa li ʋɔɔma. <verse eid="LUK 24:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 24:16"/>Kɛlɛ ti ɠaazumaaɓidini ga ti mina kwɛɛ.<verse eid="LUK 24:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 24:17"/>Yesu ɠɛni ti ma: «Wa-yɛpɛ wooiti ta ga ɓɛgele, wo ti wosu, wo ɗa ziɛ?» Ti loni kpɛ, ti ɠaazuɠiliai. <verse eid="LUK 24:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 24:18"/>Ti ɠila ge ɠɛni ná, nii daa ɠɛni ga Kelewopase, naa gooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «Ɗa ɠila nɔ ɠa è ɲii wosu Zeluzalɛme, è la kwɛɛ, nii kɛai niima voloiti?» <verse eid="LUK 24:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 24:19"/>Yesu ɠɛ ma: «Ɓɛgele ɠa ga naa mu?» Ti gooɠaaʋoteni, ti ɠɛ ma: «Nii kɛai é ʋilɛ Nazalɛte nui Yesu ʋa, nii é ɠɛa ga GALA goo wo nu, zɛbɛi ba kɛɛwotiiti ta kpɔɛzuɠulaiti su, GALA ta nuɓusɛiti pɛ gaazu. <verse eid="LUK 24:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 24:20"/>Gá-zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠiiti ta gá-ɠundiɠiiti ti teʋegɛ ga ti peelala ga ti paa, ti kpadɔ saa wului ma. <verse eid="LUK 24:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 24:21"/>Tɔ ɠa gi-ɠi ge ɠɛa ba ga toɠa Izilayɛle unmɔɔ. Kɛlɛ wɛlɛ niima vaiti kɛɛʋɛ ma voloi zaʋasiɛ ɠa ga za. <verse eid="LUK 24:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 24:22"/>Gaama ʋe ga, anzanui tanigaa niiti ti gi zaama, ti gi laavɔɔʋɛ. Ti liiʋɛ kabalaʋɛ gosui, <verse eid="LUK 24:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 24:23"/>kɛlɛ ti la ma ʋoomai ɠaani. Ti ɠalegɛ ma, ti ɠɛ geezuɠeelaiti kulaʋɛ ti ʋɛ kɛlɛma, naati ti ɠɛ ti ma: ‹Toɠa vulua.› <verse eid="LUK 24:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 24:24"/>Gi zaama, nui tanigaa liiʋɛ kabalaʋɛ, ti faiti ka nɔ, ʋelei anzanuiti ti bogai la, kɛlɛ ti la tɔ ɓɔɠɔi ɠaani.»<verse eid="LUK 24:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 24:25"/>Názu ɠa Yesu ɠɛni la ti ma: «Ee, wa vaa ɠaaɠaazu ɓaaʋɛ! Wo nɛkɛgɛ ti laazu naa la, nii GALA goo wo nuiti ti bogai! <verse eid="LUK 24:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 24:26"/>Kilista maa la ɠɛni nɛɛni, é ʋa ɓɔlɔ ɠana, aisa é ʋa lɛ ná-lɛbiyai zu ɓaa?» <verse eid="LUK 24:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 24:27"/>Naa ʋoluma, nii kpein GALA Sɛʋɛi bogai, é ʋilɛ tɔ ɓɔɠɔi ʋa, é tɔɔzeini ga naa yɔɠɔzulɛa ga tiye, é tɔɔzei Moize ná-sɛʋɛiti ma, é li GALA goo wo nui zɔiti ta-zɛʋɛiti pɔ.<verse eid="LUK 24:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 24:28"/>Ti zeeliai ma taa loaʋɛ, ʋɛ ti ɠɛni liizu ná, Yesu kulani eɠɛ a ɠɛ liizu poun. <verse eid="LUK 24:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 24:29"/>Kɛlɛ ti vɔɔnɛni ba, ti ɠɛ ma: «Yɛ gi ɠoba, foloi ɠana li, fitili ɠana pɛɛ.» É lɛɛni pɛlɛi wu naazu ga é yɛ ti ɠoba. <verse eid="LUK 24:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 24:30"/>Ti ɠɛai ma daamii wosu taɓalii ɠa, é ɓului zeɠeni, naa ʋoluma kpegai ma ga mama fee ƓALA falii wo, é galeɠaleni, é fe ti ya. <verse eid="LUK 24:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 24:31"/>Názu ɠa ti-ɠaazuʋɛti ti zeɠeni la ma, ti kwɛɛ, kɛlɛ é ɲɛɛlɛni ti ɠaazu. <verse eid="LUK 24:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 24:32"/>Ti ɠɛni ɓɔɠɔ ma: «Koozunɛɛi ɠɛni de ʋɛ, siɛgi zu é ɠɛa GALA sɛʋɛiti zɔɠɔzulɛɛzu la ga deye pelei zu.»<verse eid="LUK 24:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 24:33"/>Ti wuzeɠeni naama yeeɠɛɠalai nɔ, ti ɠale ma Zeluzalɛme, ti kaladopo puugɔ maazu ɠilagiti (11) ka, ta niiti ti ɠɛni ti ʋa. <verse eid="LUK 24:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 24:34"/>Naati ti ɠɛ ti felegɔ ma: «Maliɠii wuzeɠea, é ɠula saai ya ga ɠite, kulaʋɛ kɛlɛma Simon ʋɛ.» <verse eid="LUK 24:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 24:35"/>Tiya ɓalaa ti naa zuɠulani, nii é ɠɛɛni pelei zu, ta ʋelei ti kwɛɛni da, siɛgi zu é ɓului ɠaleɠaleni la.<verse eid="LUK 24:35"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ɓɔɠɔ lɛɛ vai ga <optbreak/> kaladopo puugɔ maazu ɠilagiti (11)</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Matiyo 28:16-20</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Maleke 16:14-18</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Zan 20:19-23</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Kɛɛwotiiti 1:6-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 24:36"/>Ti yɛni nɔ naama ɓɔɛiti bosu dɛ, eyɛsu Yesu ɓɔɠɔgoi lo ti zaama, é ɠɛ ti ma: «Ziilɛigi ɠɛ wo ʋɛ.» <verse eid="LUK 24:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 24:37"/>Dualua golai leʋeni ti zu, ti ɠɛni kaazu ga ti zɛnvui ta ɠa. <verse eid="LUK 24:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 24:38"/>Kɛlɛ Yesu ɠɛni ti ma: «Lee ʋe wo yiiɓɔlɔzu? Lee vaa zu inɛinɛgi wo ɠisu? <verse eid="LUK 24:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 24:39"/>À wɛlɛ lɛɛ zèei ta kɔ̀ɠɔiti ba, nà ɓɔɠɔɓɔɠɔgi ʋe. À vɔɔɠu bà, wa kwɛɛ, tɔɔzei kɔlɔ ge la zɛnvui ma, kae la su ga kɛ̀ʋelei.»<verse eid="LUK 24:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 24:40"/>É naama wooiti bogai ma, é zeeiti ta kɔɠɔiti dɛɛni ga tiye. <verse eid="LUK 24:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 24:41"/>Tɛi ta ɠoozunɛɛi zu, ti la ɠɛni dɛ laani da, ta ti laavɔai, é ɠɛni ti ma: «Daamiani ka wo ya ʋɛ?» <verse eid="LUK 24:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 24:42"/>Ti kale mɔgai ma ɓuɠa ɠila feeni zea. <verse eid="LUK 24:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 24:43"/>Ti ɠaazuyɛni ba, é seɠe, é mi.<verse eid="LUK 24:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 24:44"/>Naa ʋoluma, é ɠɛni ti ma: «Naama vaiti ka gè ɠɛni ti wosu wo ma, ade ɠɛai ma ʋa, ga fai kpein é zɛʋɛni nà-faa zu Moize ná-tɔgi zu, ta GALA goo wo nuiti ta-zɛʋɛiti su, ta GALA Sɛʋɛi ma wuyeiti su, ti laa ɠa zeeli.» <verse eid="LUK 24:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 24:45"/>É ti-ɠigiti daalaoni názuʋɛ, nii a kɛ ti GALA sɛʋɛiti gaaɠa. <verse eid="LUK 24:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 24:46"/>É ɠɛni ti ma: «Naa ɠa é zɛʋɛni GALA Sɛʋɛi zu ga: Kilista a la ɓɔlɔ, foloi zaʋasiɛi é wuzeɠe, é ɠula saai ya. <verse eid="LUK 24:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 24:47"/>Daaseigi zu, nu ziɛ ʋelei maavalibo fai ta kotoi ma zuvaayɛgi ma wooi laa ɠa zeeli ziiti pɛ ma, é tɔɔzei Zeluzalɛme ma. <verse eid="LUK 24:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 24:48"/>Wa ga naama vaiti ma zeelei. <verse eid="LUK 24:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 24:49"/>Nà ʋaazu naa leʋesu wo ma, nii Kɛ̀ɛ minazeɠeai la. Kɛlɛ kɛni dɛ wo yɛ Zeluzalɛme taazuʋɛ, eyɛsu wo zɛbɛi zɔlɔɔ, é zeɠe geezuʋɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 24:49"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu lɛɛ vai geeɠɔlɔgi zu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:19-20">Maleke 16:19-20</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Kɛɛwotiiti 1:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 24:50"/>É loni ti luɠɔ, eyɛsu ti maaɓuɠa Ɓetani ʋa, naa ʋoluma é yeeiti buzeɠeni, é tuya loo ti ʋɛ. <verse eid="LUK 24:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 24:51"/>Kɛai ma tuyai loozu ti ʋɛ, é zeɠeni ti ʋa, é lɛ geeɠɔlɔgi zu. <verse eid="LUK 24:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 24:52"/>Tiya mu, ti ɓegai ma ga dɛbi, ti ɠaleni ma Zeluzalɛme ga koozunɛ wolai, <verse eid="LUK 24:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 24:53"/>siɛnɔpɛ su ti ɠɛni nɔ ɠɔ GALA sei ʋɛlɛi wu, ti ɗa GALA mama.<verse eid="LUK 24:53"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 24"/>
</usx>
